# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:14
translate chinese castlem_19df2c7f:

    # aur "Welcome back~"
    aur "欢迎回来~"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:20
translate chinese auroram_342132b2:

    # "I feel exhausted!"
    "我累坏了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:25
translate chinese auroram_1b0eeb81:

    # aur "Oh, by the way..."
    aur "对了，顺便一提..."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:26
translate chinese auroram_6511b0fe:

    # aug "I'm visiting today~"
    aug "我今天来看你啦~"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:40
translate chinese auroram_14d8d22b:

    # "[sel] is busy right now, maybe it'd be best if I visited [aur] today."
    "[sel]现在很忙，今天还是别去找她比较好。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:42
translate chinese auroram_cff5591a:

    # "[sel] is still busy. She might be ready in a day or two."
    "[sel] 还在忙。她可能一两天后才能闲下来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:50
translate chinese auroram_59511b40:

    # sel "Good evening."
    sel "晚上好。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:58
translate chinese selm_342132b2:

    # "I feel exhausted!"
    "我累坏了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:143
translate chinese selm_0ca947cb:

    # "(While you have unlocked it, the Castle route is still in development. It should be out in the next update.)"
    "（虽然您已解锁该路线，但城堡路线仍在开发中。预计将在下次更新中推出。）"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:145
translate chinese selm_39dfaf37:

    # "Guards at the city gate stop me, refusing me entry without a pass."
    "城门卫兵拦住我，拒绝放行，声称没有通行证不得入内。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:147
translate chinese selm_fbc9b218:

    # "Even though I have a pass, it's too early for me to visit the Queen yet. I need to make sure everyone else is ready."
    "虽然我持有通行证，但现在还不是拜访她的时候。我需要确保其他马都准备好了才行。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:155
translate chinese castle1rewrite_7b3696ac:

    # "The floor shudders beneath us as I watch [mox] concentrate, her brows furrowed as she mutters under her breath."
    "公寓的地板震颤着。我坐在沙发上，看着mox]，她紧皱双眉，唇间吐着低语。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:156
translate chinese castle1rewrite_ca6ced7a:

    # "She’s been practicing teleportation and invisibility magic all morning, and even the constant tremors from the earthquakes haven’t broken her concentration."
    "她整个上午都在练习瞬移和隐形魔法，就连地震引发的持续震颤也没能打断她的专注。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:158
translate chinese castle1rewrite_17248bf4:

    # mox "If this works, [mc]… do you realize what I could do on stage?"
    mox "如果我能练会这招的话，[mc]……你知道我能在舞台上比表演什么大魔术吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:160
translate chinese castle1rewrite_ebec40d4:

    # mox "Imagine the looks on people’s faces when I disappear into thin air and reappear halfway across the room! Not a mere trick, not an illusion – a real spell!"
    mox "想象一下观众们看到我凭空消失后又在舞台的另一端重现时的表情吧！这可不是简单的障眼法，更非幻觉——而是真正的魔法！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:161
translate chinese castle1rewrite_7c544c38:

    # "She conjures a small shimmer of light. She attempts to transfer it seamlessly from one hand to another, causing it to crackle away. Despite the failure, she's not discouraged, but more excited than ever."
    "她召唤出一缕微光，试图将这缕光无缝地从一只手转移到另一只手上，结果光芒噼啪作响地消散了。虽然失败了，但她并未气馁，反而比以往任何时候都更加兴奋。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:162
translate chinese castle1rewrite_fbc32add:

    # mc "No one else can do magic like that. You could go down as a legend."
    mc "我没听过有谁能施展这样的魔法，你将成为第一个使用的它的传奇。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:163
translate chinese castle1rewrite_ae6af20c:

    # mc "Watching you practice like this makes me jealous. Just like the last world, I'm powerless here too."
    mc "就这样看着你练习让我的心里有点小烦闷。就像上个世界一样，我在此处依然发挥不了什么作用。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:177
translate chinese castle1rewrite_8f7089eb:

    # "Another tremor shakes the room, and I reach out, steadying [mox] as she almost slips."
    "房间突然摇晃了起来，我站起身，抬手接住了差点摔倒的[mox]。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:180
translate chinese castle1rewrite_0eb09eb0:

    # mox "Oft! You're not powerless at all. You're always there to catch me when I fall."
    mox "哎呀！想什么呢，你也不是什么都没干，好吧。每当我快要摔倒时，你总会在身旁接住我。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:181
translate chinese castle1rewrite_9bf734f6:

    # mc "Still... I wish I could do more."
    mc "然而……我仍希望我能做得更多。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:183
translate chinese castle1rewrite_cf4909a9:

    # mox "With you here, I’m sure everything will turn out fine."
    mox "有你在我的身边，我相信一切都会好起来的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:184
translate chinese castle1rewrite_9dac94ae:

    # mc "Thanks for believing in me."
    mc "谢谢你能相信我。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:186
translate chinese castle1rewrite_531ccb42:

    # mox "From the very start until the very end~"
    mox "我自始至终都相信着你~"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:189
translate chinese castle1rewrite_b3839817:

    # "There’s a buzz at the door – the others have arrived at the ground floor. Together, we take the elevator down and greet them."
    "门铃响起——看来姑娘们已经到楼下了。我俩一同乘电梯下楼迎接他们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:192
translate chinese castle1rewrite_55c0c9f7:

    # "[lil], [hon], [bla], [rik], [but], and [rub]. Each have an expression of varying confidence."
    "[lil]、[hon]、[bla]、[rik]、[but] 和 [rub]。每匹雌驹的脸上都挂着不同程度的自信。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:195
translate chinese castle1rewrite_9a15320a:

    # lil "The tremors have almost been constant today. Last thing I needed for my nerves."
    lil "今天的地震几乎就没停过。我已经很紧张了，这简直就是雪上加霜。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:198
translate chinese castle1rewrite_bc2b8748:

    # mox "Wow, it’s so great to finally meet you all!"
    mox "哇，终于见到大家了，太棒了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:201
translate chinese castle1rewrite_ee618c97:

    # rub "The pleasure is mine, [mox]. I’m a big fan! You should come and perform at my club sometime."
    rub "荣幸之至，[mox]。我是你的忠实粉丝！有机会请来我的夜店表演吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:202
translate chinese castle1rewrite_d6cfa336:

    # "There’s some light greetings, but [rik] justifiably cuts it short."
    "大家都在互相问候着彼此，但有点过于拖沓了。[rik]理所当然地打断了她们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:205
translate chinese castle1rewrite_d25006ce:

    # rik "Come on, guys! Wouldn't want to keep Queenie waiting. Let's walk and talk."
    rik "可以啦，大家！别让女王等太久了。咱们边走边聊吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:208
translate chinese castle1rewrite_179fd497:

    # bla "Right. We’re marching straight for the castle!"
    bla "好。我们出发，去城堡！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:211
translate chinese castle1rewrite_7af9f433:

    # hon "Lead the way, stud! Because I have no idea how to get through the city!"
    hon "带路吧，帅哥！我不熟这地，完全不知道该怎么去城堡！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:214
translate chinese castle1rewrite_0c427973:

    # "All eight of us head to the city. The day feels charged with energy; the sun hidden by low, heavy clouds. The air thick like there’s an incoming storm."
    "我们齐赴城市。今天的天空乌云重重，厚重的云层挡住了太阳光。空气凝重，仿佛有什么大事要发生。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:216
translate chinese castle1rewrite_388c7466:

    # "We make our way through the city towards the castle, thanks to [lil], we easily get past the guards."
    "我们穿过城市朝城堡前进，有[lil]在，我们轻松地穿过了皇家守卫的岗哨。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:218
translate chinese castle1rewrite_8796b70c:

    # "In no time at all, we're wandering through the halls of the castle. It’s identical to how I remember it, if not darker and gloomier."
    "转眼间，我们已穿行在城堡的走廊里。这里与我记忆中的模样毫无二致，只是显得更加幽暗阴沉。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:219
translate chinese castle1rewrite_2a9afee6:

    # "We approach the Queen’s throne room as the last echoes of our footsteps fade, leaving only a tense silence."
    "当我们走近了女王的宝座厅时，脚步声逐渐消逝，只剩下紧张的寂静时。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:221
translate chinese castle1rewrite_a06c3156:

    # "The grand doors swing open, and there she sits — her eyes sharp and unyielding. Queen [aur] has always been a force, but I can see a deeper rigidity in this version, a hardness that chills the room."
    "宏伟的门扉缓缓开启，她端坐其间——目光锐利而坚毅。女王[aur]向来气势非凡，但此刻我却从她身上读出更深沉的刚硬，一种令整个房间都为之寒颤的冷峻。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:223
translate chinese castle1rewrite_91d5469e:

    # lil "Good morning, [aur]! I-"
    lil "早上好，[aur]！我-"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:224
translate chinese castle1rewrite_98be692a:

    # aur "Silence, [lil]."
    aur "安静，[lil]。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:226
translate chinese castle1rewrite_c4a3343e:

    # lil "Eh, uh… Of course."
    lil "呃，嗯……是的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:228
translate chinese castle1rewrite_0b6717a7:

    # "The Queen stands and takes a few steps forward."
    "女王站起身，向前走了几步。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:231
translate chinese castle1rewrite_5252c0fe:

    # aur "[mc], is it? And this… this merry band you’ve gathered—the so-called 'Virtues'. Do you really think I am unaware of what you’ve been doing?"
    aur "[mc]，是吗？还有这……这群你召集的同伴——所谓的“谐律之元”。你当真认为我不知晓你们所作所为？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:232
translate chinese castle1rewrite_74bd3eeb:

    # mc "Your Majesty, I’ve gathered them to help combat the darkness that’s crept into the land. They’re ready to protect and serve, to bring strength and unity."
    mc "陛下，我已召集她们共同对抗悄然侵袭这片土地的黑暗。她们已整装待发，誓将守护您的安危，为这片土地注入力量与团结。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:234
translate chinese castle1rewrite_379d4139:

    # aur "Protect? Unity?"
    aur "守护？团结？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:235
translate chinese castle1rewrite_6b3d9767:

    # aur "Who are you to decide that these… these girls could wield such power? Do you think I don’t know the extent of your meddling, [mc]? That I don’t see your hand in all of this?"
    aur "你凭什么断定这些……这些女孩们拥有如此强大的力量？你以为我不知道你插手的程度吗，[mc]？以为我看不出这一切背后都有你的手笔？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:236
translate chinese castle1rewrite_91cd84c0:

    # "The air around us feels stifling, but none of us dares to move — there are guards lining the room, watching every gesture."
    "气氛渐渐变得凝固起来，谁都不敢动弹——房间里站满了守卫，盯着我们每个细微的动作。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:237
translate chinese castle1rewrite_6118ab84:

    # hon "{i}Muttering{/i} I’ve never seen someone this high and mighty be so bitter about others helping out…"
    hon "{i}嘟囔着{/i} 这种马我还是第一次见，有马来帮忙还不乐意……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:238
translate chinese castle1rewrite_91d7887e:

    # aur "I have been in control for centuries, and I will not see my reign questioned by those who have no idea what it takes to rule. Especially not by one puppeted by the very enemy that threatens us."
    aur "我已掌控大局数百年，绝不容许那些不懂治国之道之辈质疑我的统治。更何况是受制于威胁我们的存在操纵的傀儡。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:239
translate chinese castle1rewrite_122f358e:

    # mc "What did you say?"
    mc "你说什么？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:240
translate chinese castle1rewrite_64aa7b96:

    # aur "[mc], you dare to interfere, to bring these commoners together, with forbidden, dangerous knowledge."
    aur "[mc]，你竟敢用那些禁忌而危险的知识，介入我的统治，将这些平民聚集在一起。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:241
translate chinese castle1rewrite_1600ae39:

    # "She motions to her guards."
    "她向她的卫兵示意。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:242
translate chinese castle1rewrite_9f1dc5ce:

    # aur "Seize him."
    aur "抓住他。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:244
translate chinese castle1rewrite_fef4ed27:

    # "I barely have a chance to register the order before two guards step forward, taking hold of my arms with iron grips. The girls surge forward, but the guards around them raise their spears, blocking the way."
    "我还没反应过来，两名卫兵便上前用铁钳般的力道攥住我的双臂。姑娘们猛地冲上前，但周围的卫兵高举长矛挡住了她们的去路。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:245
translate chinese castle1rewrite_2e22c8b1:

    # "The Queen’s gaze hardens further, and I can see the thin, dangerous line of her displeasure."
    "女王的目光愈发冷峻，我能看见她眼中那道纤细而危险的不悦之色。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:246
translate chinese castle1rewrite_7917ec5f:

    # mc "But… Wait!"
    mc "不是....等等！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:249
translate chinese castle1rewrite_45665927:

    # mox "This is a mistake, Your Majesty. [mc] hasn’t done anything wrong. We’re here to help—"
    mox "陛下，这是个误会。[mc]没有做错任何事。我们是来帮忙的—"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:251
translate chinese castle1rewrite_abd8b37c:

    # aur "Help? Do you think I don’t know where this leads? Petty gatherings of ‘virtues’ and ‘heroes,’ people who think they can handle powers they don’t understand. And you—"
    aur "帮忙？你以为我不知道你们会让事情通向何方？一些自诩为“谐律之元”与“英雄”的卑劣团伙，一群自以为能驾驭自己根本不懂的力量的马。而你—"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:252
translate chinese castle1rewrite_98ec8b52:

    # "She looks directly at me."
    "她直视着我。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:254
translate chinese castle1rewrite_1089a2b7:

    # aur "I will deal with you in a manner fitting of your insolence."
    aur "你将为你狂妄的行径，付出代价。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:256
translate chinese castle1rewrite_b201101e:

    # "The guards drag me from the room, and as I glance back, I catch one last look at the girls. Their faces are a mix of anger and frustration, restrained by the line of guards. I nod to them, hoping they’ll understand — I’ll be okay."
    "卫兵们将我拖出房间，我回头看了女孩们最后一眼。她们的脸上交织着愤怒与沮丧，被卫兵的列阵围着。我向她们点头示意，希望她们明白——我会没事的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:261
translate chinese castle1rewrite_766de824:

    # "Hours pass as I sit alone in an empty stone room, the weight of my failure setting in."
    "时间慢慢的流逝，我独自坐在空荡的石室里，失败的沉重感压迫着我。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:262
translate chinese castle1rewrite_20b944ae:

    # "We came for unity, for strength, and instead, we’ve been met with suspicion and hostility. I can only hope the Queen’s reaction hasn’t dissuaded the others."
    "我们本为团结而来，为力量而来，却遭遇了猜疑与敌意。希望女王的反应并未动摇她们的决心吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:264
translate chinese castle1rewrite_56d1d42e:

    # "At last, the door opens, and two guards enter, ordering for me to stand and follow. Best I don't try anything risky right now."
    "终于，门开了，两名卫兵走进来，命令我站起来跟他们走。还是不要逞强吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:268
translate chinese castle1rewrite_eb2661d3:

    # "I follow until we arrive at a larger chamber, packed with people. It’s a court room!"
    "卫兵将我带到一个挤满了各色物种的大厅里。这里是法庭！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:269
translate chinese castle1rewrite_3833913f:

    # "Among the crowd, I spot familiar faces. [lil], and the others are all watching, their eyes locked on me. I'm relived that they're not imprisoned; that at least shows that the Queen isn't a complete tyrant. She's capable of mercy."
    "我四周望去，瞥见了几张熟悉的面孔。[lil]和其他居民都正注视着我，目光如炬。得知她们并未被囚禁，我如释重负——至少说明女王并非彻头彻尾的暴君，她尚存仁慈之心。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:270
translate chinese castle1rewrite_519fcb7b:

    # "They look tense but determined, each of them carrying the conviction to see this through no matter the odds. I stand straighter, feeling their strength bolster my own. This might be my trial, but I’m not alone."
    "她们神情紧绷但意志坚定，每匹马都怀抱着无论胜算多寡都要坚持到底的信念。我挺直了腰板，感受到她们的力量正支撑着我。这或许是我的考验，但我并不孤单。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:273
translate chinese castle1rewrite_0d99dcfc:

    # "The Queen sits at the far end of the room, flanked by her advisors, her expression unreadable. She raises a hand, silencing the murmurs of the crowd, and her voice rings out, cold and commanding."
    "女王端坐于厅堂的尽头，两侧环绕着她的顾问们，面容难以捉摸。她举起一只手，交谈声戛然而止，她的声音清冷而威严地回荡开来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:274
translate chinese castle1rewrite_99e3270e:

    # aur "[mc], you are brought here to answer for your reckless interference in matters beyond your understanding. You have introduced dangerous ideals, inspired a baseless insurrection, and sought to instill defiance within the ranks of my people."
    aur "[mc]，你被带到此地，是因为你鲁莽干涉了超出你理解范围之事而承担责任。你引入了危险的理念，煽动了毫无根据的叛乱，并企图在我的子民中播下反叛的种子。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:275
translate chinese castle1rewrite_a9010399:

    # "What can I even say here? The wrong thing may just anger her even more."
    "我还能说什么呢？说错话只会让她更生气。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:279
translate chinese castle1rewrite_2f7ee354:

    # mc "I understand your concerns, Your Majesty. But I stand by the idea that we can achieve more together."
    mc "陛下，我理解您的顾虑。但我坚持我的看法，团结才是力量。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:281
translate chinese castle1rewrite_e79acb7e:

    # "The Queen’s gaze darkens, tension hanging heavily in the room."
    "女王的目光骤然阴沉，房间里弥漫着凝重的紧张气氛。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:282
translate chinese castle1rewrite_135da328:

    # aur "You're nothing but an interloper. If the solution were so easy, I'd have done it centuries ago."
    aur "你不过是个不速之客罢了。若解决之道如此简单，我早就在几个世纪前就解决了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:284
translate chinese castle1rewrite_0820fd8b:

    # mc "We don’t want to undermine your rule, only to grant you more power to combat the darkness."
    mc "我们无意动摇您的统治，只是想带给您更多力量来对抗黑暗。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:286
translate chinese castle1rewrite_66fd1c91:

    # "The Queen remains silent for a moment, letting the tension hang heavily in the room."
    "女王沉默片刻，房间里的紧张气氛渐渐变得凝重。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:287
translate chinese castle1rewrite_9ba83e2f:

    # aur "Surely you jest. Your actions would only serve to empower the darkness."
    aur "开什么玩笑。你的所作所为只会助长黑暗的力量。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:290
translate chinese castle1rewrite_15bb2c90:

    # mc "I'm following the will of your sister. I strongly believe this is part of her plan to vanquish the darkness once and for all."
    mc "这是您妹妹的意愿。我坚信这是她计划的一部分，旨在彻底消灭黑暗。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:292
translate chinese castle1rewrite_9505ea6e:

    # "The Queen’s gaze softens almost imperceptibly. She remains silent for a few moments before the fire returns."
    "女王的目光在一瞬间软了下来，难以察觉。她沉默片刻，随后那股锐利又重新燃起。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:294
translate chinese castle1rewrite_ed9903e4:

    # aur "He speaks utter nonsense! The kingdom knows well that I don't have a sister."
    aur "胡说八道！王国里的子民们都知道我根本没有妹妹。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:297
translate chinese castle1rewrite_ba7db686:

    # mc "Something's not right here! You're trying to hide the truth. I know that you're well aware of the power the virtues can hold, so why do you refuse a perfectly good opportunity?"
    mc "这不可能！您正在试图掩盖真相。我你深知谐律之元们所蕴含的力量，为何要拒绝这样一个能使用它的绝佳机会？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:299
translate chinese castle1rewrite_df7ae08b:

    # "[aur]'s fingers grasp and dig into the arms of her chair. Am I onto something?"
    "[aur]的指尖紧抓着带着软垫的扶手，深深地抠了进去。我是不是说中了什么？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:301
translate chinese castle1rewrite_f67775a2:

    # mc "My point is, my intentions are pure. I want to help, and if I can't, then I'm harmless for trying."
    mc "重点是，我的初衷是纯粹的。我想帮忙，即便力所不及，但尝试本身也无伤大雅。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:303
translate chinese castle1rewrite_7f81c01e:

    # aur "'Harmless', he says, while spreading dangerous rhetoric that you learned from the harbinger of darkness."
    aur "“无伤大雅”，你如此宣称，却散播着你从黑暗的先兆那学来的危险理论。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:305
translate chinese castle1rewrite_67e0f032:

    # "The 'harbinger of darkness'? ...[sel]?"
    "‘黑暗的先兆’？……[sel]？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:308
translate chinese castle1rewrite_77e4ded8:

    # lil "He’s right. We’ve all lost something to the darkness that’s spreading… and we can’t just watch it take everything. Not when there’s a chance we can stop it."
    lil "他说得对。我们都曾被蔓延的黑暗夺走过某些东西……但我们不能眼睁睁看着它吞噬一切。我们还有机会阻止它。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:309
translate chinese castle1rewrite_a971e747:

    # rik "Besides, it’s not like you’re winning the fight right now. You’re not in a position to refuse help."
    rik "再说，你现在又不是占优势。你根本没资格拒绝帮助。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:310
translate chinese castle1rewrite_88b189db:

    # "A ripple of shock goes through the crowd, but [rik]’s expression is defiant. She knows how much power she holds in public court as a famous athlete, and I watch as the Queen shifts slightly in her seat, a moment of discomfort slipping through."
    "观众席中泛起一阵震惊的涟漪，但[rik]依然保持着她充满挑衅的表情。她深知自己作为著名运动员在公开法庭上的发言拥有多大的影响力，我注意到女王在座位上微微挪动，一丝不适从她脸上掠过。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:312
translate chinese castle1rewrite_b9ef9ae2:

    # aur "Enough. This is not a debate. [mc] will answer for his actions, and the rest of you… will stay in your place."
    aur "够了。这不是辩论。[mc]将为他的行为负责，至于你们……就待在观众席上吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:313
translate chinese castle1rewrite_b2fc092d:

    # "The courtroom fills with an uneasy quiet as I stand in the center, watching as the Queen’s advisors gather around."
    "法庭里弥漫着令人不安的寂静，我伫立中央，看着女王的顾问们纷纷向她围了过去。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:314
translate chinese castle1rewrite_0a8c5a99:

    # "The Queen sits with an air of detachment, her fingers tapping rhythmically on the arm of her throne. She regards me as one might a curious specimen, perhaps waiting to see if I deserve to live or die."
    "女王端坐着，神情超然，手指有节奏地轻敲着王座扶手。她审视我的目光如同打量一件奇特的标本，或许她正思考着我的生死。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:316
translate chinese castle1rewrite_3f8abb2c:

    # aur "The man in front of you has been accused of being an agent of the darkness."
    aur "你们眼前这个人被指控为黑暗的爪牙。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:317
translate chinese castle1rewrite_6d6ac92f:

    # aur "Since you insist on introducing dangerous powers. I believe we should have a closer look at your character. Shall we examine your… true intentions?"
    aur "既然你执意要引入危险的力量，我认为我们应该更深入地审视你的本性。不如来看看你的……真实意图？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:318
translate chinese castle1rewrite_b9bb624c:

    # "She gestures to her advisors, and from the back of the room, a few familiar figures shuffle forward."
    "她向顾问们示意，几位熟悉的身影便从房间后方缓缓走上前。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:319
translate chinese castle1rewrite_57da4ec3:

    # "The first figure to take the stand is a man who looks weary and beaten by the world. I recognize this stallion. It was a beggar I saw during my first day here."
    "第一个走上证人席的，是个面容憔悴、饱经风霜的雄马。我认识他——他就是我初来此地那天遇见的那个乞丐。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:320
translate chinese castle1rewrite_d604e989:

    # aur "Tell us, citizen, did [mc] offer you charity when you were down on your luck? Speak clearly."
    aur "请告诉我，公民，当你时运不济时，[mc]可曾施予你善意？请说清楚。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:325
translate chinese castle1rewrite_a3ad18de:

    # misc "Yes… He did. Not just a coin or two, but a large sum that kept me fed for a whole week. He could have walked on by like so many others, but… he stopped and helped."
    misc "是的……他确实这么做了。不仅是一两枚硬币，而是足以让我吃上一整周的钱。他本可以像许多马那样径直走过，但……他停下了脚步，伸出了援手。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:327
translate chinese castle1rewrite_81e114f3:

    # "The courtroom murmurs as the Queen’s gaze flickers. For a brief moment, something akin to surprise crosses her face, though it’s gone as quickly as it appeared."
    "法庭里传来低语声，女王的眼神闪烁不定。刹那间，她脸上掠过一丝类似惊讶的神色，但转瞬即逝。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:330
translate chinese castle1rewrite_e86b64b1:

    # misc "Yes… He did. Just a coin or two. He could have walked on by like so many others, but… he stopped and helped."
    misc "是的……他确实做了。给了我一两枚硬币。他本可以像许多马那样径直走过，但……他停下了脚步，伸出了援手。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:332
translate chinese castle1rewrite_ae269e8f:

    # "The courtroom murmurs as the Queen’s gaze flickers."
    "法庭里传来低语声，女王的眼神闪烁不定。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:334
translate chinese castle1rewrite_2c7619a6:

    # misc "I asked [mc] for help when I had nothing. But he just ignored me. Didn’t even spare a coin."
    misc "我一无所有时向[mc]求助，但他置之不理，连一枚硬币都吝于施舍。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:336
translate chinese castle1rewrite_2331ce8c:

    # "The Queen's lips curl in faint satisfaction as the beggar steps back, eyes shifting uncomfortably."
    "当乞丐退下时，女王的嘴角微微上扬，露出淡淡的得意，乞丐的眼睛不安地四处张望。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:337
translate chinese castle1rewrite_da99b39b:

    # aur "Very well. We will remember that."
    aur "很好。我们会记住的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:340
translate chinese castle1rewrite_ee61eda3:

    # "Next, [ros], the dog girl, steps up, a humble smile on her face despite the solemnity of the moment. She gives a respectful bow to the Queen before speaking."
    "下一个是犬娘[ros]，尽管此刻气氛庄重，她脸上仍带着谦逊的微笑。她走上前来，向女王恭敬地行了一礼，才开口说话。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:341
translate chinese castle1rewrite_55a093fe:

    # ros "Your Majesty, I was traveling on the road when my wagon’s wheel broke, and it looked like I’d be stuck there all day!"
    ros "陛下，我的篷车在行驶途中，车轮突然脱落了，眼看就要困在那一整天！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:345
translate chinese castle1rewrite_5c62af01:

    # ros "[mc] didn’t have to stop, but he did. He fixed it himself, helped me get back on the road. I’m no one important, but he treated me like I mattered."
    ros "[mc]本不必停下，但他还是这么做了。他亲手修好了车，让我能重新上路。我和他并不相识，但他还是伸出了援手。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:347
translate chinese castle1rewrite_b839a0be:

    # "The Queen’s expression tightens. I can tell she wasn’t expecting this. Her advisors exchange glances, clearly taking note of the testimony."
    "女王的表情变得紧张起来。看得出她对此事毫无准备。她的顾问们互相交换眼神，显然在认真记录着她的证词。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:349
translate chinese castle1rewrite_30355431:

    # ros "[mc] didn’t have to stop, but he did. He didn’t fix it, but I didn’t expect him to. He wished me luck and went on his way."
    ros "[mc]本不必停下，但他还是这么做了。虽然他没来帮我修篷车吧，但其实我本来也没指望他会来帮我的。他祝我好运，然后就走掉了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:351
translate chinese castle1rewrite_d1a93614:

    # "I catch a flicker of amusement in the Queen’s eyes. Her advisors exchange glances, clearly taking note of the testimony."
    "我看到了女王眼中一闪而过的得意。她的顾问们互相对视，记录下了这份证词。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:353
translate chinese castle1rewrite_28e53fe4:

    # "As [ros] steps down, a merchant from the marketplace steps up, looking a little embarrassed as he speaks."
    "随着[ros]的退场，一名来自集市的商贩走上前来，说话时显得有些紧张。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:357
translate chinese castle1rewrite_89cf217c:

    # misc "I—I made a mistake with the change after the defendant bought something from me. Gave him too much, and only realized later… but he handed it back without a second thought."
    misc "我——我给被告找零时搞错了，多给了他钱，我是事后才发现……当我以为他不会把钱还回来的时候，他走了回来，把多找的零钱还给了我。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:358
translate chinese castle1rewrite_9d2ff5cd:

    # misc "It may not seem like much, but in my trade, honesty means the most."
    misc "这看似不是什么大事，但对我这个行业来说，诚信真的很重要。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:360
translate chinese castle1rewrite_9a62dfed:

    # "The Queen’s fingers stop tapping, her brows furrowing as she processes this. I can feel her impatience building. There’s a growing spark of doubt in the room. Maybe, just maybe, I’m not the villain she’s trying to paint me as."
    "女王的手指停止了敲击，她皱着眉，消化着这个信息。我能感觉到她正在变得越来越不耐烦。房间里弥漫着的怀疑气息变得越来越浓。也许，只是也许，我并非她试图描绘的那般恶徒。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:362
translate chinese castle1rewrite_95f06b02:

    # misc "Your Majesty, the defendant was at my stall to buy a few things. I gave him too much change on accident, and… well, he didn’t say a word. Just pocketed it and left. Found out later, but by then, he was long gone."
    misc "陛下，被告当时在我摊位上买了几样东西。我不小心找错了钱，而……他什么也没说，把钱收进兜里就走了。我发现的时候，他已经走得无影无踪了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:364
translate chinese castle1rewrite_a7b612e6:

    # "A wave of murmurs ripples through the court as the merchant steps back. The Queen’s face is almost gleeful as she gets vindicated."
    "商贩走了下去，一阵窃窃私语在法庭上蔓延开来。女王的脸上带着欣喜的神情，她终于得到了她想要的结果。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:366
translate chinese castle1rewrite_e0fd3133:

    # aur "Of course, exactly. Who’s next?"
    aur "当然，正是如此。下一个是谁？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:369
translate chinese castle1rewrite_5330721c:

    # "Finally, [cla] steps forward, nodding shyly to the court."
    "最后，[cla]向前迈步，向法庭羞怯地点了点头。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:372
translate chinese castle1rewrite_1b27d5a9:

    # cla "I lost my bag a while ago. I didn’t think I’d ever see it again, but [mc] found it and gave it back to me. Everything was still inside, nothing was taken. That… it’s rare to find someone who’s that trustworthy, Your Majesty."
    cla "前些日子我弄丢了手包。本以为再也找不回来了，但[mc]捡到了它，并归还给我。里面物品完好无损，分文未少。陛下啊……能遇到如此守信之人实属难得。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:376
translate chinese castle1rewrite_de5fbcaf:

    # "With each testimony, I can see the Queen’s patience wearing thinner. She stares right through me."
    "随着每份证词的陈述，我能看出女王的耐心正逐渐耗尽。她盯着我，目光尖锐。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:378
translate chinese castle1rewrite_d4987175:

    # cla "I lost my bag a while ago. I didn’t think I’d ever see it again. Someone contacted me a few hours ago and it was a shame to discover that [mc] had found it and kept it."
    cla "前阵子我弄丢了手包，以为再也找不回来了。过了几个小时后，有马联系我，发现竟是[mc]捡到后据为己有，实在遗憾。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:382
translate chinese castle1rewrite_b4ede742:

    # "The Queen grins and nods while directly staring into my eyes."
    "女王笑了笑，点头示意，目光直直地盯着我的眼睛。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:385
translate chinese castle1rewrite_ce8610c0:

    # aur "You may have won the favor of commoners, [mc], but your actions are still nothing more than petty gestures that serve to bolster your reputation. If anything, these stories prove your insidious influence, inspiring people to follow you instead of obeying their Queen."
    aur "你或许赢得了平民的欢心，[mc]，但你的所作所为不过是些微不足道的行为，无非是为你自己而粉饰门面。这些传闻恰恰证明了你外表下的阴险——煽动民众追随你，而非效忠他们的女王。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:386
translate chinese castle1rewrite_6d133972:

    # aur "How else would you have rallied these ‘Virtues’ if not with dogmatic doctrine? No doubt aspects of your characters taught by the harbinger of the darkness herself."
    aur "若非凭借教条主义的教义，你还能用什么来鼓动这些“谐律之元？无疑，这些特质正是由黑暗的先兆亲自传授给你的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:387
translate chinese castle1rewrite_5fbf66b5:

    # "She stands, addressing the court in a loud, serious tone."
    "她站起身，用洪亮而严肃的语气向法庭宣布。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:388
translate chinese castle1rewrite_3d16954c:

    # aur "For the crime of attempting to undermine the throne and spread false hope among my subjects, [mc] shall be imprisoned indefinitely."
    aur "因企图颠覆王位并向臣民散布虚妄希望之罪，[mc]，反叛者一号，将被无限期监禁。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:389
translate chinese castle1rewrite_c42290b3:

    # "The crowd gasps, voices rising in discontent."
    "观众席上发出了一阵阵惊呼，抱怨声逐渐升高。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:392
translate chinese castle1rewrite_9ea3ecce:

    # aur "I believe the evidence speaks for itself. [mc] character is clearly one of selfishness and moral deficiency. This man stands before us not as a virtuous leader but as a leech on our society, exploiting those around him with no regard for their welfare."
    aur "我相信证词足以说明一切。[mc]的品性显然充满自私与道德上的缺失。此人站在我们面前，并非贤明领袖，而是社会上的吸血虫，在社会上肆意剥削，全然不顾他们的福祉。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:393
translate chinese castle1rewrite_748fc7ff:

    # "The Queen’s gaze pierces me, her words laced with disgust."
    "女王的目光如一把长枪，刺穿了我，话语里透着厌恶。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:394
translate chinese castle1rewrite_a09b89f9:

    # aur "As an agent of the darkness, [mc] shall be sentenced to death within the next three days."
    aur "作为黑暗的使者，[mc]，被判处死刑，缓期三天执行。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:396
translate chinese castle1rewrite_315491eb:

    # "I hear [lil] and the others calling out, their protests swallowed by the clamor of the court. I meet their eyes, seeing the disbelief and anger."
    "我听见[lil]和其他姑娘呼喊，她们的抗议声被法庭的喧嚣吞没。我与他们目光交汇，看见那满溢的难以置信与愤怒。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:397
translate chinese castle1rewrite_05734563:

    # "I nod to them in silent reassurance. We knew this journey wouldn’t be easy, and if this is what it takes to ignite a spark of change, then so be it."
    "我默默点头以示安抚。我早知这段旅程不会轻松，如若这是点燃变革火花的代价，那就这样吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:399
translate chinese castle1rewrite_8d2b0e59:

    # "As the guards lead me away, I catch a glimpse of the Queen’s face. For all her pomp and venom, there’s a shadow of doubt in her gaze, as if she, too, is questioning her decision."
    "当卫兵押着我离开时，我瞥见了女王的脸庞。纵然她满身华服，目光里却浮现出一抹疑虑，仿佛连她自己也在质疑这个决定。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:403
translate chinese castle1changes_2e35461b:

    # "The door slams shut behind me, and I’m taken away from the city to Castlegaol Prison, a mile away."
    "身后门哐当一声关上，我被押离了城市，前往一公里外的Castlegaol监狱。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:411
translate chinese castle1changes_3ad73260:

    # "My world narrows to the cold stone walls of my cell."
    "我的世界变成了牢房冰冷的石墙。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:412
translate chinese castle1changes_70719f77:

    # "I’m stuffed into a pitch-black cell, with only a single sliver of light creeping through the small, barred window too high to even reach."
    "我被塞进漆黑的牢房中，唯有细窄的铁窗透进一缕微光，那窗户高得完全够不着。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:413
translate chinese castle1changes_8b6e5b26:

    # "The sides of the cell are so dark that with my eyes unadjusted, it might as well be an endless void."
    "牢房的四壁漆黑一片，若未适应黑暗，简直如同无边无际的虚空。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:414
translate chinese castle1changes_c01e70b1:

    # "I simply sigh and make my way towards the single spot in the bench illuminated by light. I need to go over everything that led up to this moment. To try and make sense of the Queen’s judgment, her contempt, the way she dismissed my attempts to help."
    "我叹了口气，走向长椅上唯一被光线照亮的角落。我需要思考。试图理解女王的判决、她的轻蔑，以及她如何无视我伸出的援手。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:415
translate chinese castle1changes_227ecc98:

    # "She’s nothing like the kind, motherly [aur] I knew. In fact, she may be the most contrasting person I’ve met so far in this universe. Could this be a consequence of [sel]’s absence?"
    "她完全不像我所认识的那个温柔如慈母般的[aur]。事实上，她或许是我在这个宇宙中迄今遇见性格变化最大的马。这难道是缺少了[sel]的后果？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:416
translate chinese castle1changes_1df3f824:

    # "Some scratching and shifting catches my attention in a particularly dark corner of my cell. I hope it’s not a rat. A little, furry cell mate is the last thing I need right now."
    "牢房某个特别昏暗的角落传来窸窸窣窣的动静，引起了我的注意。但愿不是老鼠。此刻最不需要的就是多个毛茸茸的狱友。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:417
translate chinese castle1changes_2388ea75:

    # "But as I stare off into that corner, I notice light reflecting off something. Something… green."
    "但当我凝视那个角落时，我注意到有东西散发着光芒。某种……绿色的东西。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:418
translate chinese castle1changes_f91d7fbe:

    # "Two green, vertical slits shifted ever so slightly… For a moment, I swear I could see sharp, predatory pupils watching me."
    "两道绿色的竖缝微微挪动……刹那间，我发誓看见了锐利的掠食者瞳孔正盯着我。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:419
translate chinese castle1changes_e3bb5298:

    # "They stepped closer, and a female figure came into focus. I found myself face to face with..."
    "它向我走近了些，一个女性身影逐渐清晰。我发现自己面对的是……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:430
translate chinese castle1changes_1782dcee:

    # "For a moment, I froze. My heart pounded in my chest, and the scar across it pulsed."
    "刹那间，我僵住了。心跳如雷般在胸腔里轰鸣，那道横亘其上的疤痕随之阵阵抽搐。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:431
translate chinese castle1changes_09bbc180:

    # "I gripped the edge of the wall as a spike of adrenaline flooded through me, but then I looked closer."
    "我紧抓着墙沿，一股肾上腺素猛地涌遍全身，随即我定睛细看。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:435
translate chinese castle1changes_707a2831:

    # "Her expression was intimidating, sure, but it held no malice."
    "她的表情确实令人胆寒，但其中毫无恶意。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:436
translate chinese castle1changes_e2667cb2:

    # "She looked at me not with hate but with something else — an understanding, a strange sense of calm."
    "她看着我，眼中没有仇恨，而是某种别的东西——一种理解，一种奇异的平静。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:438
translate chinese castle1changes_58cb0e8b:

    # "She noticed something in my gaze, and a faint, almost weary smile tugged at her lips. This wasn’t the same [mor] I’d fought, but…"
    "她从我的目光中察觉到什么，嘴角浮起一抹微弱而近乎疲惫的微笑。眼前这个[mor]已非昔日与我交战的模样，但……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:440
translate chinese castle1changes_0b375cd7:

    # mor "Now this is a rather interesting turn of events... My name is [mor]."
    mor "这真是个相当有趣的转折……我叫[mor]。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:441
translate chinese castle1changes_e2c87184:

    # mc "[mc]... I… didn’t know anyone else was in here."
    mc "[mc]……我……不知道这间牢房里还有其它马。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:443
translate chinese castle1changes_f926518e:

    # mor "This is where they throw the most dangerous prisoners. The walls are lined with a material that nullifies magic. So why would a young boy such as yourself be here?"
    mor "这里关押着最危险的重刑犯。墙壁上铺着能抵消魔法的材料。那么像你这样的小男孩为何会在此？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:444
translate chinese castle1changes_26344609:

    # mc "If you are as dangerous as you say, can I really be honest with you?"
    mc "若你真如你所言般危险，我还能对你坦诚相待吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:446
translate chinese castle1changes_85e5ec95:

    # mor "Statistically, you’re going to be in here for an extremely long time… You better get used to talking to me."
    mor "从统计学角度来说呢，你将在这里待上相当长的时间……最好习惯和我说话。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:448
translate chinese castle1changes_7525bb1d:

    # mor "And isn't there an implication that you're just as dangerous as me? Question is, what’s so special about you?"
    mor "而且，你都和我住同一个牢房了，这不说明你和我一样危险吗？问题是，你到底是怎么个危险法？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:449
translate chinese castle1changes_d828d592:

    # mc "That, I still don’t fully understand. We came to the Queen offering aid, and before I knew it, I was being dragged along by guards."
    mc "其实，我也不太清楚。我想为女王做一些力所能及的事，可转眼间，我就被卫兵们拖走了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:451
translate chinese castle1changes_9e291e5c:

    # mor "Hah! I’m familiar with your type. Trying to save the world with goodwill, hoping to soften the edges of a system that’s all teeth underneath."
    mor "哈！你这种人我再熟悉不过了。满腔热血想拯救世界，却妄想软化这个骨子里满是尖牙的体系。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:452
translate chinese castle1changes_fcb83ba9:

    # mc "So… what happened to you? What brought you here?"
    mc "那……你身上发生什么了？你怎么到这里来的？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:454
translate chinese castle1changes_3be3af03:

    # mor "I tried to dethrone her, your so-called Queen. Thought it was about time someone showed her what happens when you neglect the very people you’re sworn to protect."
    mor "我曾试图推翻她——你们所谓的女王。是时候该有马让她明白，当你辜负了那些你发誓要保护的事物时，会发生什么。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:455
translate chinese castle1changes_62e82853:

    # mor "I had a plan, allies…"
    mor "我曾有过计划，有过盟友……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:457
translate chinese castle1changes_10bd008f:

    # mor "But we didn’t stand a chance."
    mor "但我们毫无胜算。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:458
translate chinese castle1changes_09d1fe55:

    # mor "Arcadia wasn’t always this way. But unchecked royalty, the Queen’s obsession with power—it’s all led to this. They’ve convinced themselves they’re beyond criticism, while the rest of us… are disposable."
    mor "Arcadia并非一直如此。但君权不受制约，女王对权力的痴迷——这一切都导致了如今的局面。她自以为凌驾于万众之上，而我们其余的马……不过是可有可无的存在。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:459
translate chinese castle1changes_7e955c54:

    # mc "Do you know why the Queen is doing this?"
    mc "你知道女王为什么这么做吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:461
translate chinese castle1changes_7cb16e99:

    # mor "Maybe. I’ve had more than enough time locked in here to think about it."
    mor "大概吧。被关在这里这么久，我早有足够的时间去思考这个问题了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:462
translate chinese castle1changes_e5bbff85:

    # mor "I believe that the reason the Queen is so authoritarian, so hellbent on power, is because she’s preparing to fight something."
    mor "我认为女王之所以如此专制，如此执着于权力，是因为她正在为对抗某种事物做准备。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:464
translate chinese castle1changes_69544167:

    # mor "She’s trying to save us; means be damned."
    mor "她正竭力拯救我们；不计后果。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:465
translate chinese castle1changes_e6b68960:

    # mc "Whoever battles monsters should make sure they don’t become one in the process…"
    mc "屠龙者，谨记不要成为恶龙……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:467
translate chinese castle1changes_ef5ae2fc:

    # mor "Heh, hard to say I’m much better, boy. Truth is, I just wanted that power for myself."
    mor "嘿，不过我也没比她高尚到哪去，小子。说真的，我只是想把那股力量据为己有罢了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:468
translate chinese castle1changes_0218a6b4:

    # mor "I was no saviour; I envied her power and coveted it for myself. That was my downfall. What was yours?"
    mor "我并非救世主；我单纯嫉妒她的力量，并渴望将其据为己有。这便是我在这的原因。而你的呢？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:469
translate chinese castle1changes_b0e54773:

    # mc "My downfall? I guess it was thinking I could fix this world without understanding it first. I assumed good intentions and a strong will were enough..."
    mc "我吗？大概是以为能在不了解这个世界的前提下就改变它。我以为只要怀揣善意和意志就足够了……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:470
translate chinese castle1changes_09b5e619:

    # mc "I thought I could reason with her, that my intentions would speak for themselves…"
    mc "我以为能说服她，以为我的心意会不言自明……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:471
translate chinese castle1changes_833af8eb:

    # mc "But when you stand before someone like the Queen — someone who’s seen and done everything in the name of survival — words don’t mean much."
    mc "但当你面对女王这样的马——一个为生存而见识过、经历过一切的马——言语便显得微不足道。                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        "

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:473
translate chinese castle1changes_54ea36b9:

    # mor "Hah, naive and idealistic. And yet, here you are, sharing a cell with me, the very thing she fears becoming. Maybe you're not so different."
    mor "哈，天真又充满理想主义。可看啊，你如今竟与我共处一室——这正是她最害怕变成的那种马。说不定你其实没那么不同。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:474
translate chinese castle1changes_71a01d37:

    # mc "Or maybe I just underestimated how far she’d go to protect her kingdom. Good intentions don’t necessarily mean good results."
    mc "或许我只是低估了她为守护王国所能付出的代价。善意的初衷未必能带来好的结果。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:475
translate chinese castle1changes_27d483f8:

    # mc "What about you? If you could do it all over again, would you have done anything differently?"
    mc "那你呢？如果能重新来过，你会做些什么不同的选择吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:477
translate chinese castle1changes_7ba12974:

    # mor "Tch. You’re asking if I’d invade the city again? The answer is no... And not just because I know I’d lose. I’ve had a few decades to meditate on myself here with surprisingly good food."
    mor "哼。你问我还会不会再攻城？答案是不会……而且不只是因为我知道这会输。说实话吧，在这儿沉淀了几十年，倒也意外地吃得不错。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:479
translate chinese castle1changes_e2ff9fe3:

    # mor "But I might’ve been smarter about it. Less blunt force, more... finesse. I let anger drive me. It clouded my judgment, made me sloppy. And here I am, paying the price."
    mor "但我本可以更聪明些。少些蛮力，多些……技巧。我任由愤怒驱使自己，它蒙蔽了我的判断，让我变得粗心大意。而现在，我正在为此付出代价。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:481
translate chinese castle1changes_feb2271e:

    # mor "Still, I don’t regret trying. I was the smoke to her fire. Someone would have done it eventually. Someone had to remind her that power isn’t absolute."
    mor "尽管如此，我也无怨无悔。我是果，她是因。终究会有马这么做，总得有马提醒她，权力并非绝对。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:482
translate chinese castle1changes_55ce15fe:

    # mc "And yet you admit you wanted her power for yourself. Doesn’t that make you worse than she as is?"
    mc "然而你承认你也想拥有她的力量。这难道不比她本身更邪恶吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:484
translate chinese castle1changes_7643f968:

    # mor "Worse? … Yeah. I was much worse."
    mor "邪恶吗？…确实。我当时坏透了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:485
translate chinese castle1changes_b865d140:

    # mor "It’s like you said. [aur] only operates through good intentions. Remains to be seen whether it truly leads to hell."
    mor "正如你所言，[aur]实际上是抱着好意行动的。至于她的领导是否会通向地狱，尚待观察。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:487
translate chinese castle1changes_50963571:

    # "She leans closer, her sharp eyes glinting in the faint light."
    "她靠近了些，锐利的目光在微弱的光线中闪烁。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:488
translate chinese castle1changes_e5b92994:

    # mor "And what about you, boy? What’s your goal? Why are you here, really?"
    mor "那你呢，小子？你的目标是什么？说真的，你到底是因为什么才被关到这的？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:489
translate chinese castle1changes_461beb09:

    # mc "Where do I even begin… This world... kind of fucking sucks? I know it could be better; I've seen it myself. Everyone I know is struggling; but there's a bright future if they just work together."
    mc "我该从何说起……这世界……简直他妈糟透了？我知道它本可以更好，我亲眼见过。我认识的每匹马都在挣扎；但只要她们齐心协力，未来就会一片光明。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:490
translate chinese castle1changes_90ad417f:

    # mc "This world doesn’t have to keep tearing itself apart. I came here because I believed I could help, but now… now I’m not so sure."
    mc "这个世界不必继续自我撕裂。我被关到这里，是因为相信自己能帮助这个世界，但如今……如今我已不再能确定。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:491
translate chinese castle1changes_3b3a9937:

    # mc "There's only so much I can do, and if the people in this city can't come together, they'll never be able to get through this."
    mc "我能做的终究有限，若这座城市无法团结一心，那他们也永远无法渡过难关。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:493
translate chinese castle1changes_930cecf0:

    # mor "Doubt keeps you sharp. But let me give you some advice from one failed revolutionary to another—change isn’t about kindness or intentions. It’s about leverage. Without it, you’re just a dreamer with empty hands."
    mor "怀疑能让你保持敏锐。但请允许我以一个失败的革命者身份给另一个失败者提个建议——变革与仁慈或意图无关，关键在于影响力。没有影响力，你不过是个空手而归的梦想家。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:494
translate chinese castle1changes_d95d8dd1:

    # mc "Leverage…"
    mc "影响力吗....."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:495
translate chinese castle1changes_878f4b38:

    # "The cell fell into a tense silence. I stared at the sliver of light on the wall, trying to process her cynicism."
    "牢房陷入了紧张的沉默。我盯着墙上那道狭窄的光线，努力消化着她的愤世嫉俗。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:496
translate chinese castle1changes_0ec70885:

    # "I didn’t bring anything of value to the Queen except ideals and vacant promises. How could I have expected her to react any differently when she’s operating such a tight military regime for the safety of the city?"
    "我除了空洞的理想和虚妄的承诺，别无珍宝可献给女王。当她为守护城池安全而实施如此严密的军事管制时，我怎能指望她会有不同的反应？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:497
translate chinese castle1changes_fff18526:

    # "If I just had something, anything to show…"
    "要是能有东西能证明的话……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:499
translate chinese castle1changes_4bdd5085:

    # mor "Doesn’t matter. Get comfortable, because this cell is going to be your grave."
    mor "无所谓啦。放轻松，因为这牢房将成为你的坟墓哩。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:500
translate chinese castle1changes_a324d6cd:

    # "She leaned back into the shadows, her green eyes glowing faintly in the dark."
    "她向后退入阴影中，那双绿色的眼睛在黑暗里微微发亮。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:501
translate chinese castle1changes_bfa39338:

    # "I’m going to get out, right? The others… will they come for me? Have I left enough of an impact?"
    "我会离开这里，对吧？她们……她们会来找我吗？我留下的影响够深吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:503
translate chinese castle1changes_a4efdb12:

    # mor "But… maybe it doesn’t have to be that uncomfortable."
    mor "不过嘛……或许有办法让牢狱时光变得不那么难受。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:504
translate chinese castle1changes_3a6eedbc:

    # "Her tone shifted, almost teasing. I turned my head, catching the glint of her eyes watching me through the darkness."
    "她的语气突然一变，带着几分戏谑。我转过头，看见黑暗中她注视着我的眼睛里闪着绿色的光芒。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:505
translate chinese castle1changes_b79ddbfd:

    # mc "What’s that supposed to mean?"
    mc "你什么意思？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:507
translate chinese castle1changes_a5bee1b6:

    # mor "Oh, don’t act so dense. We’re stuck in here together, boy. No escape, no distractions… just you, me, and plenty of time to get creative."
    mor "噢，别装傻了。咱们被困在这儿了，小子。无处可逃，无事可想……只有你、我，还有大把时间来发挥一些 \"创意\"。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:508
translate chinese castle1changes_e94a908e:

    # "I raised an eyebrow, unsure whether to laugh. She leaned forward, her sharp features catching just enough of the dim light to reveal a sly grin."
    "我挑了挑眉，不知该不该笑。她向前倾身，棱角分明的脸庞在昏暗灯光下隐约透出狡黠的笑容。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:509
translate chinese castle1changes_a9928347:

    # mc "You’re joking. Right? It’s cold in here."
    mc "你在开玩笑吧？对吧？这里挺冷的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:511
translate chinese castle1changes_7305b302:

    # mor "Hmm… maybe. But let’s face it, a dark cell isn’t exactly a breeding ground for optimism. Why not make the best of our… unique circumstances?"
    mor "嗯……或许吧。但说实话，黑暗的牢房实在算不上温暖的软床。何不趁此机会，好好利用我们这个……独特的处境呢？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:512
translate chinese castle1changes_5f738dc9:

    # mc "You’re serious. The dark cell isn’t exactly a {b}breeding{/b} ground for {b}breeding{/b}."
    mc "你认真的啊。这间黑暗牢房可算不上是一个适合{b}受精{/b}的{b}温床{/b}。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:514
translate chinese castle1changes_1f910f9c:

    # mor "What, scared of a little intimacy? You think I bite?"
    mor "怎么，你怕我？你觉得我会咬你吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:515
translate chinese castle1changes_8ccea595:

    # mc "Oh come on, you definitely bite."
    mc "得了吧，你肯定会咬我。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:517
translate chinese castle1changes_a0c1d9e9:

    # mor "Fair point. But only nibbles your neck and ear~"
    mor "说得有道理。不过只会轻轻咬你的脖子和耳朵~"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:518
translate chinese castle1changes_853b5e83:

    # "She let out a low, husky laugh, leaning back again."
    "她发出低沉而沙哑的笑声，再次向后靠去。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:520
translate chinese castle1changes_deadbe7f:

    # mor "Relax, boy. I’m not about to pounce on you."
    mor "放松点，小子。我才不会强上你呢。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:521
translate chinese castle1changes_c2ae1813:

    # mc "You’re awfully flippant for someone who just called this my grave."
    mc "你可真牛逼，刚刚还把这儿说是我的坟墓。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:523
translate chinese castle1changes_7cdd1ba9:

    # mor "That’s because I’ve already made peace with it. You? You’re still fighting, even in here. It’s kind of admirable… and a little stupid."
    mor "那是因为我早已与这和解。你呢？此刻，你仍在抗争。这倒有些可敬……又有点愚蠢。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:524
translate chinese castle1changes_dafaa365:

    # mc "[mor], I’ve been here for twenty minutes. Give me a break."
    mc "[mor]，我在这儿才待了二十分钟。让我静静吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:525
translate chinese castle1changes_16f0316d:

    # "I couldn’t tell if she was mocking me or trying to find common ground. Maybe both. Either way, her presence was… disarming, in a way I hadn’t expected."
    "我无法分辨她是嘲弄我，还是试图寻找和我的共同点。或许两者兼而有之。无论如何，她的存在……以一种我始料未及的方式，令我卸下心防。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:526
translate chinese castle1changes_90a2c39a:

    # mc "So, what’s your angle? Why try to get under my skin?"
    mc "所以，你到底想干什么？为什么总想惹我生气？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:528
translate chinese castle1changes_9abb0425:

    # mor "Because it’s fun, and because I don’t think you’ve figured out what you’re really made of yet. And maybe — just maybe — you’ll surprise me."
    mor "因为这很有趣，也因为我觉得你还没真正认识到自己的潜力。可能——只是可能哦——你会让我大吃一惊。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:529
translate chinese castle1changes_eebfff2a:

    # "I didn’t respond right away. Despite her provocations, there was a strange, genuine undertone to her voice."
    "我没有立刻回应她。尽管她不断的开我玩笑，但她的声音里却透着一种奇怪而真实的底色。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:531
translate chinese castle1changes_f9b1c141:

    # mor "Well, I’m here whenever you feel like figuring it out. We’ve got nothing but time, after all."
    mor "嗯，只要你想弄明白，我随时都在。毕竟，我们在这有大把时间呢。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:533
translate chinese castle1changes_896a8018:

    # "She reclined fully into the shadows, her glowing eyes the last thing to fade from view… That’s unnecessarily creepy. Why can’t she just stay in the light like a normal person?"
    "她完全沉入阴影之中，那双闪烁的眼睛在她没入黑暗后才彻底消失……这未免太诡异了。她为什么不能像正常点，像我一样待在光线里呢？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:535
translate chinese castle1changes_051973ff:

    # "Oh, hang on… Now my eyes have adjusted to the darkness, I can see a bed over in that corner now. Alright, I’ll give her a pass."
