# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:851
translate chinese castle1changes_367b3197:

    # mor "Focus, you fool! If we don’t move now, we’ll be killed!"
    mor "集中注意...蠢货们！如果我们现在不行动的话，死的就是我们！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:859
translate chinese castle1changes_0cba1b8d:

    # rub "[lil], [mox], you can cast magic. I don't care how strong or weak, let's do something to help."
    rub "[lil]，[mox]，你们可以施展魔法。不管有多强或多弱，我们总得做点什么。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:861
translate chinese castle1changes_ff01f1dc:

    # lil "Nnghh… Y-Yeah! Channel together, support our fighters!"
    lil "嗯.....对..对！团结起来，支持我们的朋友！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:864
translate chinese castle1changes_b27f5541:

    # "[lil], [mox] and [rub] hung back and cast a spell. A shimmering, fiery barrier erupted between us and a significant amount of the guards."
    "[lil]，[mox]和[rub]犹豫了一下，然后施放了一道魔法。一道闪亮的火焰屏障在我们和大量守卫之间爆发开来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:865
translate chinese castle1changes_2f906177:

    # "This allowed the girls fighting in close quarters to make quick work of the stragglers."
    "这使得在近距离作战的女孩们能够迅速解决掉落单的守卫。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:869
translate chinese castle1changes_075f82e2:

    # lil "That won’t hold long. Whatever you’re doing, make it quick!"
    lil "这坚持不了太久，想做什么就趁现在！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:872
translate chinese castle1changes_c1486836:

    # "Another tremor shook the ground, causing the prison walls to groan ominously. Dust and debris rained down, adding to the chaos."
    "又是一阵震动，地面随之摇晃，监狱的墙壁发出不祥的哭嚎声。尘土和碎石如雨点般落下，使得混乱更加严重。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:875
translate chinese castle1changes_6c1f07ff:

    # mox "This place might come down on its own before we even need to escape!"
    mox "这地方估计要在我们逃走前塌了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:876
translate chinese castle1changes_895fd77a:

    # mc "We need an opening! Can you create a distraction?"
    mc "我们需要一个突破口！你可以制造一个干扰吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:878
translate chinese castle1changes_8c521837:

    # lil "What do you think we’ve been doing?!"
    lil "那你觉得我们现在在做啥？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:880
translate chinese castle1changes_098abc0e:

    # mox "Wait, I think I know what you mean! Everyone, close your eyes!"
    mox "等下，我觉得我知道你啥意思了！大家闭上眼睛！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:883
translate chinese castle1changes_1f5e8c0c:

    # "[mox] flung her hands outward, directing an explosion of light that engulfed the courtyard. The guards recoiled, shielding their eyes as the intense brilliance blinded them momentarily."
    "[mox] 的双手向外一挥，引导一道剧烈的光芒在空中爆炸，瞬间将院子笼罩其中。守卫们纷纷后退，用手遮挡眼睛，强烈的光芒让他们暂时失明。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:887
translate chinese castle1changes_cebe7cb4:

    # mor "Oh? Now’s our chance! Through this gate!"
    mor "哦？现在正是时候！穿过这扇门！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:890
translate chinese castle1changes_3e5a077b:

    # "We darted through the chaos, slipping past disoriented guards and heading for the outer gate. [rik] skidded to a halt and shoved her entire weight into the heavy iron lever, gritting her teeth as it began to budge."
    "我们穿过茫然失措的守卫，直奔外门而去。[rik]猛地刹住脚步，将全身重量都压在沉重的大门上，咬着牙，用尽全力推着它。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:892
translate chinese castle1changes_66a3f7cb:

    # rik "Argh. Why can’t you all fly too?!"
    rik "唉！你们为什么不会飞啊！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:895
translate chinese castle1changes_b07d9782:

    # hon "Heh, I just respect that you didn't ditch us. Here, let me lend a hand!"
    hon "嘿，我还挺佩服你没抛下我们，自己飞走呢。来，腾个位置，让我帮个忙！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:898
translate chinese castle1changes_ff384aea:

    # "Another tremor rippled through the ground, and the walls cracked audibly behind us. The gate groaned as it creaked open just wide enough for us to slip through."
    "地面又一次震颤，身后墙壁发出咔嚓作响的龟裂声。铁门吱呀作响地尖叫着，缓缓敞开了一条缝隙，刚好容我们钻过。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:901
translate chinese castle1changes_4e15196a:

    # mor "Don't stop. Crawl under!"
    mor "别停！钻过去！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:903
translate chinese castle1changes_f80de5f7:

    # "One by one, we managed to slip under while [rik] held the gate open. Once we were all in, she flew over the top."
    "我们一个接一个地钻了进去，而[rik]则一直顶着门。等大家都进去后，她才飞越过围墙。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:907
translate chinese castle1changes_9a3aa483:

    # "With the prison crumbling behind us and the guards regrouping, we bolted into the night. The city looming in the distance."
    "监狱在身后崩塌，守卫们已恢复过来，正在重新集结。我们冲入夜色之中，城市的灯光在远处若隐若现。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:908
translate chinese castle1changes_d101e934:

    # "As we reached the tree line, I glanced back one last time at the collapsing prison. The guards were still scrambling, their shouts growing fainter with each step we took."
    "当我们抵达林线时，我最后一次回头望了望那座坍塌的监狱。守卫们仍在慌乱的撤离着，他们的喊声随着我们每一步的远去而渐趋微弱。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:910
translate chinese castle1changes_2baee260:

    # bla "That was way too close for comfort."
    bla "那真是太险了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:913
translate chinese castle1changes_11b1319d:

    # rub "I can't believe we broke the Queen of the Morphlings out of a maximum security prison!"
    rub "真不敢相信我们居然把幻形女王从最高安全级别的监狱里救出来了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:914
translate chinese castle1changes_746177c9:

    # mc "Uhm, and me?"
    mc "额，不是还有我吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:917
translate chinese castle1changes_a3f3751f:

    # mor "I like this one."
    mor "我喜欢这种说法。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:925
translate chinese castle1changes_79ec217a:

    # but "We have a hidden camp to the west about a mile away. Let’s head there quickly; it’s safe, and you’ll have a chance to recover."
    but "我们在西边约一公里远的地方藏着个营地。快去那里，那里很安全，你也能休整一下。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:926
translate chinese castle1changes_d386a435:

    # mc "Music to my ears. Lead the way."
    mc "听着挺不错的。带路吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:929
translate chinese castle1changes_8a661fe8:

    # "As we approached the camp, the tension in the air began to dissipate. The faint glow of firelight peeked through the trees, and the soft hum of crickets filled the silence between us."
    "我们接近了营地，空气中的紧张感开始渐渐消散。篝火发出的火光从书从中透了出来，蟋蟀嗡嗡声填满了我们之间的寂静。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:931
translate chinese castle1changes_4192225d:

    # hon "There she is. Our little slice of paradise."
    hon "就在那。我们的世外桃源。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:932
translate chinese castle1changes_4d383d7c:

    # "[hon] gestured ahead, her voice tinged with pride as the hidden camp came into view—a small but well-organized clearing, complete with a campfire, makeshift tents, and supplies carefully tucked away."
    "[hon]指了指前方，声音里透着一股自豪感，隐蔽的营地随即映入了我的眼帘——那是一片虽小却井然有序的空地，篝火熊熊，帐篷林立，物资被整齐地收纳在暗处。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:936
translate chinese castle1changes_1dee4860:

    # but "Before we settle in, [mc], you look like you’ve been through the wringer. Rest by the fire and I’ll brew up something to help you recover."
    but "在我们安顿下来之前，[mc]，你看起来累坏了，去火边坐会吧，我给你煮点东西帮你恢复体力。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:937
translate chinese castle1changes_2a9ac906:

    # mc "As long as it doesn’t ‘invigorate’ me quite as much as your last brew."
    mc "只要它不会像你上次煮的那杯那样让我“精神振奋”就行。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:939
translate chinese castle1changes_65b9a668:

    # but "Oh, uhm… It… probably… At least you’re in good company."
    but "呃……这个……大概……至少这次身边都是熟悉的朋友。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:940
translate chinese castle1changes_57794bd5:

    # mc "Ah… I suppose."
    mc "啊……大概吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:942
translate chinese castle1changes_e98562ea:

    # "[but] guided me toward the campfire where she set up her cauldron. As I followed, [pen] came into focus and waved me over."
    "[but]她领着我走向篝火，在那里架起了她的大锅。当我跟过去时，篝火边[pen]的身影逐渐清晰起来，向我招手示意。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:944
translate chinese castle1changes_875483c8:

    # pen "[penmc]! Looks like the plan was a great success!"
    pen "[penmc]！看来计划成功了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:945
translate chinese castle1changes_a34062b6:

    # mc "I’m glad to see you’re doing well, [pen]! You managed to avoid the courtroom drama."
    mc "很高兴能看到你，[pen]！看来你成功地避开了那场法庭闹剧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:947
translate chinese castle1changes_a5d52bab:

    # pen "Never been a huge fan of that genre. I’m more of a heist kind of girl, and it looks like everything worked!"
    pen "我从来都不是那种类型的忠实粉丝。我更喜欢劫案类的电影，而且看起来一切都很顺利！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:948
translate chinese castle1changes_469b37e4:

    # mc "How’d you get all this set up so fast?"
    mc "你怎么这么快就把这一切都安排好了？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:951
translate chinese castle1changes_f3d63cd3:

    # mox "It wasn’t just the eight of us, there were others too."
    mox "不仅仅只有我们八个哟。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:952
translate chinese castle1changes_3fd61a7d:

    # mox "We’ve had an amazing team working behind the scenes. You’ve got no idea what kind of people are out there who appreciate what you’ve done."
    mox "我们背后有一支了不起的团队在默默支持着我们。你根本想象不到，有谁都在默默欣赏着你所做的一切。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:954
translate chinese castle1changes_6f38889e:

    # "She lifts out a bag leaned up against… that’s [mox]’s wagon! I didn’t recognize it in the darkness. I see [ros], smiling wide as she bounces out of it."
    "她从一辆篷车上取了一个包出来.....那是[mox]的篷车！太黑了我第一时间没认出来。只见[ros]笑盈盈地从车里蹦了出来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:957
translate chinese castle1changes_52a63498:

    # ros "Heyyy! You made it!"
    ros "嘿~！你做到了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:958
translate chinese castle1changes_b2541576:

    # mc "[ros]! You’re here too?"
    mc "[ros]！你也帮忙了？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:960
translate chinese castle1changes_e2c04348:

    # ros "Of course! You didn’t think we’d leave you hanging, did you?"
    ros "当然啦！你不会以为我们会不管你吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:962
translate chinese castle1changes_bcc518ec:

    # mox "A lot of this is from the people you’ve helped."
    mox "你的善意，给你赢得了很多的支持者。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:964
translate chinese castle1changes_432c817e:

    # "[ros] waved toward the pile of bags next to the old wagon."
    "[ros]朝老篷车旁那堆行李袋挥了挥手。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:966
translate chinese castle1changes_d1257d02:

    # "She gestured over to a pile of supplies next to a tent."
    "她指了指帐篷旁的一大堆行李袋。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:972
translate chinese castle1changes_b66d2967:

    # "[cla] appeared from a nearby tent, holding a clipboard, glancing over the supplies."
    "[cla]从附近帐篷里探出头来，手里拿着一个文件夹，瞥了瞥物资。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:973
translate chinese castle1changes_7ad92ea6:

    # cla "That’s correct. [rub] told us everything, and we wanted to support the cause."
    cla "没错。[rub]把一切都告诉了我们，而我们也想出一份力。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:974
translate chinese castle1changes_301ddcdd:

    # "I reached for a bag. The weight of food and supplies was far more than I expected."
    "我伸手拿一个袋子，掂了掂，食物和补给品的重量远超我的预期。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:976
translate chinese castle1changes_364da04c:

    # mc "Wow, everyone… Thank you so much!"
    mc "哇……真的非常感谢大家！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:983
translate chinese castle1changes_49ac0cca:

    # rub "It’s the least we can do. You’ve done all the hard work so far."
    rub "只是做了些微不足道的小事罢了。你做的比我们多得多，也难得多。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:985
translate chinese castle1changes_c05c6f44:

    # mox "And now it’s our turn."
    mox "现在轮到我们回报你了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:987
translate chinese castle1changes_c581193f:

    # bla "If we’re going to lay low here for a while, we need to be ready for anything."
    bla "既然要在这隐蔽一段时间，我们必须做好应对一切突发状况的准备。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:989
translate chinese castle1changes_e45eb564:

    # "I nodded. Things were far from over."
    "我点了点头。事情远未结束。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:991
translate chinese castle1changes_cdff513b:

    # mox "And that’s why we’ve got all the supplies here. We’ll take shifts keeping watch. No one’s going to catch us off guard."
    mox "正因如此，我们才把所有物资都储备在这里。我们会轮流站岗放哨，警戒周围，绝不出一点纰漏。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:995
translate chinese castle1changes_849203de:

    # mor "Though I can’t help but wonder… what exactly is the plan from here?"
    mor "我还是有个问题……接下来究竟该怎么办？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:996
translate chinese castle1changes_ff029e48:

    # "Her eyes flicked between the group, assessing."
    "她的目光扫视着我们，审视着。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:999
translate chinese castle1changes_c325516b:

    # but "For now, rest. You especially, [mor]. You’re clearly not at full strength."
    but "现在先休息吧。特别是你，[mor]。你显然还没恢复到最佳状态。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1001
translate chinese castle1changes_23d62ce9:

    # mor "Astute observation. Decades in a cell will do that to a person."
    mor "你观察力挺敏锐的。在牢房里待上几十年，是匹马都会变成这样。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1003
translate chinese castle1changes_f27ca4c9:

    # "Her gaze shifted to me, lingering for a moment longer than I was comfortable with."
    "她将目光转向了我，死死地盯着我，时间长到让我心里发毛。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1008
translate chinese castle1changes_1c991635:

    # hon "Y’all a morphling, right? If you’re fixin’ to rebuild that strength, do it without draining any of our reserves. That’s a hard no."
    hon "你是幻形灵吧？别用我们的“储备”来恢复你的力量。这绝对不行。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1009
translate chinese castle1changes_7c548466:

    # mox "Yeah! No sucking the life out of us, thank you!"
    mox "对！别想着吸干我们的大男孩，谢谢！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1010
translate chinese castle1changes_4f35ec46:

    # "[mox] puffed up dramatically, placing her hands on her hips as if to make herself look more formidable. Guess she doesn’t like [mor] in this universe either."
    "[mox]突然挺起胸膛，双手叉腰，仿佛要让自己显得更威风。看来在这个宇宙里，她也不喜欢[mor]。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1012
translate chinese castle1changes_b453710e:

    # mor "Relax, all of you. I’ve already assured your golden boy here I’m not a threat. But I do expect to be useful in the future, and for that... well, I may need to get creative."
    mor "放松点，各位。我向这小子保证过了，不会对你们构成威胁的。不过我确实期待未来能给你们派上用场——为此嘛……我可能得想点办法。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1013
translate chinese castle1changes_b926b7bb:

    # mc "Creative how?"
    mc "什么办法？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1015
translate chinese castle1changes_e9311da0:

    # mor "Oh, you’ll see."
    mor "哦~，你会知道的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1018
translate chinese castle1changes_193bac01:

    # "Her lips curled into an enigmatic smile as she left to rest at a nearby tent."
    "她嘴角勾起一抹神秘的微笑，随后走向附近的帐篷休息去了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1026
translate chinese castle1changes_6f400925:

    # mox "She’s... intense, huh?"
    mox "她很……强势，对吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1027
translate chinese castle1changes_0c72cc6a:

    # pen "That’s one word for it."
    pen "可以这么说。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1028
translate chinese castle1changes_a60a974b:

    # lil "[mc]… You know who that is, right? I might have reconsidered releasing you if I knew…"
    lil "[mc]……你知道那是谁吧？要是早知道你和她同一间牢房的话，我或许会重新考虑越狱的事……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1029
translate chinese castle1changes_eda51167:

    # mc "More than you could ever know, [lil]."
    mc "对她，我知道的比你还多，[lil]。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1030
translate chinese castle1changes_1f5778af:

    # mc "I know she won’t be everyone’s favourite person to bunk with right now, but if she’s on our side… that’s a hell of a card to play."
    mc "我知道她现在未必是大家最想同住的对象，但如果她站在我们这边……这将是张王牌。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1032
translate chinese castle1changes_56f98eee:

    # pen "You’re assuming she stays on our side."
    pen "你这是在赌，赌她会站在我们这边。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1033
translate chinese castle1changes_91d2d3c3:

    # mc "It’s a gamble, sure. But if we’re going to pull this off, we need all the firepower we can get. And she’s a lot of firepower."
    mc "确实是在赌。但若想成功，我们需要能调动的力量。而她本身就是强大的力量。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1035
translate chinese castle1changes_3bc90833:

    # lil "Nghh, we’re not going to fight the Queen if that’s what you’re suggesting."
    lil "唔，我们是不会和女王战斗的——如果你是这个意思的话。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1037
translate chinese castle1changes_7d31bdc6:

    # mox "What exactly is the plan?"
    mox "计划具体是什么？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1039
translate chinese castle1changes_8090ab0b:

    # pen "That… I’m still figuring out. Take five for now."
    pen "那个……我还在琢磨这事呢。先休息五分钟吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1043
translate chinese castle1changes_9f2ea604:

    # "The group disperses to relax and eat some food. I have some time to wait for [but] to brew that potion for me too. I should take the time to catch up with everyone and see how they’re doing."
    "我们解散休息，享用热腾腾的食物。[but]正在熬她说的药，得要上一段时间。趁现在，我该抽空和大家聊聊，看看她们近况如何。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1048
translate chinese c1m1_97ed7590:

    # mox "You worked so hard, just to be imprisoned… All your hard work leading to that… I feel so awful for you."
    mox "你这么努力，却落得被囚禁的下场……所有辛劳竟归于此……我为你感到无比难过。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1049
translate chinese c1m1_72b2271c:

    # mc "Look on the bright side. All my hard work led to {i}this{/i} around us right now. Friends for life."
    mc "往好处想。我所有的努力，才造就了此刻我们身边的{i}这一切{/i}。一群永远的朋友。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1051
translate chinese c1m1_6a86ad0e:

    # mox "And potentially fugitives for life too. You should have heard the hard conversations and arguments we had before we all ultimately agreed to come and help you."
    mox "说不定我们还得当一辈子逃犯。你真该听听我们之前那些讨论和争执，最后才终于同意来救你。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1052
translate chinese c1m1_92e36a0f:

    # mox "In the end, we all choose to put out faith in you, not the Queen. We know we can’t just sit around waiting for the darkness to consume us."
    mox "最终，我们选择将信任寄托于你，而非女王。我们深知不能坐以待毙，任由黑暗吞噬我们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1054
translate chinese c1m1_47433533:

    # mox "A lot of the girls are taking big risks due to family and friends they have living in Arcadia, but I think it’s those things on the line that are motivating them to see this through the end."
    mox "许多女孩正因在Arcadia生活着的亲友而承担巨大风险，但我认为正是这些牵挂驱使她们坚持到底。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1055
translate chinese c1m1_deba4a1a:

    # mox "They’d rather latch onto hope of a better future than continue to wade through the status quo."
    mox "她们宁愿抓住对美好未来的希望，也不愿继续在现状中挣扎前行。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1056
translate chinese c1m1_dea5ad25:

    # mc "Why do you personally choose to follow me? Particularly as someone that isn’t a virtue."
    mc "你为何选择相信我？我不是什么值得学习的榜样。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1058
translate chinese c1m1_ffc18d00:

    # mox "Other than the fact I love you? I feel… some kind of connection to [sel] that I find hard to put into words."
    mox "我爱你，除此之外呢？我感觉……我和[sel]之间存在某种难以言喻的羁绊。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1060
translate chinese c1m1_8fe65668:

    # mox "I know that she tried to contact you. That couldn’t have been for nothing."
    mox "我知道她曾试图和你建立联系。这绝非毫无缘由。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1061
translate chinese c1m1_69d3f32e:

    # mc "My thoughts exactly. Although, I’m left wondering…"
    mc "我也是这么想的。不过，我忍不住在想……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1062
translate chinese c1m1_68eb0c0c:

    # mc "If the Queen felt that strongly about [sel] contacting me, maybe she had a point?"
    mc "如果女王对[sel]联系我如此在意，或许确实有她的道理？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1063
translate chinese c1m1_73f6f58b:

    # mc "What if I’ve been fooled into following an evil villain’s plan this entire time?"
    mc "如果我一直被愚弄着，在执行某个邪恶反派的计划呢？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1065
translate chinese c1m1_17f1f229:

    # mox "You think [sel] might be deceiving us?"
    mox "你觉得[sel]可能在欺骗我们？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1066
translate chinese c1m1_dac96f51:

    # mc "I… don’t know… It doesn’t really make sense, does it? Why would she ask me to gather a bunch of powerful heroes."
    mc "我……不知道……这说不通吧？她为什么要让我召集一群强大的英雄？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1068
translate chinese c1m1_6b9016fe:

    # mox "I wish we knew more… but, I don’t think [sel] is evil. Call it a hunch, but ever since you mentioned she was my ancestor and I started practicing that new type of magic, I can’t help but feel a connection."
    mox "真希望我们能了解更多……不过，我不认为[sel]是邪恶的。姑且称之为预感吧，自从你说她是我类似于祖先的角色，而我开始练习那种新魔法后，我总觉得我们之间存在某种联系。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1069
translate chinese c1m1_a778878d:

    # mc "Your little light show down at the prison was really impressive!"
    mc "你在监狱里那场小型灯光秀真是精彩！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1071
translate chinese c1m1_4ad56ac9:

    # mox "That’s a perfect example. I put a little of that lunar magic into it!"
    mox "那真是绝佳的例子。我可是往里面注入了些许月之魔法呢！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1072
translate chinese c1m1_050c1cc2:

    # mc "Is that what you’re going to call it?"
    mc "这就是你给它起的名字？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1074
translate chinese c1m1_cf25ff86:

    # mox "Yeah, 'lunar' magic... I like the sound of it!"
    mox "是啊，“月之”魔法……听起来真不错！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1076
translate chinese c1m1_330a67be:

    # mox "I'm going to grab a bite to eat. Rest up, okay?"
    mox "我去吃点东西。你好好休息，好吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1077
translate chinese c1m1_93dfa314:

    # mc "Will do."
    mc "好。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1084
translate chinese c1m1_7353abfe:

    # lil "I am so, so sorry that things turned out this way."
    lil "事情竟会变成这样，我实在非常非常抱歉。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1085
translate chinese c1m1_b480afc2:

    # mc "Come on, [lil], you don’t have to apologize. Just having you here says volumes."
    mc "别这样，[lil]，你不必道歉。有你在就足够说明一切了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1087
translate chinese c1m1_70eeff23:

    # lil "I came to break you out of your prison in largely the same way you broke me out of mine…"
    lil "我来解救你脱离囚笼的方式，与你当年解救我脱离囚笼的方式，几乎如出一辙……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1088
translate chinese c1m1_3f680528:

    # lil "You gave me a second chance of life. I wanted to return the favor."
    lil "你给了我重生的机会，我本想回报这份恩情。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1089
translate chinese c1m1_89e261e5:

    # mc "But there's more to it than that, isn't there?"
    mc "但事情远不止于此，对吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1091
translate chinese c1m1_de2ceae0:

    # lil "You're right... I’m sure the Queen has a justification for her actions, and I do pity the struggles she’s had to go through as the leader of this country."
    lil "你说得对……我确信女王的所作所为自有其道理，我也确实同情她作为国家领袖所经历的种种艰辛。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1093
translate chinese c1m1_223b69e8:

    # lil "She’s had to make some extremely difficult decisions for the betterment of the country, and while at times they have been controversial, I believe she’s always had good intentions."
    lil "她曾为国家的未来做出过极其艰难的抉择，尽管这些决定有时引发争议，但我相信她始终怀有善意。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1095
translate chinese c1m1_5b272682:

    # lil "But… this time, I think she’s wrong."
    lil "但是……这次，我觉得她错了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1096
translate chinese c1m1_ae77385f:

    # lil "If I can’t rely on her, I need to rely on myself, and I don’t want to make the same mistakes she did."
    lil "如果不能依靠她，我就必须依靠自己，而且我不想重蹈她的覆辙。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1098
translate chinese c1m1_8ef5b39b:

    # lil "I’m going to listen to my heart and rise up to the occasion to become the leader this group needs."
    lil "我将追随内心，挺身而出，成为这个团队需要的领袖。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1099
translate chinese c1m1_b9af00f1:

    # mc "You have my vote of confidence, captain."
    mc "我对你表示信任，老大。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1101
translate chinese c1m1_9e29e218:

    # lil "Awhh... Thank you, [mc]. You're the heart of all of this."
    lil "啊……谢谢你，[mc]。你才是这一切的核心。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1108
translate chinese c1m1_421afe42:

    # pen "Quite the heist we pulled off there, don’t you think, [penmc]?"
    pen "我们这次干的可真是场惊天大劫案啊，你说是不是呀，[penmc]？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1109
translate chinese c1m1_360de9fc:

    # mc "I suppose I missed most of it! Damn. The plan utilized [lil]’s position as the Queen’s student?"
    mc "看来我错过了大部分内容！真可惜。这个计划利用了[lil]作为女王学生的身份？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1111
translate chinese c1m1_063b92be:

    # pen "We actually had a variety of plans that we were juggling simultaneously."
    pen "我们其实同时在实行多种不同的计划。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1112
translate chinese c1m1_a3c94a1f:

    # pen "[mox] and [rik] worked together to identify the cell you were in, so we already had the brute force approach in mind."
    pen "[mox]和[rik]合作确定了你所在的牢房，因此我们先前考虑的是比较暴力的方案。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1113
translate chinese c1m1_0191bbbc:

    # pen "But we really lucked out with [lil]’s political standing."
    pen "但我们真的很幸运，[lil]的政治地位帮了大忙。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1114
translate chinese c1m1_a7822e75:

    # pen "By merely claiming that the Queen had sent her to personally question you, we got handed the key on a silver platter."
    pen "仅凭声称女王派她亲自来审问你，我们就轻而易举地得到了钥匙。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1115
translate chinese c1m1_2930148e:

    # pen "It was a risky move. If they knew the connection between you and [lil], we'd have to move to plan B, but we lucked out."
    pen "这是招险棋。要是他们发现你和[lil]的关系，我们就得启动B计划，不过我们运气不错。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1116
translate chinese c1m1_2f0af799:

    # pen "After that, it was as easy as rushing to your cell and rushing out using the shortest route available."
    pen "之后，事情就变得简单了——冲进你的牢房，再沿着最近的撤离路线冲出去。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1118
translate chinese c1m1_2c316e67:

    # pen "Although… [mor] wasn’t part of the plan."
    pen "虽然吧……[mor]不在我们的计划之内。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1120
translate chinese c1m1_2220f840:

    # pen "[mc], didn’t you say I was a morphling in your last universe?"
    pen "[mc]，你不是说我在你的上个宇宙里是个幻形灵吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1121
translate chinese c1m1_3b717ff3:

    # mc "That’s right, pitch-dark chitin with a dark green mane."
    mc "没错，漆黑的甲壳配上深绿色的鬃毛。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1123
translate chinese c1m1_7f697c7a:

    # pen "Goodness… I haven’t met any morphlings before in this universe, they’re quite a secluded bunch living in Eidolon Spire far north of here."
    pen "天哪……我在这片宇宙里从未遇见过幻形灵，他们十分喜欢隐居，住在远在北方彼端的Eidolon Spire里。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1124
translate chinese c1m1_2555a218:

    # pen "I don’t think they’re indulged in many of the modern advancements of society. Whether that’s due to stubbornness or lack of access, I can’t say."
    pen "我认为他们并未享受社会诸多现代进步的成果。至于这究竟源于固执己见还是缺乏接触机会，我无法断言。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1125
translate chinese c1m1_3dc9fd40:

    # pen "But I do know that their society have struggled since their failure to raid Arcadia and overthrow the Queen. I guess we both know how that turned out."
    pen "但我确实知道，自从他们未能攻陷Arcadia并推翻女王后，他们的社会就陷入了困境。我想我们都清楚那场行动最终的结果。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1126
translate chinese c1m1_886465e5:

    # pen "What do you think? You actually defeated her once, right?"
    pen "你觉得呢？你确实打败过她一次，对吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1127
translate chinese c1m1_d87b4818:

    # mc "She’s not the same [mor] I knew. This one seems to have significantly cooled off from her time in prison. Although her resentment towards the Queen is apparent as ever, she’s smart enough to know her limits."
    mc "她已非我所熟识的那个[mor]。她似乎在狱中沉淀后变得冷静了许多。尽管她对女王的怨恨依旧昭然若揭，但她足够聪明，懂得自知之明。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1128
translate chinese c1m1_7050e45f:

    # mc "That said, I want us to keep a close eye on her. She’s an ally for now, but could backstab us at any time, especially as she’s recovering her strength."
    mc "话虽如此，我觉得我们还是应该小心她。她目前是我们的盟友，但随时可能背叛我们，尤其是在她正在恢复力量的时候。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1130
translate chinese c1m1_dc4de1ad:

    # pen "Quite… I couldn’t sense her when she first arrived, but since she started resting in that tent, the magical pressure she exerts has been building."
    pen "确实……她刚来时我并未察觉，但自从她在那顶帐篷里休整后，她散发的魔法的压迫感便在不断增强。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1131
translate chinese c1m1_d7f3fa38:

    # mc "Is that what I've been feeling? I guess she's still technically an alicorn."
    mc "这不就是我一直以来的感受吗？我想她严格来说还是只类似于天角兽的存在。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1132
translate chinese c1m1_1d7317aa:

    # pen "I hope she plays nice…"
    pen "希望她别对我们耍花招……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1139
translate chinese c1m1_c5df39c2:

    # but "I’m still brewing that potion for you. I wanted to make enough for a few people, so it’ll take longer than usual."
    but "我还在为你熬制那瓶药剂。我想为大家多做几份药水，所以比平时要花更长时间。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1140
translate chinese c1m1_8c1d0a47:

    # mc "These are ingredients from Nevermore Forest, right?"
    mc "这些是来自无尽森林的素材，对吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1142
translate chinese c1m1_80a165b8:

    # but "Yeah, I suppose you must be a little geographically blind after being thrown from the city to the prison. We’re currently west of Arcadia, those woods we're currently in {i}are{/i} Nevermore Forest."
    but "是啊，被从城里扔到监狱里，想必你对地理位置有点模糊了吧。我们现在位于Arcadia以西，眼前{i}这片树林{/i}就是无尽森林。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1143
translate chinese c1m1_aeb47594:

    # mc "Huh, really? For some reason I thought we were to the east."
    mc "咦，真的吗？我总觉得我们是在东边呢。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1145
translate chinese c1m1_626cf484:

    # but "Nah, we’re currently closer to minotaur territory than pony territory. That’ll prevent anyone from Arcadia from freely poking their noses around here, they’d have to get permission first."
    but "不，我们现在离牛头人领地比小马领地更近。这样就能阻止Arcadia的追兵们随意在这儿乱晃，他们得先申请许可才行。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1146
translate chinese c1m1_046b5d2e:

    # mc "Are {i}we{/i} safe? We’ve got minotaur mountains one side, and the evil forest on the other."
    mc "{i}我们{/i}安全吗？一边是牛头人出没的山脉，另一边则是邪恶的森林。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1148
translate chinese c1m1_9c2e61bb:

    # but "The minotaurs are lovely folk and we’ll be fine on the forest’s outskirts."
    but "牛头人其实是个很友善的种族，我们在森林边缘会很安全的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1149
translate chinese c1m1_d53c1fbe:

    # but "The real dangers are lurking deep in the forest. If you don’t run into any Ursa Majors, you could stumble into the darkness pocket in Old Arcadia."
    but "真正的危险潜伏在森林深处。若运气不好的话，说不定就会闯进老Arcadia的黑暗口袋。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1150
translate chinese c1m1_40e2b6ce:

    # mc "Oh yeah, I’ve heard that mentioned before. How exactly did this forest get its name and reputation? There was nothing quite like this in my universe."
    mc "哦，是啊，我以前也听说过这个说法。这片森林究竟是如何得名并声名远扬的？在我所处的宇宙里，可找不到类似的存在。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1152
translate chinese c1m1_554d8b68:

    # but "The story of Nevermore Forest goes back centuries, back when Old Arcadia was, well… just Arcadia!"
    but "无尽森林的故事可追溯至数个世纪前，那时老Arcadia还是……Arcadia！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1153
translate chinese c1m1_2606c246:

    # but "It was over one thousand years ago and history books are surprisingly sparse on the details, but what I do know is that a great battle erupted."
    but "那已是千余年前的往事，史书对此鲜有记载，但我知道一场伟大的战役爆发了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1154
translate chinese c1m1_ea8be8be:

    # but "Arcadia's previous rulers tried to use that magic to protect their kingdom. They cast a massive barrier spell around the forest to ward off invaders, but... something went wrong."
    but "Arcadia的昔日统治者曾试图运用一种魔法守护王国。他们在森林周围施展了巨大的屏障法术以抵御入侵者，然而……出了差错。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1155
translate chinese c1m1_3b30c38e:

    # mc "Wrong how?"
    mc "什么差错？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1157
translate chinese c1m1_e6c831f3:

    # but "No one’s entirely sure. Some say the magic of the barrier was corrupted, along with everything contained within."
    but "无马能完全确定。有马说屏障的魔法被玷污了，连同屏障内的一切。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1158
translate chinese c1m1_ac807024:

    # but "Others believe the barrier was simply shattered. Either way, the forest became... twisted."
    but "另一些人则认为那道屏障已被彻底粉碎。无论如何，森林变得……扭曲了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1159
translate chinese c1m1_dbef3884:

    # mc "And the name? 'Nevermore'?"
    mc "名字呢？“无尽？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1161
translate chinese c1m1_625e10ad:

    # but "It’s from an old Arcadian saying: 'Once into the forest, never more shall you return.' Some bard probably thought it sounded poetic and catchy."
    but "这源自Arcadia先人们的古老谚语：“一旦踏入了这座森林，便永无归途之路。”想必是某位吟游诗马觉得这句听起来既富有诗意又朗朗上口。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1162
translate chinese c1m1_ed02aa33:

    # mc "Cheery. So, what’s this about a darkness pocket in Old Arcadia?"
    mc "真够欢快的。那么，老Arcadia的黑暗口袋又是怎么回事？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1164
translate chinese c1m1_fabd5af8:

    # but "I thought that might have been the center of the blast, but it turns out the darkness came much later."
    but "我原以为那可能是黑暗爆发的中心，但后来才发现黑暗其实来得更晚。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1165
translate chinese c1m1_abe64615:

    # but "Of course, it's a little strange to acknowledge that there seem to be two different sources of corruption here. Whatever twisted this forest a thousand years ago, and now this more dangerous, modern scourge, 'darkness.'"
    but "当然，承认这里似乎存在两种不同的不详源头确实有些奇怪。无论是什么在千年前扭曲了这片森林，如今又出现了更危险也更现代的祸患——“黑暗”。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1166
translate chinese c1m1_a49bf5ec:

    # but "You can only imagine the conflicting rumors and tales. The most popular suggests Old Arcadia is where the corruption started, and the darkness is simply a more condensed variant."
    but "你只能通过那些相互矛盾的传闻与传说来猜测。最流行的说法认为，森林的腐败始于老Arcadia，而黑暗不过是其更浓缩的形态罢了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1167
translate chinese c1m1_f8941657:

    # but "And whatever caused it is still waiting there, festering."
    but "而无论是什么导致了这一切，它依然在那里等待着，不断地恶化。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1168
translate chinese c1m1_bd84748f:

    # mc "Waiting? For what?"
    mc "等待？等待什么？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1170
translate chinese c1m1_05d3edaa:

    # but "Who knows? Revenge? Power? A snack? I’m not exactly lining up to find out."
    but "谁知道呢？复仇？权力？还是零食？反正我不打算去探个究竟。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1171
translate chinese c1m1_80003f98:

    # "She laughed nervously, then gestured toward the bubbling cauldron beside her."
    "她紧张地笑了一下，随即朝身旁冒泡的坩埚示意。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1172
translate chinese c1m1_829aa10b:

    # but "Anyway, the forest’s nature results in plenty of rare ingredients if you know where to look. But don’t get any ideas about wandering in there alone. Even the outskirts can get dicey if you’re not careful."
    but "总之，这片森林的特性使得珍稀素材随处可见——只要你懂得去哪里寻找。但千万别妄想独自深入其中。即便在外围区域，稍有不慎也可能陷入险境。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1173
translate chinese c1m1_bfd05a99:

    # mc "Don’t worry, I have no plans to make friends with monsters. I’ll leave the forest adventures to you."
    mc "别担心，我可没打算和怪物交朋友。森林探险的事就交给你了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1175
translate chinese c1m1_61aa297c:

    # but "One more thing, [mc]..."
    but "还有一件事，[mc]....."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1177
translate chinese c1m1_c7e6f4d8:

    # but "I want to fully commit to this cause, but... I'm terrified what everyone will think if I transform... What do you think I should do?"
    but "我想全身心投入这项事业，但……我害怕自己变身后的样子会让大家怎么看……你觉得我该怎么办？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1178
translate chinese c1m1_a1466c8b:

    # mc "We're working with the Queen of the Morphlings. A few more surprises aren't going to phase this bunch."
    mc "我们都和幻形灵女王合作了，再多的意外也吓不到她们了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1179
translate chinese c1m1_982aed15:

    # mc "You do whatever you feel comfortable with, you're one of us regardless."
    mc "你做自己觉得正确的事就好，反正无论如何你都是我们的一员。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1181
translate chinese c1m1_b1790f20:

    # but "R-Right... I'll consider it. Thank you!"
    but "好-好的……我会考虑的。谢谢！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1188
translate chinese c1m1_1098150c:

    # rik "Glad you’re okay, bud. But, eck, I am not okay with the lack of leads we’ve got right now. I’m itching to do something."
    rik "老兄，你没事就好。但天啊，现在线索这么少，我实在坐不住了。我早就蠢蠢欲动了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1189
translate chinese c1m1_8e35e131:

    # rik "After seeing the way the Queen treated you. I mean, it was just so unfair. I can’t stand injustice like that."
    rik "看到女王对你的态度，我实在无法忍受。那简直太不公平了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1190
translate chinese c1m1_b5e9bc75:

    # mc "Sounds like it really lit a fire in your belly."
    mc "听起来这事真的点燃了你心中的那把火。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1192
translate chinese c1m1_898af4e9:

    # rik "I think it just put things into perspective. I've always said that if you want to get the most out of life, you need to be proactive... So here I am."
    rik "我觉得这让我看清了事物的本质。我一直认为，若想活出精彩的一生，就必须主动出击……所以，我现在才会在这里。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1194
translate chinese c1m1_522512f4:

    # rik "I’m a fugitive now. Running from the law with a ragtag group of ‘maybe’ heroes."
    rik "如今我成了逃犯。和一群堪称乌合之众的“英雄”，在法律的追捕中四处奔逃。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1195
translate chinese c1m1_8c712897:

    # mc "You sound thrilled about it."
    mc "你听起来对此很兴奋。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1197
translate chinese c1m1_e5392682:

    # rik "{i}*Grinning*{/i} Absolutely ecstatic! It's a good thing you're cute, otherwise I wouldn't be here~"
    rik "{i}*咧嘴笑*{/i} 简直爽翻天了！幸好你长得帅，不然我才不会来呢~"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1198
translate chinese c1m1_05500ff6:

    # mc "Huh?"
    mc "啊？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1200
translate chinese c1m1_53fd4013:

    # rik "Joking! Sort of… But seriously... My parents are gonna flip if this ends up plastered on the front page of every newspaper in Arcadia."
    rik "开玩笑的！不过说真的……要是这事儿被登上Arcadia每家报纸的头版，我爸妈肯定要气炸了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1201
translate chinese c1m1_0b8011db:

    # mc "Your parents? Do they live nearby?"
    mc "你父母呢？他们住得近吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1203
translate chinese c1m1_52450bda:

    # rik "No, they’re back in my hometown. A cloud city called Shimmerdale. A lot less dramatic than Arcadia, but still..."
    rik "不，他们回到了我的故乡。一座名为Shimmerdale的云之城。虽不及Arcadia那般壮丽，但依然……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1204
translate chinese c1m1_79688a66:

    # mc "Wait. A cloud city? Like... an actual city in the sky? On clouds?"
    mc "等等。云之城？就是……建在天空里的城市？在云层上？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1206
translate chinese c1m1_d53d7ec9:

    # rik "Yup. Pegasi civilizations. We live in the clouds, build our homes there, everything."
    rik "没错。天马文明。我们栖居云端，在云层中建造家园，一切皆如此。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1207
translate chinese c1m1_6805970f:

    # rik "It’s pretty amazing when you think about it. Beautiful too, especially at sunrise."
    rik "仔细想想，其实挺壮观的。而且非常美丽，尤其是在日出的时候。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1208
translate chinese c1m1_95fb57ac:

    # mc "Okay, but... how? How do you even build architecture on clouds? How do you get bricks up there, for starters?"
    mc "好吧，但是……怎么建？云端怎么可能建造建筑？首先，砖头怎么运上去？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1210
translate chinese c1m1_c8937c7f:

    # rik "Beats me! Maybe the buildings started on the ground, and someone thought, ‘Hey, let’s lift this entire thing into the sky.’"
    rik "我也不清楚！也许建筑最初是建在地面的，后来有人突发奇想：‘嘿，咱们干脆把整栋楼抬到天上算了。’"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1211
translate chinese c1m1_5e58e01c:

    # rik "I just live there; I don’t ask too many questions."
    rik "我只是住在那儿；没问太多问题。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1212
translate chinese c1m1_d11a9ad0:

    # mc "Riiight…"
    mc "彳亍...."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1214
translate chinese c1m1_ed5263b5:

    # rik "Hey, if you ever get the chance, you should visit. It’s not exactly a quick trip, though — gotta have wings or a ride to get up there."
    rik "嘿，有机会的话你真该去看看。不过这可不是趟短途旅行——得有翅膀或交通工具才能上去。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1215
translate chinese c1m1_ade66a4e:

    # mc "Maybe after we’ve dealt with all of this."
    mc "也许等我们处理完这一切之后再上去看吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1217
translate chinese c1m1_ce329d82:

    # rik "Yeah... One step at a time, right?"
    rik "嗯……一步一个脚印，对吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1224
translate chinese c1m1_6859b6f0:

    # mc "You okay, [hon]? You’ve been quiet for a while."
    mc "你还好吗，[hon]？你沉默了好一阵子。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1226
translate chinese c1m1_59eb3aa7:

    # hon "Yeah, I’m alright. Just... thinkin’. [blo]’s on my mind, y’know? Hope she’s okay out there."
    hon "嗯，我没事。只是……在想事儿。[blo]总在我脑海里萦绕，懂吗？希望她那边一切安好。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1227
translate chinese c1m1_a0b71fce:

    # mc "She’ll be alright. She's tougher than we know."
    mc "她会没事的。她比我们想象的更坚强。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1229
translate chinese c1m1_dcce9faf:

    # hon "I reckon so. But still, it’s hard not to worry."
    hon "我大概能猜到。但即便如此，我还是很难不去担心她。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1230
translate chinese c1m1_de2ca447:

    # hon "I only got a chance to leave a text, but now [pen] is saying it’s better to keep our phones off in case we get ‘tracked’."
    hon "我本来还来得及给她发条短信的，但[pen]说最好关掉手机，以免被“追踪”。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1231
translate chinese c1m1_533d9e89:

    # mc "I’m glad you’re with us despite everything."
    mc "尽管经历了一切，我很高兴你依然与我们同在。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1233
translate chinese c1m1_a95a932d:

    # hon "My pa always said, ‘If somethin’ feels right, you gotta do it.'"
    hon "我爸总说：“感觉对的事，就得去做。”"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1234
translate chinese c1m1_9338890b:

    # hon "And this all feels right, even if it’s dangerous as heck."
    hon "这一切都感觉很对，即使它危险得要命。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1235
translate chinese c1m1_a846906d:

    # mc "For what it’s worth, you’ve been amazing. Honestly, you’re probably the strongest fighter on the team."
    mc "说句公道话，你表现得非常出色。说真的，你很可能是团队里最强的战士。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1237
translate chinese c1m1_f05ced48:

    # hon "Me? Strongest? Well, I’ll be. That’s mighty nice of ya to say. (Hah, take that, [rik]!)"
    hon "我？最强？哎呀，真是的。你这么说可真够意思。（哈，听到了吧，[rik]！）"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1238
translate chinese c1m1_cf989142:

    # mc "I’m serious. You’ve got this raw strength that’s unmatched. I know earth ponies are naturally strong, but it's still crazy to see."
    mc "我是认真的。你拥有这种无人能及的原始力量。我知道陆马天生力大，但亲眼所见依然令我震惊。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1240
translate chinese c1m1_4ec6d8c6:

    # hon "Guess all that farm work paid off, huh? Buckin’ apples, haulin’ carts, mendin’ fences... Didn’t think it’d amount to much more than a strong back and a sore tail, but here we are."
    hon "看来干农活总算没白费功夫，对吧？摘苹果、拉车、修栅栏……原以为除了练就一副好脊梁和屁股疼之外没什么别的收获，没想到现在派上用场了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1241
translate chinese c1m1_6670f177:

    # mc "Looks like it amounted to a lot more than that. You’re a powerhouse out there."
    mc "看来实际情况远不止于此。你在团队里真是个实力派。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1243
translate chinese c1m1_6478b9b9:

    # hon "Don’t go blowing my head up too big now, but... thanks. Means a lot, comin’ from you."
    hon "别吹我马屁了，不过...谢谢。这话从你嘴里说出来，意义非凡。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1244
translate chinese c1m1_f42ec834:

    # mc "You’ve earned it. We’re lucky to have you with us."
    mc "你应得的。你能加入我们，我们深感荣幸。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1246
translate chinese c1m1_dd5db840:

    # hon "Well, if you and the others are this fired up about the Virtues and makin’ things right, I’ll see this through to the end."
    hon "既然你和大家对谐律精华和伸张正义这么热忱，那我就坚持到底。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1247
translate chinese c1m1_960bb596:

    # hon "Gotta admit, I’ve only ever heard the old stories about the virtues, but watchin’ y’all... Makes me think there’s something real special goin’ on here."
    hon "不得不承认，我只听过那些关于谐律精华的古老传说，但看着你们……让我觉得这里正发生着些特别的事。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1248
translate chinese c1m1_468f0a86:

    # mc "I hope so too."
    mc "但愿如此。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1255
translate chinese c1m1_04798359:

    # rub "When I first laid my eyes on you, I knew you’d be a very special man, but even this is far beyond my wildest expectations."
    rub "初见你时，我就知道你会是个传奇，但即便如此，你依然远超我最狂野的想象。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1256
translate chinese c1m1_94977155:

    # rub "Look at all the things I’ve gotten to do. The things I’ve seen! Most ponies don’t even leave their hometown, let alone get wrapped up in something like this."
    rub "看看我经历过的一切。见识了多少奇观！大多数小马连家乡都没离开过，更别说卷入这样的事了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1257
translate chinese c1m1_88a430eb:

    # mc "So, no regrets then?"
    mc "所以，无怨无悔？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1259
translate chinese c1m1_7e4df2a6:

    # rub "Not a single one, darling. I’ve accomplished everything I set out to do when I decided to follow you — met incredible people, made unforgettable memories."
    rub "当然，亲爱的。当我决定追随你时，我已完成所有立下的目标——遇见了非凡的朋友，创造了难忘的回忆。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1261
translate chinese c1m1_4581b592:

    # rub "But..."
    rub "但是..."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1262
translate chinese c1m1_98bcc197:

    # mc "But?"
    mc "但是？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1264
translate chinese c1m1_7af908e7:

    # rub "It’s just the beginning, isn’t it? There’s still so much left to do. Darkness is still out there, spreading like a cancer, threatening everything we love."
    rub "这只是开始，对吧？还有太多事情要做。黑暗依然存在，像瘟疫一样蔓延，威胁着我们所爱的一切。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1265
translate chinese c1m1_b8fd2317:

    # mc "Yeah. This fight is far from over."
    mc "是啊。这场战斗远未结束。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1267
translate chinese c1m1_19126972:

    # rub "I don’t care what it takes. I’ll do anything to protect [mel]... to protect everyone I care about. I’ve already lost too much to that darkness. It took my mother, and I’m not letting it take anything—or anyone—else."
    rub "我不在乎付出什么代价。为了保护[mel]...为了保护所有我珍视的马，我愿意付出一切。那片黑暗已经夺走太多——它夺走了我的母亲，而这次，我绝不让它再夺走任何东西——任何马。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1269
translate chinese c1m1_8751111c:

    # rub "I just wish we knew more—where the darkness started, how it spreads. Maybe then we’d have a real shot at stopping it."
    rub "我只希望我们能了解更多——黑暗从何处开始，如何蔓延。也许那样我们才有真正的机会阻止它。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1270
translate chinese c1m1_05614a4a:

    # mc "It’s strange, isn’t it? Something this big, this dangerous, and we know so little about it."
    mc "这很奇怪，不是吗？如此庞大、如此危险的事物，我们却知之甚少。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1272
translate chinese c1m1_28bf059e:

    # rub "Exactly. And you know what really grinds my gears?"
    rub "没错。你知道什么最让我抓狂吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1273
translate chinese c1m1_7cca586a:

    # rub "The rest of the world. Where are they in all this? They see what’s happening in Arcadia. They know this darkness isn’t just going to stay here forever. And yet, nothing. Almost no aid or help. They’re just sitting on their backsides, waiting for it to reach their borders."
    rub "其余的国家。他们在这场浩劫中身在何处？他们目睹着Arcadia的变故，深知这片黑暗绝不会永远困守于此。然而，他们却无动于衷。援助与救助几近于无。他们只是坐视不管，静待灾厄蔓延至自己的疆域。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1274
translate chinese c1m1_99de619c:

    # mc "Not if we can help it. We’re fighting for everyone, whether they realize it or not."
    mc "只要我们能阻止，就绝不让它发生。我们为世界而战，无论他们是否意识到。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1276
translate chinese c1m1_af60b2b8:

    # rub "For [mel]. For my mother. For all the lives this darkness has taken. I’m with you until it’s gone for good."
    rub "为[mel]。为我的母亲。为所有被这黑暗吞噬的生命。我将与你同在，直至它永远消逝。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1283
translate chinese c1m1_cea7521f:

    # bla "You know, when you told me I should start living, I wasn’t expecting my first big adventure to be... this."
    bla "你知道吗，当你说我该开始好好生活时，我真没想到马生第一场大冒险会是……这样。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1284
translate chinese c1m1_54945dff:

    # mc "Yeah, sorry. Next time I’ll schedule a safer grand debut."
    mc "嗯，抱歉。下次我会安排一个更安全的冒险。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1286
translate chinese c1m1_41f93bde:

    # bla "Seriously, though. It’s wild. Dangerous. And honestly... getting caught by those guards earlier? That hit me hard."
    bla "说真的，这太疯狂了。太危险了。而且老实说……假如真的被那些守卫抓到的了呢？真的吓到我了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1287
translate chinese c1m1_f0d1fc03:

    # mc "Why? You came out of it okay."
    mc "为什么？你不是安然无恙地出来了么？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1289
translate chinese c1m1_1b3edd2c:

    # bla "It just made me realize how useless I am to the team. I mean, everyone else has powers, skills, or at least combat experience. What do I have? Moral support? Baking skills? I’m not exactly pulling my weight."
    bla "这让我意识到自己对团队有多么无用。我是说，其他马都有魔法、专业技能，至少还有实战经验。而我呢？加油打气？烘焙手艺？我确实没能尽到自己的责任。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1290
translate chinese c1m1_8e8e6ff6:

    # mc "Sometimes, moral support is exactly what a team needs. Besides, don’t forget your not-so-secret weapon, the [cre] army."
    mc "有时，加油打气正是团队所需。别忘了你那支并非秘密的武器——[cre]军团。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1292
translate chinese c1m1_6e3fbb09:

    # bla "The [cre] army? Pfft. Call it the [bla] army instead, will you? They’re all me as well, after all."
    bla "[cre]军团？噗。不如叫它[bla]军团吧？反正那群家伙也都是我的变体。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1293
translate chinese c1m1_4c67b7fb:

    # mc "Fair enough. The [bla] army it is."
    mc "行吧。那就叫[bla]军队。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1295
translate chinese c1m1_5b7e16b3:

    # bla "It’s still surreal, though. How do you handle it? Especially considering you’re going into this just as ‘weak’ as I am."
    bla "尽管如此，这一切依然如梦似幻。你究竟是如何应对的？尤其考虑到你和我一样，都是带着同样的“脆弱”踏入这个世界的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1296
translate chinese c1m1_25b1856c:

    # mc "How do I handle it? Honestly? Sometimes, you just don’t have a choice but to handle it."
    mc "我该如何应对？说实话？有时候，你别无选择，船到桥头自然直咯。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1297
translate chinese c1m1_5a213d18:

    # bla "That’s it? You just... hang in there?"
    bla "就这样？你只是……努力坚持？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1298
translate chinese c1m1_21317b57:

    # mc "People are good at getting their shit together when it matters most. You’d be surprised what you can do when there’s no other option. Keep going forward."
    mc "人在关键时刻最能收拾好自己的烂摊子。当别无选择时，你会惊讶于自己能做到什么。继续前进吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1299
translate chinese c1m1_1c073f79:

    # mc "And of course, there's absolutely no shame in relying on your friends."
    mc "当然，依靠朋友也没什么难为情的。"

