translate chinese c1m1_7f644006:

    # pen "I... I'm at a loss..."
    pen "我……我不知道……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1592
translate chinese c1m1_ee4b36c6:

    # mor "Who’s [sel]?"
    mor "[sel]是谁？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1593
translate chinese c1m1_7986315f:

    # "I turn to see [mor] watching from the darkness. She isn’t trying to be sneaky, but it’s so dark out here that she’s almost invisible."
    "我转身看见[mor]正从黑暗中窥视着我们。她并非刻意隐匿，只是因为她实在太黑了，完全融入了黑暗之中。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1594
translate chinese c1m1_14471714:

    # mc "Stop being a creep and join us at the campfire."
    mc "别在那地方待着了，快来篝火这坐一坐吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1595
translate chinese c1m1_df6e6eba:

    # mor "I overheard you from the tent. I’ve never heard of the Queen having a sister, but I’m old enough and immersed enough in the history of this country to figure out a few things you may miss."
    mor "我在帐篷外听见了你们的谈话。我从未听说女王有妹妹，但以我的年纪和对这个国家历史的了解，倒是能补充一些你不知道的事。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1596
translate chinese c1m1_94da43cd:

    # "As [mor] approaches, [but] also scoots over a little closer, her ears perked up."
    "随着[mor]的靠近，[but]也悄悄挪近了些，竖起了耳朵。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1601
translate chinese c1m1_d91f0304:

    # hon "You got somethin’ to add, [mor]?"
    hon "有什么要补充的吗，[mor]？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1603
translate chinese c1m1_7e79c99d:

    # mor "Sit and observe."
    mor "确实是有，坐着好好听吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1604
translate chinese c1m1_d64a4e29:

    # mor "Your dear Queen is sometimes referred to as the Goddess of the Sun, no?"
    mor "你们尊贵的女王有时被尊称为日之女神，不是吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1605
translate chinese c1m1_e8aa097f:

    # pen "Correct."
    pen "是的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1607
translate chinese c1m1_0118266a:

    # mor "And her sister?"
    mor "那她的妹妹？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1608
translate chinese c1m1_bec5d0ae:

    # mc "Uhm, Princess of the Moon."
    mc "呃，月之公主。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1610
translate chinese c1m1_10c2915b:

    # mor "I knew it…"
    mor "嗯...."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1611
translate chinese c1m1_565fe559:

    # mor "The sky's really fuckin' falling..."
    mor "天真他妈要塌了……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1612
translate chinese c1m1_dd2a4e8d:

    # mor "The earthquakes you’ve been feeling? It’s not just your imagination."
    mor "记得之前的地震吗？那可不是你们想象出来的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1613
translate chinese c1m1_e02d8f9c:

    # "She shoots a quick glance up to the sky, and then at the group."
    "她迅速瞥了眼天空，又望向我们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1615
translate chinese c1m1_ecf23b1d:

    # mor "It's not really the sky, though."
    mor "不过，我说的不是真正的天空。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1616
translate chinese c1m1_be94ab9f:

    # mor "The moon is falling."
    mor "是月亮，月亮正在坠落。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1617
translate chinese c1m1_671c88f4:

    # "There’s a long moment of silence as we all process what she’s said."
    "我们都消化着她说的话，现场陷入了漫长的沉默。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1622
translate chinese c1m1_5a25876f:

    # bla "Falling? How can the moon fall?"
    bla "坠落？月亮怎会坠落？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1624
translate chinese c1m1_669c26c3:

    # mor "Simple. The moon doesn’t just move on its own. If it’s losing its place in the sky... something’s pulling it down."
    mor "很简单。月亮不会自己移动。如果它在天空中的位置不断偏移……就说明有东西在把它拉下来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1632
translate chinese c1m1_0aab517b:

    # but "That... that makes sense. The tides have been rising all over the world. I’ve seen the reports."
    but "那……那就说得通了。全球各地的海平面都在上升。我看过相关报道。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1633
translate chinese c1m1_fd513387:

    # hon "[sel]… The Moon… The {i}Darkness{/i}. This ain’t a coincidence, is it?"
    hon "[sel]……月亮……以及{i}黑暗{/i}。这绝非巧合，对吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1634
translate chinese c1m1_38f3a980:

    # pen "Everything must be related... [sel], the Virtues, the moon, the earthquakes, the relics, the darkness. It’s all connected! We’re missing something big here, something we’re not seeing."
    pen "万物必有联系……[sel]，谐律精华、月亮、地震、圣物、黑暗。一切都息息相关！我们漏了什么重要的线索，某些我们尚未察觉的存在。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1635
translate chinese c1m1_5329175d:

    # "She’s piecing together a puzzle we all have parts of, but no one knows how to finish it."
    "她正在拼凑一幅我们各自拥有拼图，但无人知晓如何完成它。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1639
translate chinese c1m1_d265498f:

    # mor "{i}Scoffing{/i} Really? That’s your big revelation? Of course, everything is related. We’re talking about forces that shake the very foundations of the world."
    mor "{i}翻了个白眼{/i} 真的？这就是你的重大发现？当然，万物皆有联系。但我们现在讨论的可是撼动世界根基的力量。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1640
translate chinese c1m1_b6b1ae82:

    # mor "But that doesn’t exactly help us figure out what to do next, does it?"
    mor "但这并不能真正帮助我们确定下一步该怎么做，对吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1641
translate chinese c1m1_04630c8f:

    # "Sharp and dismissive. She’s only been a part of this conversation for only a moment, and already, she’s pulling back from it."
    "尖锐而轻蔑。她才加入这场对话片刻，转眼间便抽身而退。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1642
translate chinese c1m1_ee93ef4c:

    # mor "There’s nothing to corroborate this in Arcadian history books. It’s pure speculation. We need something actionable."
    mor "Arcadia的历史典籍中对此毫无佐证。纯属臆测。我们需要线索。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1650
translate chinese c1m1_9989b176:

    # "[but], however, seems to catch something in the air, something that none of us were considering."
    "[but]，然而，我们似乎找到了思路，某种我们谁都没曾考虑过的东西。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1652
translate chinese c1m1_a0be6b33:

    # but "When exactly do you think [sel] existed? If she isn’t in any modern Arcadian history books, perhaps it’s worth going even further back in history than that."
    but "你认为[sel]究竟存在于何时？既然她未见于任何现代Arcadia的史书里，这就说明她比这些书还要古老。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1653
translate chinese c1m1_6fdb6b04:

    # but "Perhaps… We should consider the history of Old Arcadia, deep within Nevermore Forest."
    but "或许……我们应当探究无尽森林的深处，老Arcadia的历史。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1655
translate chinese c1m1_e9401ed6:

    # pen "The Old Arcadian Isolation Zone? It’s covered in darkne – Ooohhh… Oh!"
    pen "老Arcadia隔离区？但那里充斥着黑暗——哦……我懂了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1657
translate chinese c1m1_9c8444cc:

    # but "Precisely."
    but "就是你想的那样。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1659
translate chinese c1m1_a28d9112:

    # bla "Sorry, I’m a little slow. Can you guys tell me so I can be shocked too?"
    bla "抱歉，我这个CPU不太行。你们能告诉我到底怎么回事吗？这样我也能一起震惊一下。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1660
translate chinese c1m1_05892011:

    # "At this point, [mox] and [lil] were listening in too."
    "此时，[mox]和[lil]也竖起耳朵偷听了起来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1662
translate chinese c1m1_3ccc6b3a:

    # pen "Essentially, the Old Arcadian castle is currently experiencing a bizarre phenomenon of isolated darkness."
    pen "说白了，老Arcadia的城堡目前正发生着一种离奇的现象——区域性黑暗。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1663
translate chinese c1m1_33993a7d:

    # pen "Scientists took this as an opportunity to study the darkness, just deeming it to be abnormal and nothing else."
    pen "科学家们借此机会研究黑暗现象，但最终仅将其认定为异常现象，别无它意。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1665
translate chinese c1m1_da19d999:

    # pen "However, if we’re to believe that someone is capable of moving the moon, then would it really be so much of a reach to say that they wouldn’t be able to control the darkness too?"
    pen "然而，倘若我们认定确实有某种存在的力量大到能够移动月亮，那么说它无法掌控黑暗，真的合理吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1673
translate chinese c1m1_48b0cd4d:

    # lil "Of course! Something must have exerted its power to blanket that specific area in darkness."
    lil "当然！必定有某种存在施展了法术，将那片特定区域笼罩在了黑暗之中。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1681
translate chinese c1m1_9be402ce:

    # pen "Call it wishful thinking, but it sounds like someone was trying to cover up something that could pose a threat."
    pen "姑且这么认为吧，但听起来像是有东西试图掩盖可能构成对它构成威胁的关键区域。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1689
translate chinese c1m1_b9bc6424:

    # hon "Relics… The relics?"
    hon "圣物....难道真是圣物吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1690
translate chinese c1m1_083fc948:

    # mox "It could be! It had to be something, at least! We need to regroup with everyone immediately."
    mox "说不定呢！至少这种现象总得有个原因吧！我们必须立刻集合。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1694
translate chinese c1m1_969bd042:

    # mor "Now… Hold on… What makes you so confident?"
    mor "等等……你凭什么这么认为？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1695
translate chinese c1m1_63247b2a:

    # mor "For one, these things could be completely unrelated. How can we be certain that these relics are going to be there?"
    mor "第一，它们之间可能完全不存在关联。我们怎么能确定这些圣物会存在于那里呢？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1696
translate chinese c1m1_3bf693f6:

    # mor "And two, haven't you considered that it's a little too obvious? The one threat you have in miles, and they shine a spotlight on it with their powers?"
    mor "第二，你难道没觉得这有点太刻意了吗？方圆数百里内对它的唯一威胁，它竟然用能力将那片区域标了出来？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1704
translate chinese c1m1_56b2910a:

    # pen "{i}*Sigh*{/i} You have a point, [mor], but this is the only lead we have. We now know someone’s been actively working against us. [mc]’s confirmed it."
    pen "{i}*叹气*{/i} 你说在理，[mor]，但这是我们唯一的线索。现在我们知道有某种存在一直在暗中破坏着我们的行动。而[mc]已经证实了这一猜测。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1705
translate chinese c1m1_43118f8e:

    # pen "This isn’t just some random event. If darkness is there, in that old, abandoned castle, then there may something there. Something important. We need to go and figure it out."
    pen "这绝非偶然。若黑暗特意盘踞在那座废弃的古老城堡中，那么那里或许藏着什么十分重要的东西。我们必须前去查个水落石出。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1707
translate chinese c1m1_913f3d2f:

    # bla "So, we’re really about to go into the that darkness?"
    bla "所以，我们真的要踏入那个地方吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1715
translate chinese c1m1_16637a11:

    # mox "I don’t know about you, but I’m all for breaking some more rules if it gets us closer to solving this mess."
    mox "我不知道你怎么看，但我觉得只要能让我们能接近真相，打破更多规则也无妨。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1716
translate chinese c1m1_7aed60a7:

    # lil "If this is our next step, we’ll need to be ready. None of us have ever faced anything like this before. We’ll need to make sure everyone’s on the same page and prepare for whatever’s out there."
    lil "如果这是我们的下一步行动，我们必须做好准备。我们从未经历过类似的情况。必须确保所有马团结一致，为所有可能出现的情况做好准备。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1721
translate chinese c1m1_64f1156b:

    # mor "And how exactly do you propose we prepare? You can’t even figure out what’s causing the disturbances. For all we know, this ‘darkness’ could be a trap."
    mor "那你们具体打算怎么准备？连骚乱的根源都查不出来。说不定这所谓的“黑暗区域”根本就是个陷阱。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1722
translate chinese c1m1_ace68de7:

    # "Her doubt lingers in the air, but she’s not outright dismissing the idea — just being pragmatic. It’s annoying, but I understand her need for caution."
    "她的猜测是对的，但并未完全否定这个想法——她只是比较务实而已。虽说这很令人恼火，但我也能理解她谨慎的必要性。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1725
translate chinese c1m1_9ae06581:

    # pen "Then we’ll face it head-on. We’re not just going to sit here and wait for the rest of the world to burn. If we’re right, and the relics are tied to that darkness, then we have a chance. A real one."
    pen "那么我们就迎难而上。我们不会坐以待毙，眼睁睁看着世界陷入火海。如果我们判断正确，那些圣物确实被那股黑暗所保护着，那么我们就有机会去获得它。真正的机会。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1726
translate chinese c1m1_62d1afa0:

    # mor "Hmph... Very well. I'll accompany you and 'hope for the best'."
    mor "哼……勇气可嘉。我就陪你一起去吧，“祝我们好运”。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1727
translate chinese c1m1_876e6e59:

    # "There’s an unspoken agreement — this is our best shot, our only shot. Even [mor] can’t argue with that."
    "我们之间存在着一种默契——这是我们最好的机会，也是唯一的机会。就连[mor]也无法反驳这一点。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1731
translate chinese c1m1_9d5121ea:

    # lil "Alright, everyone in? I’ll let the others know that we’ll be leaving soon."
    lil "好了，大家都到齐了吗？我会通知其他马我们出发的消息。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1736
translate chinese c1m1_c7b0f942:

    # "The ground beneath us suddenly rumbles, a deep, guttural vibration that rises into a violent quake. The fire flickers wildly, casting jagged shadows across everyone’s startled faces."
    "大地骤然轰鸣，低沉如喉音般震颤逐渐升腾为剧烈震动。火焰狂乱地跳动，在我们惊惶的面容上投下参差不齐的阴影。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1740
translate chinese c1m1_08b521f2:

    # mox "What the—?!"
    mox "什么鬼——?!"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1741
translate chinese c1m1_40b29778:

    # "[mox] grabs the edge of the log she’s sitting on, struggling to keep her balance, I move over to help her."
    "[mox]扶着她坐着的树干，努力保持着平衡，我走过去帮她。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1744
translate chinese c1m1_8c8f8707:

    # hon "Hold on! It’ll pass!"
    hon "别担心！过会就停了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1747
translate chinese c1m1_06044eaa:

    # "But it doesn’t pass—not immediately. The quake intensifies, shaking the trees around us and sending loose branches crashing to the ground. The air fills with the sharp crack of splintering wood and the unsettling groan of the earth shifting beneath us."
    "但地震并未停止——至少没有立刻停止。地震变得愈发剧烈，周围的树木剧烈摇晃，松动的树枝轰然坠地。空气中充斥着木头碎裂的尖锐爆裂声，以及脚下大地蠕动时令人不安的轰隆声。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1755
translate chinese c1m1_51bc464a:

    # but "This isn’t normal! This is—this is wrong!"
    but "这不正常！这——这很不对劲！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1756
translate chinese c1m1_5bbda416:

    # pen "This quake... is it fucking centered on {i}us{/i}?!"
    pen "这场地震……震中就在{i}我们{/i}这里？！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1757
translate chinese c1m1_e9b5e327:

    # mc "Are you telling me the moon is specifically approaching us right now?! Why is it coming closer?!"
    mc "你是说月亮此刻正朝着我们靠近？！为什么？！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1759
translate chinese c1m1_29420af4:

    # mor "If you needed a sign that time’s running out, consider this one gift-wrapped. We need to move."
    mor "若你正需要一个信号来提醒你时间不多了，这就是那个信号。我们必须马上行动。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1767
translate chinese c1m1_24b4718c:

    # bla "I second that! I don’t feel like sticking around for an encore!"
    bla "我赞成！我可不想留下来看这种表演！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1772
translate chinese c1m1_4166feec:

    # "The quake starts to subside, leaving an eerie, oppressive silence in its wake. Everyone exchanges nervous glances, the implications of what just happened sinking in."
    "地震逐渐平息，留下诡异而压抑的寂静。我们紧张的望着彼此，大家渐渐意识到了地震的原因。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1773
translate chinese c1m1_6a3263af:

    # mox "{i}*Gulp*{/i} Something's listening in on us..."
    mox "{i}*咕噜*{/i} 有东西在偷听我们……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1774
translate chinese c1m1_bb77c56c:

    # hon "Alright, listen up. If we’re gonna do this, we do it now. Thirty minutes to pack up and gear up. We head into Nevermore Forest as soon as we’re ready."
    hon "听着，既然决定要行动，那就现在动身。三十分钟收拾装备整装待发，准备就绪后立刻进军无尽森林。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1775
translate chinese c1m1_326ec43c:

    # mox "Guess we’re skipping the warmup. Straight into the boss fight, huh?"
    mox "看来我们跳过了热身环节，直接进入BOSS战了，是吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1782
translate chinese c1m1_9ff467b7:

    # "[but] was already gathering her supplies, her hands moving with practiced efficiency."
    "[but]她早已开始收拾行装，双手熟练而高效地忙碌着。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1783
translate chinese c1m1_6eec2970:

    # but "We’ll need light, potions, and protection. I have a few things that might help with the darkness, but it won’t last forever."
    but "我们需要光源、药水和防护措施。我带了些能够抵御黑暗的东西，但效果不会持续太久。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1784
translate chinese c1m1_2978c97b:

    # pen "You’ll need someone on the outside. I’m going to the library to look up anything on Old Arcadia: maps, notes, anything that might give us an edge. Keep your phones on."
    pen "你们会需要外援的。我会去图书馆查阅关于老Arcadia的一切资料：地图、笔记，以及任何可能让我们获取优势的资料。保持手机开机。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1785
translate chinese c1m1_063a0c63:

    # lil "Everyone else, stick together, keep your wits about you. This forest isn’t going to make it easy for us."
    lil "大家，保持团结，保持清醒。这片森林是不会让我们轻易地放我们过去的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1789
translate chinese c1m1_dd3da0f4:

    # mor "And if the forest doesn’t, whatever’s waiting for us inside certainly will."
    mor "就算森林放过了我们，潜藏其中的未知之物也不会让我们好过的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1792
translate chinese c1m1_c14a5d29:

    # "The group disperses quickly, everyone moving with purpose. The camp transforms from a place of rest to a hive of activity. I move toward a tent, gathering some of my own gear as I overhear snippets of conversation."
    "队伍迅速散开，个个都行动果断。营地从休憩之态转变成一片忙碌的景象。我走向帐篷，整理自己的装备时，耳畔飘来零星的交谈声。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1799
translate chinese c1m1_64922c2f:

    # hon "Got enough time to brew somethin’ strong, [but]? We’ll need all the help we can get."
    hon "有没有时间再炼点药水，[but]？我们需要所有可能得帮助。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1800
translate chinese c1m1_fe7219e2:

    # but "I’ve got a few tricks up my sleeve! Just make sure we’ve got someone watching our backs while I work."
    but "我还有一些配方！只要确保有马在我们干活时帮我们警戒后方就行。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1807
translate chinese c1m1_eb8f4e39:

    # mox "You good with the light spells, [lil]? I’ve got a feeling we’re gonna need them. A lot of them."
    mox "你擅长光系魔法吗，[lil]？我总觉得我们会用得上——而且用处不少。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1808
translate chinese c1m1_99e787f1:

    # lil "Yeah, no problem. You weren’t so bad yourself at the prison. I suppose you did pick up a thing or two at your shows."
    lil "有，这个没问题。你在监狱里表现也不差嘛。想必你在那些演出中确实学到了一两招。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1815
translate chinese c1m1_763327bb:

    # bla "So… uh… just to clarify, [pen], we’re heading into the creepy darkness castle hoping to find magical relics that {i}might{/i} save us from the darkness?"
    bla "所以……呃……也就是说，[pen]，我们要闯进这座阴森的、被黑暗笼罩的城堡，希望能从其中找到魔法圣物，这个圣物{i}或许{/i}能拯救我们击败黑暗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1816
translate chinese c1m1_e579cdc0:

    # pen "Yes. That’s exactly what we’re doing."
    pen "是的。这正是我们正在做的事。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1817
translate chinese c1m1_2c6983e0:

    # bla "Cool. Cool-cool-cool. No pressure."
    bla "哇哦。哇-哇-哇哦。别-别有压力。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1824
translate chinese c1m1_f733bc50:

    # rik "You all rested now, [rub]?"
    rik "你休息好了吗，[rub]？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1825
translate chinese c1m1_12d86f68:

    # rub "Somewhat… I haven’t had the chance to do my hair, what a tragedy…"
    rub "还没……我还没梳头呢，真是悲剧啊……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1830
translate chinese c1m1_446f7ffb:

    # ros "[rub], you can leave the packing up process to us!"
    ros "[rub]，打包工作就交给我们吧！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1834
translate chinese c1m1_4a3f39c3:

    # cla "We'll take the supplies back to the brothel."
    cla "我们会把物资带回夜总会的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1838
translate chinese c1m1_7523f9d0:

    # "As I finish packing my gear, [mor] finally approaches."
    "当我打包完装备时，[mor]终于走了过来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1839
translate chinese c1m1_81070212:

    # mor "You’re sure about this, golden boy? Once we step into that forest, there’s no turning back."
    mor "你确定吗，小子？一旦踏入那片森林，就再无回头路。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1840
translate chinese c1m1_130fe475:

    # mc "I’ve been sure since the moment [sel] brought me here. If there’s even a chance I can save this world, I’m taking it."
    mc "自从[sel]带我来到这个世界的那一刻起，我就下定决心了。只要还有一丝机会能拯救这个世界，我绝不会放弃它。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1841
translate chinese c1m1_d07ce03d:

    # "She studies me for a moment before nodding, a flicker of respect in her eyes."
    "她打量了我片刻，随后点头，眼中闪过一丝敬意。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1843
translate chinese c1m1_9c0d7def:

    # mor "Good. Let’s hope your conviction’s enough to keep us alive."
    mor "好。但愿你的信念能让我们活下去。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1848
translate chinese c1m1_e2f5bc5b:

    # "Within thirty minutes, we’re assembled, the campfire now extinguished. The group stands at the edge of the forest, the towering trees looming over us."
    "三十分钟内，我们集结完毕，篝火已然熄灭。队伍伫立在森林边缘，参天古树如巨影般笼罩着我们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1851
translate chinese c1m1_3f95d12a:

    # hon "This is it, folks. Last chance to back out."
    hon "就是现在，各位。最后机会，想退出还来得及。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1854
translate chinese c1m1_40335b6c:

    # mox "And miss all the fun? Not a chance."
    mox "我才不会错过场精彩的冒险，绝不会。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1855
translate chinese c1m1_1ac8cd85:

    # "I take a deep breath and step forward."
    "我深吸一口气，迈步向前。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1856
translate chinese c1m1_d0e84450:

    # mc "Then let’s go. The answers are waiting for us."
    mc "那就出发吧。答案正在等待我们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1861
translate chinese c1m1_164e7d6b:

    # "The group moves as one, stepping into the depths of Nevermore Forest, the unknown stretching before us like an endless abyss."
    "我们的队伍步调一致，踏入无尽森林的深处，未知的领域在我们面前如无底深渊般延展。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1862
translate chinese c1m1_405d15c6:

    # "We push deeper, the thick canopy above blocking out even the moonlight. The air is heavy, the only sounds coming from our cautious footsteps and the occasional rustle of unseen creatures."
    "我们继续深入，茂密的树冠遮住了月光。空气沉闷，唯有我们谨慎的脚步声和偶尔隐约传来的生物窸窣声。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1864
translate chinese c1m1_24b41aea:

    # rik "Stay sharp. Feels like we’re being watched."
    rik "保持警惕。感觉有什么东西在监视着我们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1867
translate chinese c1m1_c4d76faf:

    # "The trees close in around us, their gnarled roots and twisted branches creating an oppressive, maze-like atmosphere. It’s as if the forest itself is alive."
    "树木密密麻麻的矗立在我们周围，它们盘根错节的树根和扭曲的枝干营造出一种令人窒息的迷宫般的氛围。仿佛森林本身活了过来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1868
translate chinese c1m1_e10d8392:

    # mc "Anyone else feel like this place doesn’t want us here?"
    mc "谁觉得这地方欢迎我们吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1870
translate chinese c1m1_9ff22203:

    # but "This is the easy part. Nevermore Forest certainly has a haunting atmosphere, but you won’t understand just how malevolent it can be until you’ve seen the darkness."
    but "这只是开端。无尽森林固然阴森可怖，但若未曾亲睹那片黑暗，你永远无法体会它究竟有多么邪恶。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1873
translate chinese c1m1_d04eccc5:

    # "We finally emerge onto an ancient pathway. It leads into a clearing that provides a clear view of our objective in the distance. Jagged mountains in all other directions."
    "我们终于找到了一条古老的道路。它通向一片空地，从那里可以清晰地望见远方的目标。其他方向尽是参差不齐的山峦。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1876
translate chinese c1m1_faf9e86f:

    # bla "Is that purple glow what I think it is?"
    bla "那紫色的光芒，是我想的那个东西吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1878
translate chinese c1m1_551466fa:

    # lil "Y-Yeah... That's darkness. It seeps into the environment and corrupts everything within its grasp."
    lil "嗯……那就是黑暗。它渗透进环境之中，腐蚀触及的一切。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1879
translate chinese c1m1_fbe1cac4:

    # lil "Once something is completely corrupted, it starts to emit its own darkness. Because of that, we've yet to successfully remove it, even here where it's isolated."
    lil "一旦被黑暗彻底腐化，自身便会开始散发黑暗。正因如此，即便在此处将其隔离，我们仍未能成功清除它。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1882
translate chinese c1m1_7af1ffe3:

    # rub "Look how it radiates and throbs... What a haunting sight."
    rub "看它散发出的光芒……多么令马心神不宁的景象。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1888
translate chinese c1m1_cff308bd:

    # rik "And uh, what about that other light over there?"
    rik "那个，那边的另一束光呢？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1889
translate chinese c1m1_f56ed45b:

    # "Suddenly, the air shifts, growing warmer. A flicker of golden light appears ahead, faint, and distant."
    "空气骤然变暖，前方闪现一缕金光，微弱而遥远。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1890
translate chinese c1m1_30e5bc90:

    # mor "Something… {i}powerful{/i} is approaching…"
    mor "某种……{i}强大的力量{/i}正在逼近……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1891
translate chinese c1m1_f05b5457:

    # "A hush fell over our group as the silence became eerie."
    "一股寂静笼罩着我们，沉默渐渐变得诡异起来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1895
translate chinese c1m1_e3785e18:

    # "Then, from beyond the horizon, a blinding light emerged."
    "随后，一道耀眼的光芒从地平线彼端浮现。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1900
translate chinese c1m1_c8969ae6:

    # "The Queen, radiating with celestial energy."
    "女王，散发着她那神圣的能量。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1901
translate chinese c1m1_d4b45afc:

    # "Her gaze settled on me, then flickered toward [mor] with a look of restrained fury."
    "她的目光落在我的身上，随即转向[mor]，眼中闪过一丝强忍的怒火。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1902
translate chinese c1m1_5c159f96:

    # aur "Hmph, [mor] too? Just how far does this conspiracy go?"
    aur "哼，[mor]也参与了？这场阴谋究竟有多深？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1903
translate chinese c1m1_7360f49e:

    # mc "[aur], I’m not here to threaten you. I’m earnestly working for your sister —"
    mc "[aur]，我的行动并非是为了威胁您的地位。我是在真心实意地为你的妹妹效力—"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1904
translate chinese c1m1_0ab68df4:

    # aur "My assessment was correct all along, [mc]. You’ve been tricked. You’re all working for the greatest threat this country has ever faced."
    aur "我的判断始终正确，[mc]。你被骗了。你们都在为这个国家有史以来面临的最大威胁效力。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1905
translate chinese c1m1_bfac7b15:

    # "Tension crackled between us, but before I could continue, [mor] stepped forward."
    "紧张气氛在我们之间弥漫开，可在我继续开口前，[mor]已抢先一步迈步向前。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1912
translate chinese c1m1_2ba45f75:

    # mor "Tsk, only person I’m working for is myself. Whatever’s moving the moon has nothing to do with us."
    mor "啧，别想太多，我只为自己做事。那个推动月亮的东西与我们毫无关系。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1913
translate chinese c1m1_c6161003:

    # aur "You feel it too?"
    aur "你也感觉到了？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1914
translate chinese c1m1_c2d2411b:

    # "Just then, a chill wind began to swirl around us as [aur] pointed up towards the sky."
    "就在这时，寒风开始在我们周围盘旋，[aur]指向天空。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1915
translate chinese c1m1_8e5428e7:

    # "The moon above seemed to shine brighter, casting an unnatural, eerie glow over the clearing."
    "头顶的月亮似乎格外明亮，将一片不自然的诡异光芒洒在空地上。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1917
translate chinese c1m1_1fb73aad:

    # "[aur]’s gaze left us, her body tensing, and for the first time, I saw her face filled with something I hadn’t expected: dread."
    "[aur]将目光从我们身上移开了，她的身体绷紧，而我第一次在她脸上看见了未曾见过的神情：恐惧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1918
translate chinese c1m1_c549376a:

    # aur "{i}She{/i} has chosen this spot to arrive."
    aur "{i}她{/i}选定了此处作为落点。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1919
translate chinese c1m1_41cc5cc5:

    # aur "[mc], [mor]… You can leave. You’re irrelevant. I didn’t come here to stop you."
    aur "[mc]，[mor]……你们可以走了。你们不是我来这的原因。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1920
translate chinese c1m1_77dcd004:

    # mor "What the?! The disrespect! I can still rival you any day!"
    mor "你说啥？！真没礼貌！我随时都能和你一较高下！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1921
translate chinese c1m1_c9921ea3:

    # mc "W-We should get out of here."
    mc "我—我们确实该离开这里。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1925
translate chinese c1m1_825aa21c:

    # "From above, a beam of moonlight shot down, slamming into the ground with such force that it sent shockwaves through the earth."
    "一束月光从天而降，猛然撞击地面，激起阵阵震颤。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1927
translate chinese c1m1_93e3013f:

    # mid "Too late!"
    mid "太晚了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1935
translate chinese c1m1_18f2dfc6:

    # "The light was quickly shrouded in a dark, violet mist, and within it, a figure began to take form — a woman, draped in shadow and midnight blue, her hair like flowing ink, eyes cold as the depths of a winter night. She was the inverse of [aur], a dark mirror that exuded malice and power."
    "光芒很快被一团深紫色的浓雾所笼罩，其中逐渐显现出一个身影——一名雌驹，暗蓝的毛色上散发着阴影气息，青蓝的头发如流淌的墨汁般飘动，双眸冷若冬夜深渊。她是[aur]的反面，一面散发着邪恶与力量的黑暗镜像。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1943
translate chinese c1m1_3493a3ce:

    # aur "[sel]… No… Midnight!"
    aur "[sel]...不....梦魇之月！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1944
translate chinese c1m1_b65b74a3:

    # "Midnight’s laugh rang out, chilling and mocking."
    "梦魇之月的笑声骤然响起，冰冷而讥讽。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1945
translate chinese c1m1_4f8d6bf7:

    # "That's three angry alicorns. Shit... I know exactly how bad it can get when they start fighting."
    "三只愤怒的天角兽。坏了……我清楚它们打起来会有多可怕。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1947
translate chinese c1m1_e377e17f:

    # mid "Did you really think you could keep me sealed away forever, dear sister? Did you truly believe that I’d confine myself to the moon while you pranced about in your little throne room?"
    mid "亲爱的姐姐，你当真以为能永远将我囚禁于月亮之上？你可曾料到，当你在王座厅里蹦蹦跳跳的时候，我早已挣脱束缚，将以雷霆之势重返王位？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1948
translate chinese c1m1_a6c3531d:

    # "Her gaze fell to us, curiosity flickering as her eyes narrowed, inspecting each of us like a hunter studying her prey."
    "她的目光落在我们身上，好奇心在眯起的眼眸中闪烁，审视菜品般打量着我。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1952
translate chinese c1m1_d9ab3747:

    # mid "You! Interloper!"
    mid "喂！入侵者！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1953
translate chinese c1m1_c74757a9:

    # "She pointed directly at me. My breath caught, and I instinctively clenched my fists. Midnight’s presence was overwhelming and her gaze was enough to freeze me in place."
    "她直指着我。我屏住呼吸，本能地紧握双拳。梦魇之月的气场令人窒息，她那道目光足以让我僵立原地。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1955
translate chinese c1m1_7b96e95f:

    # mid "That little plan you concocted behind my back was adorable. Unfortunately for you, it's too late."
    mid "你背着我策划的小把戏真是可爱。可惜啊，为时已晚。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1962
translate chinese c1m1_d4491cb4:

    # "But [aur] stepped forward, her hand raised, and the golden light around her brightened."
    "但[aur]迈步上前，举起手来，周身的金色光芒骤然增强。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1963
translate chinese c1m1_39a607a1:

    # aur "Your business is with me, Midnight."
    aur "你该找的是我，梦魇之月。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1965
translate chinese c1m1_3d89bd12:

    # "She turned to us briefly, her gaze softer."
    "她转过身来，温柔地看了我们一眼。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1967
translate chinese c1m1_9611e1c8:

    # aur "[mc]… [lil]... each of you. I was wrong. You can pass the trials of Old Arcadia. You must!"
    aur "[mc]……[lil]……大家。是我错了。你们能够通过老Arcadia的考验。必须如此！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1968
translate chinese c1m1_0867335a:

    # "Midnight rolled her eyes, unfazed."
    "梦魇之月翻了个白眼，毫不在意。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1970
translate chinese c1m1_4f1eb977:

    # mid "Too little, too late, darling. That power will be all mine. Now die."
    mid "太迟了，我亲爱的姐姐。那股力量终将归我所有。现在，乖乖去死吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1974
translate chinese c1m1_8792e61c:

    # "She raised her hand, and a wave of purple energy surged toward us, crashing like a tidal wave. But the energy halted just before us, clashing with a wall of golden light that [aur] had cast. Her power radiated around us, protecting us from her sister’s onslaught."
    "她举起手，一股紫色光束朝我们袭来，如海啸般汹涌撞击。但能量在我们面前骤然停住，与[aur]构筑的金色光墙激烈碰撞。她的力量在我们周围迸发，将我们护在了她妹妹的猛攻之外。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1975
translate chinese c1m1_a0824513:

    # "The sisters locked eyes, the tension thickening as their magic surged and crackled in the air between them."
    "姐妹俩四目相对，空气中窜动的魔法噼啪作响，紧张气氛愈发凝重。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1978
translate chinese c1m1_0a466378:

    # mid "Let’s end this, [aur]. For too long, you’ve shined while I’ve been cast aside."
    mid "让我们结束这一切吧，[aur]。太久了，你闪耀着光芒，而我却被抛在一边。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1981
translate chinese c1m1_94ccc2ca:

    # "With a graceful but firm gesture, [aur] pulled her golden light around her, shaping it into a shield."
    "[aur]以优雅而坚定的姿态，将金光环绕周身，凝成护盾。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1982
translate chinese c1m1_a4f41d31:

    # aur "If you wish for battle, you shall have it."
    aur "要战，便战吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1986
translate chinese c1m1_90cc7242:

    # "The two goddesses collided, a clash of golden light and purple darkness that rocked the earth, sending tremors through the ground and illuminating the night with flashes of otherworldly light."
    "两位女神激烈相撞，金光与紫暗交织的激战撼动了大地，震颤蔓延，异界的光芒划破了夜空，照亮了整片大地"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1987
translate chinese c1m1_ff59ec82:

    # "Midnight’s attacks were ferocious, almost wild, her shadowed tendrils snapping forward, while [aur]’s magic shone with a radiant intensity, her movements graceful but unwavering."
    "梦魇之月的攻击凶猛异常，近乎狂野，她那阴影般的触须猛然向前抽击，而[aur]的魔法则绽放出耀眼的光芒，动作优雅而毫不迟疑。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1988
translate chinese c1m1_ad595a30:

    # "It was like watching the moon and sun dance in a deadly orbit, each strike landing with such force that I could barely keep my footing."
    "这景象如同目睹日月在致命轨道上共舞，每一次撞击都带着惊人的力量，震得我几乎站不稳脚。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1989
translate chinese c1m1_542d3521:

    # "[lil] and the others fled with me, eyes wide as they looked back and watched, caught between awe and terror."
    "[lil]和其他女孩跟着我逃跑，她们回望的眼神中夹着敬畏与恐惧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1991
translate chinese c1m1_b02595a2:

    # mc "This is our fight too. If we’re going to be virtues, this is our time to shine."
    mc "这也是我们的战斗。若要成为谐律之元，此刻正是我们闪耀的时刻。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1992
translate chinese c1m1_72ff50a8:

    # "I glanced over at [mor], who had been watching the conflict with an inscrutable expression."
    "我瞥了眼[mor]，她以一种难以捉摸的表情注视着这场战斗。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:1998
translate chinese c1m1_cd4453bf:

    # rik "You're running away with us? I thought you were going to fight!"
    rik "你要和我们一起逃跑？我还以为你要上去战斗呢！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2001
translate chinese c1m1_88a9b754:

    # mor "I have barely any energy, thanks to [mc] refusing to give me any… You get what you deserve."
    mor "我几乎毫无魔力，全因[mc]拒绝给予我哪怕一滴…额…反正就是你们活该。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2003
translate chinese c1m1_513c560d:

    # mor "This isn't my fight. I have my own people to protect."
    mor "这不是我的战斗。我有我需要保护的东西。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2006
translate chinese c1m1_c6117e33:

    # "Without warning, she turned on her heel and darted into the shadows, slipping away as if the darkness itself were welcoming her back."
    "她毫无预兆地转身，如箭般窜入阴影之中，悄然消失，仿佛它本身正张开双臂迎接她的归来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2008
translate chinese c1m1_65b5e111:

    # lil "Wait! [mor]!"
    lil "等一下！[mor]！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2009
translate chinese c1m1_2f541857:

    # mc "Tch, typical."
    mc "啧，我怎么一点都不意外呢。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2012
translate chinese c1m1_7e6f2818:

    # hon "Actually, I quite like her plan! We can’t stay here! Just look!"
    hon "其实，我挺同意她的想法的！我们不能待在这里！快看！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2019
translate chinese c1m1_5f869989:

    # "She exclaimed, pointing to [aur], who was staggering back under the weight of Midnight’s power."
    "她惊呼着，指向正被梦魇之月压得踉跄后退的[aur]。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2023
translate chinese c1m1_a32ad00c:

    # "With a scream of fury, Midnight unleashed a wave of dark energy that crashed against [aur]’s defenses. The impact sent a shockwave rippling through our group, knocking us off our feet."
    "梦魇之月发出愤怒的嘶吼，释放出一道黑暗魔法，猛烈撞击着[aur]的护盾。战斗带来的冲击波在我们队伍中荡漾开来，将我们震得踉跄倒地。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2025
translate chinese c1m1_5dcebb54:

    # "As the fight continued, darkness seemed to ripple and spread from Old Arcadia."
    "战斗持续着，黑暗仿佛从老Arcadia蔓延开来，朝着外界扩散而去。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2031
translate chinese c1m1_64cfa2b5:

    # but "That’s darkness! Nightmares could show up at any time!"
    but "黑暗在蔓延！梦魇随时可能出现！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2032
translate chinese c1m1_dabc83dd:

    # but "Ngghhh... No half measures! I'm trusting you!"
    but "唔……不要放弃！我相信你！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2035
translate chinese c1m1_d82ead43:

    # "[but] transforms under the heat and flaps her wings."
    "[but]变为了魅魔形态，身后的翅膀因为变身带来的性欲而扑腾着。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2036
translate chinese c1m1_3d16eedd:

    # but "Get ready, everyone~"
    but "大家做好准备~"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2039
translate chinese c1m1_1cdc56ad:

    # lil "{i}Gulp{/i} Let’s get inside the castle as fast as we can!"
    lil "{i}咽口水{/i} 我们赶紧进城堡吧！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2041
translate chinese c1m1_03dacc73:

    # "The air was electric, charged with the clash of [aur] and Midnight’s power, but it wasn’t just the sight of their battle that pressed on us—it was the suffocating sense of darkness seeping from the castle."
    "[aur]与与梦魇之月的战斗带来的紧张感挑动着我们紧张的神经，但压迫我们的不仅只有她们激战的景象——更来自城堡中渗出的令人窒息的黑暗气息。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2042
translate chinese c1m1_058ac69a:

    # "The environment around us trembled as if it were alive, a throbbing pulse in time with Midnight’s attacks."
    "我们周围的环境随着梦魇之月攻击的节奏，如活物般脉动着。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2046
translate chinese c1m1_3c3a4c4f:

    # lil "Move it, people! That’s not just normal darkness creeping out—it’s the kind that bites!"
    lil "快走，各位！这些不是一般的黑暗——是会咬你的那种！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2047
translate chinese c1m1_58d162da:

    # but "The other me prepared just the thing!"
    but "另一个我早就准备好应对措施了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2050
translate chinese c1m1_a2266006:

    # "With a sharp flap of her wings, [but] took to the air, her body glowing faintly as she held a crystalline charm high above her head. The charm emitted a soft hum, growing louder until it exploded with a wave of bright, iridescent light that swept outward like a protective dome."
    "她猛地扇动翅膀，腾空而起，身体泛着微光，高举着一枚晶莹的护符。护符发出轻柔的嗡鸣，声响逐渐增强，直至轰然爆裂，绽放出绚烂的虹彩光芒，在我们周围形成了一道防护结界。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2053
translate chinese c1m1_d6687240:

    # but "This’ll keep the shadow monsters back for a bit! Don’t make me waste it!"
    but "这能暂时挡住那些暗影怪物！别让我的努力白白浪费！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2056
translate chinese c1m1_f2771139:

    # bla "Is it just me, or do these things keep getting worse?! A literal goddess of darkness?!"
    bla "难道只有我这么觉得吗，还是说事情真的正在变得越来越糟了？！一位真正的黑暗女神？！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2059
translate chinese c1m1_7507b482:

    # hon "Less talk, more runnin’, sugar!"
    hon "少废话，快跑啊，甜心！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2064
translate chinese c1m1_79f3b74b:

    # "The castle loomed closer; its broken towers silhouetted against the eerie light of the moon. Around us, the shadows rippled and twisted, almost alive, clawing at the edge of [but]’s protective field."
    "我们离城堡越来越近，残破的塔楼在诡谲的月光下勾勒出剪影。四周的暗影如波纹般翻涌扭曲，几近活物，正拼命抓挠着[but]的防护结界。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2073
translate chinese c1m1_2087d632:

    # mox "I can’t believe we’re leaving [aur] to fight that thing alone!"
    mox "真不敢相信我们要抛下[aur]，让她独自去对抗那东西！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2074
translate chinese c1m1_a2faec32:

    # rik "Hah, be my guest if you want to try walking up to Midnight to give her a good whack in the face."
    rik "哈~，你要觉得你能和梦魇之月碰一碰，给她脸上狠狠来一拳，那你就去吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2075
translate chinese c1m1_c6aa75d3:

    # rub "[aur] is buying us time! Let’s not waste it!"
    rub "[aur]正在为我们争取时间！不要浪费时间开玩笑了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2080
translate chinese c1m1_1bc7b4b6:

    # "We charged forward, reaching the ancient stone bridge that led to the castle entrance. The air grew colder, and the protective glow of [but]’s charm began to flicker."
    "我们奋力向前冲刺，抵达通往城堡入口的古老石桥。空气愈发寒冷，[but]的护身符所散发的保护光芒开始闪烁不定。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2082
translate chinese c1m1_0a91c4da:

    # but "It won’t last much longer!"
    but "它快撑不住了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2083
translate chinese c1m1_cd4f766d:

    # mc "Everyone, inside! Go!"
    mc "大家一鼓作气冲进去！快！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2086
translate chinese c1m1_25a1c628:

    # "We stormed through the crumbling gates just as the light from [but]’s charm finally sputtered out."
    "我们冲进摇摇欲坠的大门后，[but]的防护结界也随之消失。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2087
translate chinese c1m1_d44192be:

    # "Darkness rushed in behind us like a wave, we slammed the gigantic gate closed behind us, slowing its spread."
    "黑暗如浪潮般从我们身后涌来，我们猛地关上身后巨大的铁门，阻滞了它的蔓延。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2089
translate chinese c1m1_9b544e7e:

    # mox "*{i}Pant, pant{/i}* Okay… safe… for now… right?"
    mox "{i}气喘吁吁{/i}* 好了……我们安全了……暂时……对吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2092
translate chinese c1m1_d15b78b0:

    # lil "Safe-ish. The scientists who studied this place must’ve used magic to keep the darkness out, but… how long will it hold against an even more aggressive variant?"
    lil "相对来说，是的。研究此地的科学家们想必在此施了魔法驱散黑暗，但……面对更具侵略性的变种，这道屏障还能撑多久？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2095
translate chinese c1m1_fef18300:

    # bla "I'm just glad there aren't any nightmares around!"
    bla "我只庆幸周围没有梦魇出现！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2097
translate chinese c1m1_0ef2b6a3:

    # lil "No, why would there be? Nightmares require... a host."
    lil "不是，为什么会有？梦魇是需要……一个宿主的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2099
translate chinese c1m1_f3a35b86:

    # bla "They do? Sorry, but I don't actually know how they work. I just thought they kinda 'spawned' in the dark lands."
    bla "是吗？抱歉，我其实不知道它们是怎么运作的。我只是觉得它们大概是在黑暗之地里'生成'的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2101
translate chinese c1m1_a9aba4e4:

    # lil "Hm, just so we're all on the same page, I'll explain how the process works while we walk."
    lil "嗯，为了确保大家理解一致，我边走边解释这个梦魇的运行逻辑吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2103
translate chinese c1m1_16f6df0e:

    # lil "The darkness targets and feeds on the evil that lies deep inside an individual. It uses this to possess you into a mindless creature that desire nothing but to spread that corruption."
    lil "黑暗锁定并吞噬潜藏于个体深处的邪恶。它以此操控你，将你变成只知传播腐蚀的行尸走肉。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2104
translate chinese c1m1_130a8771:

    # lil "So, yes, merely being in the presence of darkness is a threat to us, but especially people with a lot of hate in their hearts."
    lil "虽说，仅仅被黑暗附身就能对我们构成威胁，但对那些心中充满仇恨的群体来说腐化更深更快。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2106
translate chinese c1m1_f5691712:

    # mox "And what about the host? Can they be brought back? Or are they... dead?"
    mox "那么宿主呢？他们还能恢复过来吗？还是说他们……已经死了？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2107
translate chinese c1m1_e684a7bd:

    # lil "At first, the host does live through the process. However, when the host naturally dies, the darkness persists, leaving a shadowy figure, 'nightmare', that's nothing more than the evil once held by the host."
    lil "起初，宿主依然是活着的。然而当宿主自然死亡时，黑暗依然会存在，留下一个阴影般的存在——“梦魇”，它是宿主生前所承载的邪恶的化身。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2109
translate chinese c1m1_249aaff1:

    # mox "Shit... All those people already lost..."
    mox "该死……他们都已经死了……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2111
translate chinese c1m1_18bdb845:

    # bla "But that does mean we can save people before it gets too bad, right?"
    bla "但这确实意味着我们能在情况恶化将宿主救回来，对吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2113
translate chinese c1m1_e2405226:

    # lil "Good luck with that. With our current medical advancements, the best we can do is amputate the affected areas."
    lil "那就看运气了。以我们目前的医疗水平，最好的办法就是截肢。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2114
translate chinese c1m1_838b39c5:

    # mox "Hmm..."
    mox "额...."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2119
translate chinese c1m1_e4868dc7:

    # rub "..."
    rub "..."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2121
translate chinese c1m1_d4881f84:

    # lil "What interests me, is Midnight. She's oozing with darkness and hatred, but seems to be very much alive. Perhaps if the host is powerful enough, something else entirely happens."
    lil "我对梦魇之月十分感兴趣。她浑身散发着黑暗与仇恨的气息，却比一般的宿主显得更有活力。或许当宿主足够强大时，事情会完全不同。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2122
translate chinese c1m1_29380a7a:

    # lil "Which means... I think you know what that implies. We should {i}really{/i} hurry up. The relics. They have to be here somewhere."
    lil "这意味着……我想你们也知道这意味什么。我们{i}真的{/i}该快点了。那些圣物。它们必定藏在这附近某个地方。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2127
translate chinese c1m1_2acdd255:

    # "We continued to move cautiously through the castle. The wind howled through the halls, carrying a rhythmic sound like the castle itself was breathing."
    "我们继续谨慎地穿行于城堡之中。狂风在走廊里呼啸，吹出有节奏的声响，仿佛城堡本身正在呼吸一般。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2128
translate chinese c1m1_ba8be5f6:

    # "Darkness crept closer, pooling in the castle’s openings and licking at the edges of the faint protective magic still lingering in the air."
    "黑暗悄然渗透，在城堡的缝隙间积聚，空气中残存的微弱防护魔法的边缘被它一点一点蚕食着。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2130
translate chinese c1m1_339c4342:

    # hon "I hate this place. It feels like it’s… alive."
    hon "我讨厌这个地方。感觉这里……像活了一样。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2133
translate chinese c1m1_acfc36b9:

    # "We finally entered a vast chamber. At the far end stood a set of double doors, massive and intricate, their surface etched with symbols."
    "我们终于进入了一座宽阔的厅堂。厅堂尽头立着一扇双扇门，门体厚重而精巧，表面刻满神秘的符文。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2136
translate chinese c1m1_ea3345e7:

    # but "This has to be the entrance to the throne room. But these doors won't budge."
    but "这必定是通往王座厅的入口。但这些门根本推不动。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2137
translate chinese c1m1_c5c6e49d:

    # "Three long corridors extended outward from the central chamber, each starting with an empty pedestal. The pedestals had the same emblems etched on the throne doors."
    "三条长廊从中央大厅向外延伸，每条长廊的起点都矗立着一座空置的基座。这些基座上镌刻着与王座门扉相同的徽章。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2138
translate chinese c1m1_23dad21b:

    # "One of the sun. One of the moon. One of the heart."
    "分别为：日、月、心。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2139
translate chinese c1m1_84716ae1:

    # mc "The three alicorns of Arcadia."
    mc "Arcadia的三只天角兽。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2142
translate chinese c1m1_dc5dbef7:

    # lil "So, this really was their original castle."
    lil "看来，这确实是我们最初的城堡。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2143
translate chinese c1m1_48c518e2:

    # mc "Where is the Princess of Love these days?"
    mc "或说爱之公主她去哪了？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2144
translate chinese c1m1_49cefb28:

    # lil "Hmph. It’s ‘Queen of Love’ now. She married my brother, then they eloped to the Crystal Kingdom. Good for some, huh?"
    lil "哼。现在她成了“爱之女王”。先嫁给我哥哥，然后又私奔到水晶王国。有些马呀，就是走运啊？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2145
translate chinese c1m1_eb33f84c:

    # lil "I warned him she wouldn’t stay loyal. I mean, come on—the goddess of love? Loyal? As if."
    lil "我早就警告过我哥，她不会专一的。拜托——爱之女神？专一？这听着就很扯淡。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2147
translate chinese c1m1_6f642b83:

    # bla "Not to interrupt this thrilling family drama, but does anyone have an idea how we’re opening this thing?"
    bla "我不想打断你吐槽你哥，但有马知道该怎么打开这玩意儿吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2148
translate chinese c1m1_f515bc62:

    # "While [lil] and I exchanged a look, [mox] and the others were already poking at the pedestals."
    "当我和[lil]交换眼神时，[mox]和其余马已经开始戳弄那些基座了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2156
translate chinese c1m1_3b53f3eb:

    # mox "I’m guessing we need to activate them somehow... Maybe insert something in these round gaps?"
    mox "我猜我们得想办法激活它们……或许在这些凹槽里插入某些东西？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2157
translate chinese c1m1_4f49d706:

    # hon "Three symbols, three pedestals, three corridors. Looks like a setup to me."
    hon "三个符号，三个基座，三条走廊。在我看来，这分明是某种提示。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2158
translate chinese c1m1_3db5e12b:

    # mc "[aur] said we needed to prove ourselves. Could this be what she meant?"
    mc "[aur]说我们需要证明自己。莫非她指的就是这个？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2159
translate chinese c1m1_cb082662:

    # but "Let me guess. We split up, tackle the trials, and—ta-da! The door opens like magic."
    but "让我猜猜。我们分头行动，克服重重考验，然后——嗒-哒！门就神奇地打开了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2167
translate chinese c1m1_f51962b3:

    # rik "And if we're not fast enough, Midnight waltzes in to finish us off."
    rik "如果我们动作不够快，梦魇之月便会追过来，将我们彻底消灭。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2169
translate chinese c1m1_6cb741ea:

    # lil "[aur] is still out there. We have time... But..."
    lil "[aur]仍在外面。我们还有时间……但是……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2171
translate chinese c1m1_4bc272a1:

    # lil "Alright, girls, focus. Let’s talk strategy. Three paths, eight of us. We need effective teams."
    lil "好了，姑娘们，集中注意力。我们来谈谈策略。这有三条路，而我们有八个。我们需要组一个最高效的组合。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2172
translate chinese c1m1_b8ca2b80:

    # lil "[mox], [rik], and [bla] — you’re on the sun corridor. Magic, flight, and muscle. You should have all the bases covered."
    lil "[mox]、[rik]和[bla]——你们去日之长廊。魔法、飞行与力量，你们都有对应的特质。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2174
translate chinese c1m1_25ffb07d:

    # rik "Easy. We’ll be done before you miss us."
    rik "简单。在你们想我们之前，我们就搞定了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2175
translate chinese c1m1_6b49f0cc:

    # lil "[rub], you’re with me in the moon corridor. With our magic, we’ll handle whatever it throws at us."
    lil "[rub]，你和我去月之长廊。凭着我们的魔法，无论它给我们出什么难题，我们都能应对自如。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2177
translate chinese c1m1_37120594:

    # rub "Certainly, ma’am."
    rub "当然，女士。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2178
translate chinese c1m1_41f35e82:

    # lil "[mc], [hon], and [but] – you’re taking the heart corridor. I’m sure [hon]’s incredible strength and [but]… whatever you can do will be just fine."
    lil "[mc]、[hon]和[but]——你们去爱之长廊。我相信[hon]超凡的力量和[but]的……无论你会什么，只管做就行。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2185
