    "她回头冲我眨眨眼，蹦蹦跳跳地跑过去捡起了那颗光球。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2326
translate chinese c1m1_6add4766:

    # "Who would have thought that fucking your way through a trial would be the solution?"
    "谁能想到这场试炼和做爱有关啊？太奇葩了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2328
translate chinese c1m1_8c263760:

    # hon "Y’all, uhm… actually live quite close to me, don’t you?"
    hon "你们这个，唔……住的其实离我挺近的，对吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2330
translate chinese c1m1_7feaa693:

    # but "That’s right! Just through the woods."
    but "没错！穿过树林就到我家了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2332
translate chinese c1m1_1e64c26d:

    # hon "Heh, I’ll keep that in mind…"
    hon "我会记住的……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2334
translate chinese c1m1_92e77176:

    # "With the pink orb safely in hand, we turned back toward the corridor, the faint glow lighting our way back to the main room."
    "将粉色光球稳稳握在手中，我们转身朝长廊走去，微弱的光芒为我们照亮了返回主厅的路。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2341
translate chinese c1m1_a5992130:

    # hon "Well, look at that. We made it back first. Guess we’re more than just muscles and good looks!"
    hon "瞧瞧，我们可是第一个回来的。看来我们可不只有肌肉和色气呢！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2342
translate chinese c1m1_8156c30b:

    # "The orb clicked into place with a faint hum, and the heart emblem above the throne room began to glow, a warm pink light casting over the chamber. It was the first piece of validation that we were doing something right."
    "光球咔嗒一声嵌了进去，伴随着轻微的嗡鸣，王座厅上方的心形徽记开始发光，温暖的粉色光芒笼罩着整个大厅。这是我们的证明——证明我们正在做正确的事。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2344
translate chinese c1m1_e19ecc7e:

    # but "And that is how you solve a trial with love!"
    but "这就是用爱通过试炼的方式！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2352
translate chinese c1m1_5a41c146:

    # "Before we could gloat any further, [lil] and [rub] emerged from the moon corridor, looking a little worse for wear but triumphant, nonetheless. [rub] carried a bright silver orb."
    "在我们来得及继续幸灾乐祸之前，[lil]和[rub]从月之长廊里走了出来，虽然略显狼狈，却依然神采飞扬。[rub]手中捧着一颗闪亮的银色光球。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2353
translate chinese c1m1_e0a93259:

    # lil "You’d think as a master of magic, I wouldn’t have to spend so long fumbling through pitch-black corridors."
    lil "作为魔法大师，按理说不该在漆黑的走廊里摸索那么久才对啊。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2354
translate chinese c1m1_1d65d932:

    # rub "I think it was a test of our patience disguised as a test of magic. You performed admirably."
    rub "我认为其实考的不是魔法运用，应该是我们的耐心。你表现得令我钦佩。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2355
translate chinese c1m1_2779ab84:

    # "The silver orb clicked into place, and the moon emblem above the throne room lit up, bathing the chamber in silvery light. The group now turned their anxious gazes toward the sun corridor."
    "银色光球咔嗒一声嵌了进去，王座厅上方的月之徽记亮起，银色光芒倾泻而下，将整个厅堂笼罩其中。我们此刻都将目光转向了太阳长廊。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2356
translate chinese c1m1_cb95da26:

    # but "Bet you ten monies the sun crew got lost. I mean, they’ve got all the jokers in there."
    but "我敢打赌，她们在里面迷路了。毕竟她们看着就很不靠谱。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2364
translate chinese c1m1_0279c6b6:

    # "Moments later, [mox], [bla], and [rik] appeared, carrying a brilliant golden orb that seemed to radiate warmth."
    "片刻之后，[mox]、[bla]和[[rik]出现了，她们手中托着一颗璀璨的金色光球，它的周围仿佛散发着温暖的光芒。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2365
translate chinese c1m1_c7806eb1:

    # rik "*{i}Laughing{/i}* Lost? Please. Had to solve a little mirror puzzle, that’s all."
    rik "*{i}大笑{/i}* 迷路？得了吧。不过是解了个简单的镜子谜题罢了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2366
translate chinese c1m1_e8a29e30:

    # mox "Little? Try twenty mirrors and a whole lot of trial and error."
    mox "简单？想想二十面镜子和无数次地试错吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2367
translate chinese c1m1_6f4d9d24:

    # bla "Let’s just say aiming light beams through tight corners is not as easy as it looks."
    bla "这么说吧，让光束通过反射穿过狭窄的拐角可没听起来那么容易。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2368
translate chinese c1m1_a903d60c:

    # "The final orb clicked into place on the sun pedestal, and the sun emblem above the throne room blazed to life, completing the trio of lights."
    "最后一颗光球咔嗒一声嵌了进去，王座厅上方的太阳徽记骤然燃起光芒，三盏圣光至此齐聚。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2369
translate chinese c1m1_e35b8ddb:

    # "A deep rumble shook the hall as the massive double doors began to creak open."
    "随着一声沉闷的轰鸣，巨大的双扇门开始吱呀作响，缓缓开启。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2376
translate chinese c1m1_d96675cd:

    # hon "Alright, I’ll admit it—our trial was the easiest. Show a little love, share some feelings, bam. Done."
    hon "好吧，我承认——我们的试炼是最轻松的。表达点爱意，分享些感受，嘣！搞定。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2377
translate chinese c1m1_d05de40d:

    # but "Meanwhile, they’re playing light and dark magic charades. Kind of feels like we lucked out."
    but "与此同时，她们遇到的是光线解密和魔法试炼。感觉我们算是走运了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2385
translate chinese c1m1_e79ad13f:

    # lil "I’d love to see you try finding your way out of a maze where your own shadow tries to trip you."
    lil "我们那是个迷宫，而且那里的各种影子都会阻碍你逃出那地方。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2386
translate chinese c1m1_1c994945:

    # mox "At least a maze doesn’t require a degree in physics."
    mox "至少走迷宫不需要物理学位。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2387
translate chinese c1m1_9ad19d87:

    # mc "Ahaha, okay, okay. We all made it back in one piece. That’s what matters. Let’s focus. We’re not done yet."
    mc "哈哈~，好啦好啦。能平安归来才是最重要的。现在要集中精力，我们还没成功呢。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2388
translate chinese c1m1_334aecc1:

    # "The levity faded as we turned our attention to the now-open throne room."
    "当我们把目光转向此刻敞开的王座厅时，那份轻松感便烟消云散了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2390
translate chinese c1m1_0c424b7a:

    # lil "Wait… Does anyone else feel that?"
    lil "等等……你们感觉到了吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2392
translate chinese c1m1_0973bb29:

    # mox "Yeah. It’s too quiet. I can’t feel [aur] anymore."
    mox "是啊。太安静了。我再也感受不到[aur]的魔法了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2394
translate chinese c1m1_727a3294:

    # rub "Do you think… she’s gone?"
    rub "你们觉得……她\"走\"了吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2396
translate chinese c1m1_aa72c5cc:

    # lil "*{i}Clenching her fists{/i}* No. She’s not gone. She can’t be. But something’s wrong. We need to hurry."
    lil "{i}她紧握双拳{/i}* 不，这不可能。但情况很不对劲。我们得快点了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2399
translate chinese c1m1_317e2c4b:

    # "We cautiously entered, passing through crumbling arches until we arrived at a throne room."
    "我们谨慎地穿过陈旧的走廊，最终抵达一座王座厅。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2400
translate chinese c1m1_c9810c34:

    # "As if answering our presence, a faint glow emerged from the other end of the room. Six ancient relics—each one distinct in shape and aura—sat on pedestals, emitting a gentle pulse of light."
    "仿佛感知到了我们的到来，房间另一端浮现出一缕微光。六件圣物——每件都形态各异、气息迥然——静静矗立在基座上，散发出柔和的光芒。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2401
translate chinese c1m1_0825d4f5:

    # "One by one, the virtues approached, each drawn to a specific relic that seemed to resonate uniquely, feeling a surge of something—power, maybe, or connection—flowing from the relics."
    "雌驹们接连走近，各自被一件特定的圣物吸引，那圣物似乎与她们产生了独特的共鸣。她们感受到一股力量——或许是力量，或许是连接——从圣物中涌动而出。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2404
translate chinese c1m1_1deb18ad:

    # rub "These are...? No, for some reason, I already know... This one's mine."
    rub "这些是……？不，不知为何，我已经感受到了……这件是我的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2407
translate chinese c1m1_4abdb260:

    # rik "I get it now... Still, hell of a place to hide 'em..."
    rik "我也一样……不过，藏这些东西的地方可真够离谱的……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2409
translate chinese c1m1_ce62ebb5:

    # lil "It’s like… they were waiting for us."
    lil "就像……它们在等着我们一样。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2410
translate chinese c1m1_3a11dd37:

    # "She extended her hand toward one of the relics, her fingers trembling as it responded with a warm glow."
    "她伸手触碰其中一件圣物，圣物随即发出温暖光芒，使她的手指微微颤抖。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2413
translate chinese c1m1_dcf58ffb:

    # "They each took hold of their respective relic, and as they did, a surge of energy washed over them, filling the girls with a sensation so pure and powerful it nearly took my breath away."
    "她们各自握住属于自己的圣物，随即，一股能量朝她们的体内席卷而来，让女孩们感受到如此纯粹而强大的力量，几乎令她们屏息。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2414
translate chinese c1m1_5f717a5b:

    # "They had past the unspoken test, and each relic accepted them, infused itself into each of them."
    "她们通过了无声的考验，每一件圣物都接纳了她们，将自身融入每匹雌驹的体内。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2416
translate chinese c1m1_909c74d8:

    # hon "This power… It’s overwhelming!"
    hon "这份力量……太强大了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2419
translate chinese c1m1_608d5f78:

    # rik "Woah! This is unreal. I’ve never felt like this before."
    rik "哇！这简直不可思议。我从未有过这样的感觉。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2422
translate chinese c1m1_0895fd18:

    # rub "I feel like I could protect the entire city right now."
    rub "我感觉我自己就能守护整座城市。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2427
translate chinese c1m1_aae13f7a:

    # but "My senses have never been sharper. Everything feels so clear right now."
    but "我的感官从未如此敏锐。此刻一切都显得如此清晰。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2430
translate chinese c1m1_7e10be83:

    # bla "It’s strong, but… is this really enough?"
    bla "这是很强，但……这真的足够吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2432
translate chinese c1m1_35f455b9:

    # lil "I’m not sure… We all saw how strong Midnight was. I’m not sure if this is enough."
    lil "我不确定……我们都见识过梦魇之月有多强。我不确定这股力量够不够打败她。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2433
translate chinese c1m1_c8765514:

    # "I remembered the day [mor] had fallen, how the only way to defeat her was through a concentrated burst of power, channelled through a catalyst."
    "我记得我们打败[mor]的那天，当时唯一能击败她的方法，就是通过汇聚能量在一马身上，然后释放她。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2434
translate chinese c1m1_6b9d9407:

    # mc "[lil], you must act as a catalyst. All of you can focus everything you have into a single, purifying burst."
    mc "[lil]，你必须充当一个能量放大器。你们所有马将所有力量注入到[lil]的体内，使其凝聚成一场纯粹的能量爆发。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2436
translate chinese c1m1_b2f6211f:

    # "[lil]’s eyes widened, hesitant to wield so much power. But that look quickly melted away as she realized what she had to do."
    "[lil]的眼睛睁得大大的，对掌控如此强大的力量感到犹豫。但当她意识到自己必须做什么时，那份迟疑的神色迅速消散。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2440
translate chinese c1m1_1e425124:

    # "She nodded, stepping to the centre of the virtues and holding her relic high."
    "她点了点头，走向大厅的中心，高举着她的圣物。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2443
translate chinese c1m1_f3c8635b:

    # "The others closed in around her. They didn’t fully understand how, or why, but the way they channelled their energy towards [lil] was like a second nature to them."
    "姑娘们围到了她的身边。她们没有了解过该如何将能量汇聚到[lil]的身上，但她们还是做到了，就如与生俱来的本能一般。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2447
translate chinese c1m1_4e602f51:

    # "[lil]’s body and eyes began to glow, her relic amplifying the light until she was nearly blinding."
    "[lil]的身体与双眼开始发光，同时她的手中的圣物也变得越来越亮，直至刺眼"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2452
translate chinese c1m1_e6c0fe8b:

    # "Then, with a steady breath, she unleashed a burst of pure magic, a blinding, brilliant force that surged outward and swept through the room, obliterating every trace of darkness."
    "随后，她深吸一口气，抬手释放出一股至高的魔法能量——那道耀眼夺目的光芒如洪流般向外迸发，席卷整个房间，将所有黑暗的痕迹彻底抹去。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2454
translate chinese c1m1_e240880b:

    # "For a moment, the silence returned, but this time it was filled with life. The sounds of the forest began to seep back, the breeze rustling in the trees, birds chirping in the distance."
    "片刻间，寂静再度降临，但这次寂静里却充满了生机。独属于森林的声音开始悄然回归——微风在树梢沙沙作响，远处的鸟儿啁啾鸣唱。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2456
translate chinese c1m1_d2754e96:

    # hon "Whoa… did we just… do that? The purple glow is completely gone!"
    hon "哇……我们刚才……是不是成了？那些紫色的东西完全消失了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2459
translate chinese c1m1_8f9e582d:

    # ruby "We did. But that was only a piece of Midnight’s darkness. We still have a long way to go."
    ruby "我们做到了。但只去除了一小片黑暗而已。我们还有很长的路要走。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2462
translate chinese c1m1_38c7f597:

    # rik "Yessss, finally! We kick butt! I’m sorry I ever doubted you, [mc]!"
    rik "太棒了，终于成功了！我们太厉害了！[mc]，对不起我曾经居然怀疑过你！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2463
translate chinese c1m1_483c69f5:

    # mc "Pfft, we were at the point where I was starting to doubt myself."
    mc "噗~，没事，当时也怀疑自己。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2467
translate chinese c1m1_8f37421b:

    # but "Time to take out Midnight."
    but "是时候消灭梦魇之月了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2470
translate chinese c1m1_926b0042:

    # mox "Beat her, and all the darkness might disappear. Just a hunch, but it makes sense, doesn’t it?"
    mox "打败她，所有的黑暗或许就会消失。只是个预感，但很合理，不是吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2474
translate chinese c1m1_5b362b7d:

    # "[lil] lowered her relic, breathing heavily but smiling with an intensity I hadn’t seen before."
    "[lil]放下她的圣物，气喘吁吁，脸上却挂着我从未见过的炽烈笑容。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2475
translate chinese c1m1_ff74dc39:

    # lil "If that was a taste of what we’re capable of… Midnight doesn’t stand a chance."
    lil "若这只是我们能力的冰山一角……那说明梦魇之月根本毫无胜算。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2480
translate chinese c1m1_1bf251cd:

    # "Just as [lil] lowered her relic, triumphant and exhausted, a violent crackling sound filled the air."
    "就在[lil]疲惫而胜利地放下圣物时，一阵剧烈的噼啪声响彻天地。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2482
translate chinese c1m1_26297703:

    # "A dark, malicious pulse surged through the room, and before anyone could react, a bolt of magic shot directly at [lil]’s relic."
    "一股黑暗而邪恶的能量在房间里翻涌，在大家反应过来之前，一道魔法箭矢已直射向[lil]的圣物。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2484
translate chinese c1m1_c60a9423:

    # "The relic shattered in her hands, fragments turning to dust and scattering on the ground.."
    "圣物在她手中碎裂，化作尘埃，散落在地。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2486
translate chinese c1m1_010135a7:

    # "[lil] gasped, clutching her empty hands, her face twisting in shock and horror."
    "[lil]倒吸一声，双手紧攥成拳，震惊与恐惧扭曲着她的脸。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2487
translate chinese c1m1_e8615d26:

    # lil "No… no, no, no! The relic!"
    lil "不....不，不，不！圣物！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2492
translate chinese c1m1_bac50feb:

    # "A dark laugh echoed through the ruined halls. Midnight stood at the edge of the chamber, her eyes gleaming with a malevolent satisfaction."
    "一阵阴森的笑声在厅中回荡。梦魇之月伫立在厅堂边缘，眼中闪烁着恶毒的得意。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2494
translate chinese c1m1_fae67982:

    # mid "Like lambs to a slaughter."
    mid "羊入虎口啊~。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2495
translate chinese c1m1_0064d35e:

    # mid "Did you really think you’d be able to handle this power? All I needed from you six is to awaken them. I'll take it from here."
    mid "你们真以为能驾驭这份力量？我只是在利用你们唤醒它而已。剩下的交给我。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2498
translate chinese c1m1_e7116289:

    # "Her horn glowed and the shadows seemed to deepen, pulsing around her like a dark, living aura."
    "她的角闪着微光，阴影似乎愈发浓重，黑暗如同活物一般，在她周围不断涌动。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2508
translate chinese c1m1_c1f6a939:

    # "Without waiting, the other five charged at her together, relics blazing in the darkness. Their combined power colliding against Midnight’s dark, swirling aura."
    "其余五马未等片刻便齐冲向她，圣物在黑暗中闪耀着炽烈的光芒，她们合力迸发能量，猛烈撞击着梦魇之月旁那团翻涌的黑暗。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2517
translate chinese c1m1_efd1a248:

    # "For a moment, I thought they were winning, their combined powers pushing back against her defenses. But Midnight’s laughter cut through the clash, chilling us to the bone."
    "有一瞬间，我以为她们占了上风，她们合力的攻击正将她的防御层层击退。但梦魇之月的笑声划破了空气，直刺骨髓。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2519
translate chinese c1m1_510e203c:

    # lil "Watch out! She’s not aiming for you, she’s aiming for – !"
    lil "当心！她的攻击对象不是你们，是——！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2525
translate chinese c1m1_78985b26:

    # "Midnight raised her hand, sending out a shockwave that shattered the relics in their hands, one by one, until each was nothing but glittering shards scattered on the ground."
    "梦魇之月举起手，释放出一道冲击波，将大家手中的圣物接连震碎，直至每件圣物都化作碎片，散落在地上。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2527
translate chinese c1m1_763e1935:

    # "I watched in horror as the relics — our last hope — fell to pieces. I watched as the power visibly drained from the girls."
    "我看着圣物——我们最后的希望——在我们的眼前，化为碎片。看着女孩们的力量的证明在我的眼前不断消散。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2530
translate chinese c1m1_9fe3cdba:

    # but "No way… it’s all gone!"
    but "不可能……全没了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2533
translate chinese c1m1_a233f3a9:

    # rik "This… this can’t be happening! My power!"
    rik "这……这不可能！我的力量！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2537
translate chinese c1m1_b36b5d7a:

    # "Midnight laughed, savoring the despair on each of our faces. She took a menacing step forward, her eyes locking onto mine with a gleeful malice."
    "梦魇之月发出了邪恶笑声，品味着我们脸上的绝望。她威胁性地向前迈了一步，带着幸灾乐祸的眼神锁定我的视线。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2538
translate chinese c1m1_197d33a1:

    # mid "And now that I’ve stripped you of your little toys, I wonder... What cruel fate do you deserve?"
    mid "既然我已夺走了你那些无聊小玩具，我不禁思考...你的命运，该何去何从？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2540
translate chinese c1m1_4c3b9aac:

    # mid "It'll be lonely at the top. I could use some loyal sex drones."
    mid "高处不胜寒。或许我会需要一些忠实的性伴侣"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2541
translate chinese c1m1_d53e5288:

    # mid "What do you say, [mc]? I'll need a reliable man around to continue my legacy."
    mid "你觉得呢，[mc]？我需要一个可靠的伴侣来一起延续我的事业。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2542
translate chinese c1m1_9b4a3c3c:

    # mid "Who better than the one that made all this happen?"
    mid "还有谁比你更合适呢？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2543
translate chinese c1m1_ed9cf983:

    # "I grit my teeth and wince. We could all die right here if I refuse..."
    "我咬紧牙关，痛苦地思考者。如果我拒绝……我们都可能死在这里……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2544
translate chinese c1m1_0cb080d7:

    # "I should..."
    "我该....."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2560
translate chinese finaletimer_421e02ba:

    # "A flash of green light cut through the shadows. [mor] emerged, sending a searing blast of energy right into Midnight’s chest, forcing her to stagger back."
    "一道绿光划破阴影。[mor]突然现身，一记灼热的能量冲击直击梦魇之月的胸膛，迫使她踉跄后退。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2561
translate chinese finaletimer_f4b89084:

    # "Midnight snarled, but [mor] stood her ground, defiant and fierce."
    "梦魇之月咒骂着，但[mor]不为所动，保持着她那股倔强而凶悍的态度。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2570
translate chinese finaletimer_326c48ca:

    # mid "[mor]? I thought you skittered away like the cockroach you are."
    mid "[mor]？我还以为你像只蟑螂似的溜走了呢。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2571
translate chinese finaletimer_ab735297:

    # mor "I’m not about to let you drag me into your nightmare hellscape. Not now, not ever."
    mor "我绝不会让你把我拖进你那噩梦般的地狱。现在不会，以后也不会，永远都不会。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2583
translate chinese finaletimer_460e3d0f:

    # "She shot another blast, and the room erupted into a chaotic clash of magic as the two fought, the force of their power shaking the ground beneath us."
    "她又射出一道魔法冲击，房间里顿时爆发了一场混乱的魔法交锋，两马激战时释放的力量震得脚下地面剧烈颤动。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2587
translate chinese finaletimer_395a6a8f:

    # mor "Tsk. [mc], you’d better figure something out! I can’t hold her back for long!"
    mor "啧。[mc]，你快想个办法出来！我可没法一直拦着她！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2602
translate chinese finaletimer_fc1b68dd:

    # "As Midnight and [mor] clashed in an epic display of power, we could only watch."
    "当梦魇之月与[mor]在史诗般的力量对决中激烈交锋时，我们只能静静旁观。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2609
translate chinese finaletimer_4afdc3ce:

    # lil "The relics were our only chance! Without them, what are we supposed to do?"
    lil "这些圣物是我们唯一的希望！没有它们，我们还能怎么办？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2613
translate chinese finaletimer_307929ce:

    # "I felt [mox]’s hand slip into mine, squeezing tightly, her face pale but resolute."
    "我感觉到[mox]的手滑入我的掌心，紧紧地攥住了我，她脸色苍白却神情坚定。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2614
translate chinese finaletimer_10a19383:

    # mox "There has to be something. [mc], you’ve always figured a way out before."
    mox "一定会有办法的。[mc]，你总能想到办法。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2615
translate chinese finaletimer_e48ebe38:

    # "I glanced around the room, wracking my mind for any glimmer of hope. The relics were gone, our powers stripped, and Midnight was unstoppable."
    "我环顾四周，竭力在脑海中搜寻一丝希望的曙光。圣物已然消失，我们的力量被剥夺，而Midnight已势不可挡。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2616
translate chinese finaletimer_31c84a70:

    # mc "Why would... Why would Midnight destroy the relics if she implied that she wanted their power?"
    mc "为什么……为什么梦魇之月要摧毁那些圣物？她之前明明暗示过她想要它们的力量啊？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2618
translate chinese finaletimer_e942afb3:

    # lil "Oh...?"
    lil "哦...?"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2619
translate chinese finaletimer_979cf36b:

    # mc "And then, [mor]... Back in my universe, I don’t remember the girls holding onto any relics when they defeated her."
    mc "然后，[mor]……回到我的宇宙，我不记得女孩们打败她时手上拿着什么圣物。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2620
translate chinese finaletimer_aa2a1ba0:

    # "I glanced at the shards scattered around us, still faintly glowing, like echoes of its power."
    "我看了看散落四周的碎片，它们仍隐隐发着光，如同它力量的余波。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2624
translate chinese finaletimer_fddef95c:

    # "[lil] and [mox] could feel it too. Their eyes glinting with a realisation."
    "[lil]和[mox]也感受到了。她们的眼睛闪着恍然大悟的光芒。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2626
translate chinese finaletimer_3d4cfde4:

    # lil "The relics may be destroyed, but their magic is still all around us!"
    lil "圣物或许已毁，但它们的魔法依然环绕在我们身边！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2628
translate chinese finaletimer_34bace8d:

    # lil "Everyone, I think we can still tap into it, absorb it. The memory of that power is still deep inside us, they awakened to us, and that's something Midnight can’t take away."
    lil "大家，我想我们依然能触及它、吸收它。那种力量的记忆仍深藏于我们体内，融入了我们之中，梦魇之月是无法夺走这种力量的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2629
translate chinese finaletimer_f225118d:

    # "The six of them held their hands out over the shards, and with a surge of shared will, their power began to resonate through each broken piece, pulling them into an orbit around us."
    "六位雌驹将手悬于碎片之上，随着一股意志上的涌动，她们的力量开始在每块碎片间共鸣，将碎片拉入围绕我们身旁。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2634
translate chinese finaletimer_a7864f92:

    # "Energy poured out from each of the relic fragments, surrounding us in a vibrant, shimmering light that pulsed in sync with our hearts. Slowly, I could see the power returning — not just to them, but spreading to [mox] and myself too!"
    "每一块碎片都涌现出能量，将我们笼罩在了它跃动闪烁的光芒中，那光芒与我们心跳同频共振。渐渐地，我看见力量正在回归——不仅回归它们自身，更蔓延至了[mox]与我的身上！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2637
translate chinese finaletimer_938b6833:

    # "One by one, all of us felt the surge power. And now, there were eight virtues — eight fully realized forces of concord."
    "我们都感受到了这股力量的涌动。如今，八种谐律精华——八位完全觉醒的谐律之元——已然显现。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2648
translate chinese finaletimer_712a32e3:

    # "Just as [mor] was unable to fight anymore, Midnight’s turned to face us, a hint of shock flashing in her eyes."
    "就在[mor]再也无法战斗之际，梦魇之月转身面对我们，眼中掠过一丝震惊。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2649
translate chinese finaletimer_cae05ad5:

    # mid "No… that power! It should be mine!"
    mid "不……那股力量！它本该属于我！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2650
translate chinese finaletimer_bbef12f9:

    # "She reached out, trying to absorb the relic energy herself. But as she attempted to pull the power into herself, I saw the chance we’d been waiting for."
    "她伸手试图吸收圣物能量。但当她试图将力量吸入体内时，我看到了我们苦苦等待的机会。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2651
translate chinese finaletimer_f8713afb:

    # mc "She wants the power that badly? Let’s give it to her - all of it!"
    mc "你就这么渴望这股力量？那就给你吧——全部都给你！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2661
translate chinese finaletimer_321fe1b2:

    # "Each of us focused every ounce of energy into a unified blast, channeling our power toward [lil]."
    "我们将各自凝聚到一起，汇向[lil]。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2662
translate chinese finaletimer_a2d32ca8:

    # mid "I'll never let you!"
    mid "我绝不让你们得逞！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2670
translate chinese finaletimer_c9ea2e2c:

    # "[lil] glowed brighter than ever, and together we unleashed an unstoppable blast of purifying magic."
    "[lil]散发出的光芒比以往任何时候都更加耀眼，我们共同释放出一股势不可挡的净化魔法。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2673
translate chinese finaletimer_a8485935:

    # "The brilliant wave of light struck Midnight, illuminating the throne room with its blinding intensity. For a moment, it seemed as though the sheer force of the attack would consume her entirely."
    "一道耀眼的光芒击中了梦魇之月，刺目的强光照亮了整个王座大厅。刹那间，那股滔天攻势仿佛要将她彻底吞噬。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2677
translate chinese finaletimer_ea1f370b:

    # "And as the light faded..."
    "而当光芒黯淡之后....."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2681
translate chinese finaletimer_0137b563:

    # "She stood—shaken, wisps of shadow leaking from her form."
    "她站起身——浑身颤抖，体表渗出缕缕阴影。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2682
translate chinese finaletimer_4575cbd6:

    # mid "Motherfuckers!"
    mid "妈了个蛋！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2683
translate chinese finaletimer_6558338e:

    # "The attack had grazed her, and though she looked worn out, she was far from finished."
    "那次攻击只是擦伤了她，这次攻击只是削弱了她，不足以对她造成致命打击。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2684
translate chinese finaletimer_a320cd57:

    # mid "That power… it should be mine!"
    mid "那股力量........它本该属于我才对！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2685
translate chinese finaletimer_9d25fab0:

    # "She stumbled back, her piercing eyes flickering with desperation before narrowing into a glare."
    "她踉跄着后退，那双锐利的眼睛先是闪过绝望的神色，随即眯起化作怒目。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2687
translate chinese finaletimer_85c72cc8:

    # mid "Fine. If I can’t crush you here and now, I’ll turn the whole city into my army of nightmares."
    mid "行。既然我此刻无法将你们碾碎，那我就把整座城市变成我的梦魇大军。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2688
translate chinese finaletimer_08b4bb25:

    # mid "You’ll drown in their screams, and when I’ve broken every last one of you, that power will belong to me!"
    mid "你将淹没在他们的尖叫声中，当我将你们彻底摧毁时，那股力量便将归我所有！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2691
translate chinese finaletimer_c1d90e5a:

    # "With a final, chilling laugh, she dissolved into a swirl of shadow, vanishing into smoke. The faint echo of her laughter lingered."
    "随着一声最后的、毛骨悚然的笑声，她化作一团阴影，消失在了黑雾中。她那笑声的回响在我们的耳畔，久久不散。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2698
translate chinese finaletimer_bcbc911e:

    # hon "W-Wha? That coward! We’ve got to stop her!"
    hon "呃——什么？那个胆小鬼！我们必须阻止她！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2699
translate chinese finaletimer_c4f162e2:

    # rik "No way am I letting her get to the city!"
    rik "我是不会让她进城的！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2700
translate chinese finaletimer_fb570383:

    # lil "I’m sorry. If I’d aimed just a little better, we could’ve ended it here."
    lil "抱歉。如果我瞄得再准一些......"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2701
translate chinese finaletimer_5e525593:

    # mc "It’s okay, [lil]. We still forced her to retreat. That’s proof enough that we can finish this."
    mc "没事的，[lil]。我们还是把她逼退了。这足以证明我们有能力击败她。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2709
translate chinese finaletimer_cc680d5f:

    # mox "She's bluffing. There's no way she can charge into the city after fighting [aur], [mor], {i}and{/i} taking that hit."
    mox "她是在虚张声势。与[aur]、[mor]交战后{i}又{/i}吃了我们一记重击，她绝无可能冲进城里。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2710
translate chinese finaletimer_7f8bd33c:

    # rub "I tend to agree. Let's think about this rationally. She ran from us for a reason. Let's rush to the city and create a defense."
    rub "我倾向于同意你这观点。但让我们理性地思考一下。她逃离我们肯定是有原因的。我们赶快去城里建立防御工事吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2711
translate chinese finaletimer_3f76f2ba:

    # mor "Tch, I can barely walk… But… fuck it. I’m committed. Lead the way."
    mor "啧，我几乎走不动了……但……去他妈的。都决定要帮你们了。带路吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2712
translate chinese finaletimer_e64e7808:

    # mc "That’s the spirit."
    mc "就要这种精神。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2714
translate chinese finaletimer_1aa61159:

    # "The group turned as one, heading for the exit of the ruined castle."
    "我们一齐朝着出口走去。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2717
translate chinese finaletimer_f44def96:

    # "Stepping out of Old Arcadia, we saw [aur] lying defeated in the distance."
    "走出老Arcadia，我们看见[aur]在远处倒地不起。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2719
translate chinese finaletimer_2b0f1da8:

    # lil "[aur]!"
    lil "[aur]!"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2720
translate chinese finaletimer_656cba26:

    # "The group rushes over. [aur] lies motionless, her mane dimmer than usual, her breathing faint but steady."
    "我们匆匆赶了过去。[aur]一动不动地躺着，鬃毛比往常多了几分暗淡，呼吸微弱但平稳。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2723
translate chinese finaletimer_79e4ba3b:

    # but "She’s alive. Thank goodness. She gave it everything she had."
    but "她还活着。谢天谢地。她已竭尽全力。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2726
translate chinese finaletimer_f978720f:

    # rik "I can’t believe she’s still standing—or, uh, lying—after all of that. She’s tough as nails."
    rik "真不敢相信她经历了这一切居然还能站着——呃，躺着——她真是坚韧如铁。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2727
translate chinese finaletimer_c8e9c803:

    # lil "[aur]... You really held on, didn’t you? You never stopped fighting, even for a second."
    lil "[aur]……你真的坚持住了，对吧？你从未停止过战斗，哪怕一秒钟也没有。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2728
translate chinese finaletimer_bef666ce:

    # mc "We're so lucky that Midnight didn't finish her off."
    mc "我们真是走运，梦魇之月没把她彻底杀死。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2729
translate chinese finaletimer_521ebb27:

    # but "Hm... She probably had other plans for [aur] that we cancelled."
    but "嗯……她可能对[aur]另有安排，结果被我们打断了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2732
translate chinese finaletimer_1e68ade8:

    # mox "We need to get her somewhere safe. Fast."
    mox "我们必须尽快把她带到安全的地方。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2733
translate chinese finaletimer_980bf89b:

    # mc "We’ll take her to the castle. She needs a healer and time to recover."
    mc "我们会带她去城堡。她需要治疗师和时间来恢复。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2736
translate chinese finaletimer_229aead0:

    # mor "Easier said than done, all that cake went straight to the Queen's ass. I can barely stand, let alone carry her."
    mor "说来容易做来难，她吃蛋糕增加的脂肪全堆她屁股上了。我连站都站不稳，更别说背她了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2739
translate chinese finaletimer_22dd42f4:

    # bla "I’ll carry her. She’s our queen—and she saved our butts. I owe her this."
    bla "我来背她。她是我们的女王——而且她救了我们一命。这是我们欠她的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2744
translate chinese finaletimer_f0af0366:

    # hon "You’re stronger than you give yourself credit for, [bla]. Let me help you with that."
    hon "你比自己想象的要强大得多，[bla]。我来帮你吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2746
translate chinese finaletimer_9c358d70:

    # "Together, [bla] and [hon] carefully lift [aur]. She stirs slightly, murmuring something unintelligible, but doesn’t wake."
    "[bla]和[hon]合力，小心地抬起[aur]。她微微动弹，喃喃说着些听不清的话语，却并未醒来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2747
translate chinese finaletimer_711b4212:

    # "The group moves swiftly back to Arcadia as the dawn breaks. The city comes into view, the castle standing tall."
    "我们在破晓时分回到了Arcadia。城市逐渐映入眼帘，城堡巍然矗立。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2750
translate chinese finaletimer_58336184:

    # mox "Looks like Midnight hasn’t attacked the city yet. But we’ve got to act fast. No telling how long that’ll last."
    mox "看来梦魇之月尚未袭击这座城市。但我们还是必须加紧行动，谁知道这种平静能持续多久。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2753
translate chinese finaletimer_6b9646c8:

    # hon "Let’s get her inside. We can’t do anything if we’re worried about her dying on us."
    hon "快把她带进城堡里去吧。我怕她死在我们手上，而我们什么都做不了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2755
translate chinese finaletimer_7579813a:

    # "Cutting around the city to avoid prying eyes, we make our way into the back of castle where a couple of royal guards greet us."
    "绕过城中的街道，躲避窥探的目光，我们潜入到了城堡后方，几名皇家卫兵前来迎接。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2757
translate chinese finaletimer_fbd7b8d3:

    # misc "The Queen! Is she...?"
    misc "女王她...！？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2759
translate chinese finaletimer_4c4d4692:

    # lil "She’ll be okay. But she needs rest."
    lil "她会没事的。但她需要静养。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2760
translate chinese finaletimer_0ed36df1:

    # lil "Until she’s recovered, I’m taking command. I want you to call in healers, rally the guard, and prepare to defend the city."
    lil "在她康复之前，我将接过指挥权。我要你召集治疗师，集结卫兵，并准备好保卫这座城市。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2763
translate chinese finaletimer_fc05b78e:

    # "[lil] spits orders at various guards while the rest of the group carefully sets [aur] down on a plush couch in one of the quieter chambers. It’s soon swarmed with unicorns who begin tending to her with gentle magic."
    "[lil]对着几名领队厉声下令，其余的卫兵则小心地将[aur]安置在某间安静房间的软垫沙发上。转眼间，治疗师们便蜂拥而至，用温柔的魔法开始照料她。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2765
translate chinese finaletimer_72e62de8:

    # misc "Her strength is remarkable — it’s as though something greater is holding her together."
    misc "真是奇迹——仿佛有某种更强大的力量在支撑着她。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2768
translate chinese finaletimer_d79d3ad8:

    # lil "[aur], you’ve done more than enough. Rest now. We’ll take it from here."
    lil "[aur]，你已经做得够多了，休息吧，剩下的交给我们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2769
translate chinese finaletimer_82326b33:

    # mc "We regroup, we fortify, and we end this. Midnight won’t stand a chance."
    mc "我们将会重组，我们将会固守，我们将终结这一切。梦魇之月毫无胜算。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2772
translate chinese finaletimer_1697ca7d:

    # rik "Damn right. Let’s finish this once and for all."
    rik "没错。咱们一劳永逸地解决这事吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2775
translate chinese finaletimer_91b23d20:

    # "We step outside, the castle courtyard is abuzz with activity. Guards and civilians alike move with purpose, fortifying defenses and preparing for the battle ahead."
    "我们走出城堡，庭院里一片忙碌的景象。守卫与平民们都行动迅速，加固防御工事，为即将到来的战斗做准备。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2776
translate chinese finaletimer_99976a46:

    # "The group gathers around a hastily arranged table, a map of the city spread out before them. The golden light of dawn bathes the courtyard as the sun finally rises, granting a brief reprieve."
    "我们围坐在临时摆放的指挥桌旁，一张城市地图摊开在我们面前。黎明的金光浸润着庭院，太阳终于升起，我们得以休息片刻。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2777
translate chinese finaletimer_d4e43a71:

    # "The distant horizon is painted in hues of ominous purples and blacks."
    "遥远的地平线上被染上不祥的紫色与黑色。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2779
translate chinese finaletimer_da1b8c10:

    # lil "Alright, here’s where we stand. Midnight is hiding somewhere, gathering her strength. When night falls, she’ll have the cover and power she needs to strike. That gives us about twelve hours to prepare."
    lil "好，情况是这样的。梦魇之月正藏身某处积蓄力量。待夜幕降临，她便能获得发动袭击所需的掩护与能量。我们大约有十二小时的准备时间。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2782
translate chinese finaletimer_a48c1636:

    # but "Twelve hours to turn this city into a fortress. We’ve got our work cut out for us."
    but "十二小时内将这座城市变成一座堡垒。我们面临艰巨的任务。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2785
translate chinese finaletimer_6a291e1f:

    # rub "The Queen’s investment in the military is about to pay off. The guards will handle the nightmares and keep the city from being overrun. We need to focus on stopping Midnight directly."
    rub "女王对皇家军队的投资即将见效。皇家守卫们将应对那些梦魇，阻止城市被攻陷。我们只需要集中力量直接阻止梦魇之月。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2790
translate chinese finaletimer_11b72477:

    # mox "Which means we’re going to need one hell of a blast to take her down. No more grazing shots—next time, we end this."
    mox "这意味着我们得来个狠招才能干掉她。一击必杀——下次，我们一劳永逸地解决她。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2795
translate chinese finaletimer_6aa38dbd:

    # rik "Should we split up? There’s too much ground to cover and not enough time to do it together."
    rik "我们该分头行动吗？行动范围太广，如果一起行动的话时间又太少。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2800
translate chinese finaletimer_9146339f:

    # mor "Fine by me. I’m going somewhere to train. Just tell me where you need me. I’m not about to sit this one out."
    mor "我没问题，待会我要去找个地方训练去。告诉我集合地点就行，我不会袖手旁观的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2805
translate chinese finaletimer_01cd3435:

    # bla "Same here. Let’s focus on our strengths and get to work. We’ll regroup at sunset, ready to finish what we started."
    bla "我也是这么想的。让我们发挥各自的优势，立即行动起来。等日落的时候我们再重新集合，是时候画上句号了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2812
translate chinese finaletimer_5b49c4c2:

    # "The group splinter off, leaving me free with [mox] and [lil] in the courtyard."
    "队伍分头行动，留下我和[mox]、[lil]在庭院里自由活动。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2813
translate chinese finaletimer_11024168:

    # "We stand near a cleared area, the map table now forgotten as the girls begin practicing their magic."
    "我们站在一片空地旁，地图桌已被遗忘，女孩们开始练习魔法。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2814
translate chinese finaletimer_adbc2d5d:

    # lil "Alright, [mox]. I want to see just how powerful your magic can get."
    lil "好吧，[mox]。我要看看你的魔法究竟能有多强。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2815
translate chinese finaletimer_23005398:

    # lil "Let’s see how far we can push this. If we’re going to fight Midnight again, we’ve got to be ready."
    lil "让我看看你的极限在哪吧。如果要再和梦魇之月交手，我们必须做好准备。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2817
translate chinese finaletimer_15c1230c:

    # mox "Ready? Please. I was born for this."
    mox "认真的？别小看我。我生来就是耍魔法的好手。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2818
translate chinese finaletimer_7de4e628:

    # "[mox] extends her arm, a dark silver aura shimmering around her fingers. She focuses, and a sharp, jagged arc of energy bursts forth, slicing cleanly through a target dummy."
    "[mox]伸出手臂，暗银色的光晕在指尖闪烁。她凝神蓄力，一道锋利而参差的能量弧线骤然迸发，将靶子利落地劈成两半。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2820
translate chinese finaletimer_24b0ac8a:

    # "As [lil] watches, her eyes narrow as she studies the magic."
    "[lil]眯着眼睛，注视着她的一举一动，仔细研究着她的魔法。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2821
translate chinese finaletimer_208d513e:

    # lil "That’s… impressive. But it’s not just raw power, is it? There’s something… odd about the way your magic works. It’s almost like it’s pulling from somewhere I can’t sense."
    lil "这……真令我印象深刻。但这不只是单纯的魔法吧？你的魔法运作方式有些……古怪。像是从某个我无法感知的地方汲取的能量。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2822
translate chinese finaletimer_24124c65:

    # lil "I feel like I’ve always underestimated you because… I can’t really sense where your power is coming from."
    lil "我觉得自己一直低估了你，因为……我实在摸不透你的魔法究竟源自何处。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2823
translate chinese finaletimer_875ce83a:

    # lil "But at the prison, you really surprised me with that light show."
    lil "而且之前在监狱的时候，你那场爆闪魔法确实让我大吃一惊。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2825
translate chinese finaletimer_1be301db:

    # mox "Yeah, I’ve noticed that too. I’ve taken to calling it ‘lunar magic.’"
    mox "是啊，我也注意到了。我称之为“月之魔法”。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2827
translate chinese finaletimer_0fadf887:

    # lil "This isn’t just one of your magic 'tricks,' is it?"
    lil "这可不是你研究的那些那些“魔术”吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2828
translate chinese finaletimer_55f21fd4:

    # mc "No, it’s the real deal. [mox] is distantly related to [sel]. That power is the same as [sel]’s, a type of interdimensional alicorn magic."
    mc "不，这是真的魔法。[mox]与[sel]存在远亲关系。这种力量与[sel]相同，属于跨维度的魔法。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2830
translate chinese finaletimer_be516cb4:

    # lil "Huh… all that power and you used it for parlour tricks… Seriously, it’s interdimensional?"
    lil "啊这……这么强的能力，你居然用来表演魔术……说真的，这东西是跨维度的？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2831
translate chinese finaletimer_3a3738da:

    # mc "Yeah… that magic is what makes Midnight so dangerous."
    mc "是……梦魇之月强大的力量来源就是这种魔法。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2833
translate chinese finaletimer_ecfa5f8e:

    # lil "Hm… You're from another universe... Don’t tell me you're here because she can threaten other universes..."
    lil "嗯……你来自另一个宇宙……别告诉我你来这里的原因是因为她能威胁到其他宇宙……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2834
translate chinese finaletimer_16ac28ed:

    # mc "Heh, nothing eludes you, does it? Midnight isn’t just a threat to this city or this world. If she’s not stopped, she’ll figure out how to break through to other universes. She can spread her darkness far beyond what we’ve seen here."
    mc "嘿，你可真是无所不察啊。梦魇之月不仅是这座城市、这个世界的威胁。若不阻止她，她终将找到突破其他宇宙的方法。她的黑暗将造成比我现在还严重的影响。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2836
translate chinese finaletimer_146764d7:

    # mox "Well, that’s… unsettling. I wish I had enough of this power to stop her."
    mox "嗯，这……真可怕。真希望我能拥有足够的力量阻止她。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2837
translate chinese finaletimer_f8f2fac2:

    # mc "No one’s asking you to fight her alone. But you understand her power better than anyone else here, even if you don’t realize it yet."
    mc "谁都没要求你独自与她对抗。但你比在场的任何马都更了解她的力量——即便你自己尚未察觉。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2839
translate chinese finaletimer_0a924d00:

    # mox "Wait… could I control the darkness? Maybe manipulate it?"
    mox "等等……我能掌控黑暗吗？或许我还能操纵它？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2841
translate chinese finaletimer_865e4b2f:

    # lil "It’s a possibility, but what interested me was your manipulation of moonlight at the prison! You’re a virtue now too. If we can combine this magic with your new power boost…"
    lil "确实有这种可能，但真正让我感兴趣的是你在监狱时操控月光的魔法！如今你也是谐律精华的使用者了。若能将这种魔法与你新获得的谐律之力结合起来……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2843
translate chinese finaletimer_aac48ff8:

    # lil "There’s so much potential, but… I don’t really understand it. It’s a shame that the best teacher for this would be [sel] herself."
    lil "潜力如此巨大，但……可惜的是，我对这种魔法知之甚少，最适合教你的老师，正是[sel]她本尊。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2844
translate chinese finaletimer_8a0dcb07:

    # lil "If this ‘lunar magic’ is tied to her… could there be any way to separate her from the corruption without… destroying her completely?"
    lil "若这股“月之魔法”与她紧密相连……是否存在某种方法，能让她摆脱腐蚀却又不至于……彻底杀死她？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2846
translate chinese finaletimer_371f1637:

    # mox "You’re asking if we can somehow spare [sel]?"
    mox "你的意思是，我们能否设法在不伤害[sel]的情况下消灭梦魇之月？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2847
translate chinese finaletimer_fdfbf26a:

    # mc "It’s possible. I’ve seen something like this before. In my universe, [mox] and [mor] were once fused together, it was a very similar situation."
    mc "有这种可能。我以前见过类似的情况。在我的宇宙里，[mox]和[mor]曾经融合在一起，情况十分类似。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2848
translate chinese finaletimer_269e0cdd:

    # mc "They were tangled up in a way that seemed impossible to undo. But by holding back the virtue’s blast—just a little—we gave [mox] enough time to separate."
    mc "她们合为一体，仿佛再也无法分开。但通过稍稍抑制一部分魔法冲击波的力量，我们为那个宇宙的[mox]争取到了足够的时间，使其得以分开。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2850
translate chinese finaletimer_e7b59fd4:

    # lil "Holding back? Against Midnight? That’s a huge risk. What if it doesn’t work? What if she uses that time to strike back and wipe us out?"
    lil "抑制魔法？还是在对抗梦魇之月的时候？这风险太大了。万一失手怎么办？万一她趁机反击将我们全歼怎么办？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2851
translate chinese finaletimer_ae382616:

    # mc "I know it’s a risk. But it’s one worth considering. Midnight—[sel] wasn’t always like this. Somewhere inside her, the person she used to be is still there. If there’s even a chance to save her, isn’t it worth trying?"
    mc "我知道这很冒险，但值得一试。梦魇之月——[sel]并非一直如此，在她心底深处，曾经的那个她依然存在。只要还有一丝救赎的可能，难道不值得尝试吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2853
translate chinese finaletimer_2608b79a:

    # mox "I agree with [mc]. If there was no good left in Midnight, then [sel] wouldn’t have been able to contact [mc] at all."
    mox "我同意[mc]的观点。如果梦魇之月已无善念存留，那么[sel]根本就无法联系上[mc]。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2855
translate chinese finaletimer_62510c59:

    # lil "And [aur] surely would have been finished off..."
    lil "而[aur]肯定会被彻底杀死……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2856
translate chinese finaletimer_e1a3421b:

    # mc "My thoughts exactly."
    mc "我也是这么想的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2857
translate chinese finaletimer_b7d8fe5f:

    # mc "[lil], you’ve seen how the virtues work. We aren’t just weapons. We're meant to restore balance, to heal what’s broken."
    mc "[lil]，你见识过谐律精华的力量。我们不仅是武器，更肩负着恢复平衡、修复破碎世界的使命。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2859
translate chinese finaletimer_295449b3:

    # lil "You’re asking us to gamble everything on the idea that there’s still good in her. It’s not that I don’t want to believe it, but we can’t risk losing everything for a hope that might not even exist anymore."
    lil "你让我们把一切都押在她内心尚存善念的幻想上。并非我不愿相信，但我们不能为一个或许早已不复存在的希望，赌上失去一切的风险。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2860
translate chinese finaletimer_5059bfdb:

    # lil "… I’ll think about it. But if it comes down to it, if she’s too far gone and it’s her or the city… I won’t hesitate to do what needs to be done."
    lil "……我会考虑的。但如果到了那一步，如果她已经无可救药，必须在她和这座城市之间做出选择的话……我绝不会犹豫，定会采取必要行动。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2862
translate chinese finaletimer_fcea799e:

    # mox "Fair enough. But if anyone’s going to pull off a miracle, it’s us, right?"
    mox "说得对。但要说谁能创造奇迹，那肯定是我们，对吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2864
translate chinese finaletimer_7dd39382:

    # lil "[mc], have you thought about trying magic yourself?"
    lil "[mc]，你有没有考虑过学习魔法？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2865
translate chinese finaletimer_148b1d4b:

    # mc "Me? Magic?"
    mc "我？学魔法？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2867
translate chinese finaletimer_5706de64:

    # lil "You got that power boost too, I can sense untapped magical power running thick throughout you. Don’t forget that you channelled it into me earlier."
    lil "你也获得了力量，我能感受到未开发的魔法力量在你体内奔涌。别忘了你之前曾将这股力量导入过我的体内。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2869
translate chinese finaletimer_04f7826f:

    # mox "Oh, I’d pay to see you throwing around fireballs, [mc]!"
    mox "哈哈~，我愿意花钱看你扔火球，[mc]！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2870
translate chinese finaletimer_43963742:

    # mc "I mean… I’ve felt something. But figuring out how to use it is a whole other story."
    mc "我的意思是……我确实感受到了我体内的某种东西。但要弄明白如何运用它，那可就是另一回事了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2872
translate chinese finaletimer_ac2ad6fe:

    # lil "Then why not start figuring it out? I believe [rub] and [bla] went off to do exactly that. [rub] could give you some pointers. She’s a talented spellcaster, even if she doesn’t act like it sometimes."
    lil "那为什么不开始研究呢？我猜[rub]和[bla]就是为此而去的。[rub]或许能给你些指点。她其实在这方面很有天赋，虽然有时表现得不像。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2874
translate chinese finaletimer_3b31d7ec:

    # lil "You’ll never know what you’re capable of until you try. Midnight isn’t pulling any punches, so you shouldn’t either."
    lil "你不去试试怎么会知道自己的潜力有多高呢。梦魇之月从不手下留情，你也不该如此。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2876
translate chinese finaletimer_a0f2a750:

    # mox "Go on, [mc]. Go figure out how to blow something up with your mind. You’ve earned it."
    mox "去吧，[mc]。去研究下怎么使用魔法吧。你值得去研究。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2877
translate chinese finaletimer_a9808c53:

    # mc "Can’t argue with that. I’ve wanted to use magic ever since I first met you."
    mc "没问题。自从遇见你，我就幻想着能和你一起施展魔法。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2883
translate chinese finaletimer_9d85fc4d:

    # "The sun continues to rise, a moment of calm before the storm. I should take this opportunity to check what everyone else is doing. I could learn a few tricks and powers of my own."
    "太阳照常升起，暴风雨前的片刻宁静。我该趁此机会看看大家都在做些什么。或许能学到些技巧，掌握些属于自己的力量。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2888
translate chinese finm2_52f74bb3:

    # "In a quieter area near the castle gardens. [rub] and [bla] are standing side by side, both focused on a small, swirling orb of light hovering between them."
    "我在城堡花园附近的一处僻静区域找到了[rub]与[bla]，她们并肩而立，紧盯着两马之间悬浮的一颗光球。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2891
translate chinese finm2_eaf0ffb9:

    # bla "I think I’ve got it this time… maybe…"
    bla "我大概搞明白了……大概吧……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2894
translate chinese finm2_df90d6f1:

    # rub "Don’t think. Feel. Magic isn’t just about control—it’s about flow. Let it guide you."
    rub "别去想它。去感受它。魔法不仅关乎掌控——更关乎流动。让它引领你的动作。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2895
translate chinese finm2_d09be733:

    # mc "Hey, uh… hope I’m not interrupting."
    mc "嗨……希望我没打扰到你们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2897
translate chinese finm2_823690e5:

    # rub "[mc]! Perfect timing. I was just about to see if [bla] here could juggle this without setting herself on fire."
    rub "[mc]！你来得真好。我正想看看[bla]能不能在不把自己烧着的情况下成功施法。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2899
translate chinese finm2_d57dd8a8:

    # bla "{i}*Half laughing, half panicking*{/i} No pressure, right?"
    bla "{i}*紧张的笑了笑*{/i} 没问题的，对吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2900
translate chinese finm2_b03761cb:

    # mc "Actually, I was hoping you could help me out. [lil] said I might be able to use magic… but I have no idea where to start."
    mc "其实，我正想着你或许能教一教我。[lil]说我或许能施展魔法……可我完全不知道该怎么用它。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2902
translate chinese finm2_f5b3db7a:

    # rub "Oh, I’d love to show you the ropes, darling."
    rub "哦，亲爱的，我很乐意带你熟悉魔法的运用。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2904
translate chinese finm2_4697c584:

    # bla "I’m trying to figure it out too! Look, I managed to make this orb – oh, it’s gone."
    bla "我也在努力学呢！你看，这个光球，我做的哦~——哦，它消失了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2906
translate chinese finm2_443d4a22:

    # rub "That’s because you lost focus, dear."
    rub "亲爱的，这是因为你分心了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2907
translate chinese finm2_45b656bc:

    # mc "Alright, how do we start?"
    mc "好，那我们从哪里开始呢？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2908
translate chinese finm2_fa15154d:

    # "[rub] claps her hands together, visibly excited."
    "[rub]兴奋地拍了拍手。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2910
translate chinese finm2_27d27e5b:

    # rub "Let’s start simple. We all have the same power flowing through us, right? Close your eyes, take a deep breath, and feel for it."
    rub "让我们先从简单开始吧。我们体内都流淌着同样的魔法力量，对吧？闭上眼睛，深呼吸，去感受它。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2911
translate chinese finm2_fde103e4:

    # mc "Alright… feeling for it. Whatever ‘it’ is."
    mc "好吧……感受它。先别管它是什么。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2913
translate chinese finm2_e11fc0e7:

    # rub "Don’t overthink it. Magic’s not a formula—it’s intuition. Let it find you."
    rub "别想太多。魔法不是做数学——它是一种感觉。让它来找你。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2914
translate chinese finm2_dd230dda:

    # "The air around me seems to shift slightly, a faint glow radiates from my chest… In exactly the same way a unicorn’s horn might glow."
    "我周围的空气似乎微微波动，胸口泛起微弱的光晕……恰似角马的犄角在施法时会发光那样。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2916
translate chinese finm2_99a648ee:

    # bla "Whoa… he figured it out much faster than I did!"
    bla "哇……他学得比我更快！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2918
translate chinese finm2_a88d7cad:

    # rub "Not bad for a first try, darling! Now, let’s see if you can channel that into something more than a glow stick."
    rub "作为新手来说真的很不错，亲爱的！现在，让我们看看你能否把它转化成比发光更有价值的魔法。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2919
translate chinese finm2_c1687554:

    # rub "Let’s start with something simpler. I want you to try moving this."
    rub "我们先从简单点的事情开始。我想让你试着移动这个东西。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2920
translate chinese finm2_06163ec1:

    # "[rub] picks up a small, smooth stone from the ground and places it on a nearby table."
    "[rub]从地上捡起一块小巧光滑的石头，将其放在附近的桌子上。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2922
translate chinese finm2_4dc4caf9:

    # rub "Channel that magic once again, then lift this stone with your will."
    rub "再次唤醒那股魔力，然后凭你的意志举起这块石头。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2923
translate chinese finm2_b96c02fa:

    # "I take a deep breath and close my eyes to focus. The faint glow intensifies as I extend one hand towards the rock."
    "我深吸一口气，闭上双眼聚精会神。当我将一只手伸向小石子时，那微弱的光芒逐渐增强。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2924
translate chinese finm2_31675e15:

    # "For a moment, nothing happens, but then the stone begins to tremble."
    "片刻间，什么都没发生，但随后石头开始颤动。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2926
translate chinese finm2_3f49b92d:

    # bla "It’s moving! You’re doing it!"
    bla "它在移动！你做到了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2927
translate chinese finm2_9d198a38:

    # mc "*{i}I grit my teeth as I struggle to lift it{/i}* Yeah, but it’s… heavier than it looks!"
    mc "*{i}我咬紧牙关，费力地把它举起来{/i}* 是啊，但它……比看起来重多了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2929
translate chinese finm2_6b08338e:

    # rub "It’s not heavy. You’re overthinking it again. Don’t force it—guide it. Let the energy flow naturally."
    rub "它并不重。你想太多了，这削弱了你的魔法。别强求它——只需引导它。让能量自然流动。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2930
translate chinese finm2_e293ed52:

    # "I try to adjust my focus, and the trembling stone starts to lift a few inches off the table."
    "我努力调整思绪，那块颤动的石头开始移动，从桌面上抬高了几厘米。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2934
translate chinese finm2_1436ec19:

    # "The girls let out a slight cheer, which breaks my concentration and sends the rock tumbling back down."
    "女孩们发出轻微的欢呼声，这声响打断了我的思绪，导致石头落了下来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2935
translate chinese finm2_37fbdecd:

    # mc "*{i}Pant, pant{/i}* I can’t believe it… I just did magic!"
    mc "{i}喘着粗气{/i}* 我简直不敢相信……我刚刚施展了魔法！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2937
translate chinese finm2_8839b632:

    # bla "It wasn’t just that! You lifted the entire table!"
    bla "可不只是这样！你把整张桌子都抬起来了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2938
translate chinese finm2_e607b68a:

    # mc "I… did? I was so focused on the stone that I didn’t notice!"
    mc "真……真的？我当时注意力全在那块石头上，完全没注意到！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2940
translate chinese finm2_48550de0:

    # rub "Fantastic, darling. You have a high baseline of magic due to the virtue’s power. That’s quite an unusual starting point to begin learning."
    rub "太棒了，亲爱的。你因谐律精华而拥有极高的魔法潜力。这可是相当不寻常的学习起点呢。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2941
translate chinese finm2_15bd552f:

    # rub "Why don’t we try to focus that energy on something that could be effective tonight. How about conjuring a ball of heat?"
    rub "我们何不把这股能量集中到对今晚有帮助的事情上？比如召唤一个温度很高的球，怎么样？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2942
translate chinese finm2_51a498c9:

    # mc "Kind of like a fireball?"
    mc "你的意思是火球？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2944
translate chinese finm2_66e27297:

    # rub "Exactly. But try not to set anything on fire. Yet."
    rub "没错，但不要火，至少现在别。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2945
translate chinese finm2_7f8e4e7f:

    # "[rub] demonstrates, holding out her hand and conjuring a small, flickering orb of light that hovers just above her palm."
    "[rub]开始演示，她伸出手掌，凭空召唤出一颗微小的、闪烁着的光球，悬浮在她手掌上方。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2946
translate chinese finm2_efb3d100:

    # rub "Now, if I were to throw this, it’d deal serious damage."
    rub "是这样的，如果我把它扔出去，它会对受击目标造成严重的伤害。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2947
translate chinese finm2_522c2275:

    # "She dismisses it with a flick of her wrist and gestures for me to try."
    "她微微挥了挥手，示意我试试看。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2949
translate chinese finm2_246a5d85:

    # rub "Same idea as the rock. Focus on the energy, but this time, think about creating fire. Picture it forming in your hand—focused, controlled."
    rub "与隔空取物的原理相同。专注于感受魔法，但这次要想象火焰。想象它在你掌心凝聚成形的感觉——成形、可控。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2950
translate chinese finm2_52ca1e5a:

    # mc "Alright… focused and controlled. Got it."
    mc "……保持专注和可控的感觉。明白了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2951
translate chinese finm2_ee23a7a1:

    # "I extend my hand, and after a moment of focus, a faint, flickering light begins to form."
    "我伸出手，凝神片刻后，一缕微弱的光芒开始凝聚成形。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2952
translate chinese finm2_e2b2ad6a:

    # "It’s shaky at first, and [rub] remains on standby to ensure it doesn’t go wrong, but with a little more effort, it stabilizes into a small orb."
    "起初这缕光芒摇摆不定，[rub]仍在一旁待命以防失误，但我稍加努力后，它便稳定成一个小球体。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2954
translate chinese finm2_018eea18:

    # bla "You did it! That’s amazing!"
    bla "你做到了！太棒了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2955
translate chinese finm2_cc40f3c4:

    # mc "Huh… I actually did it."
    mc "哈……我居然做到了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2957
translate chinese finm2_cbc851e0:

    # rub "Told you it wasn’t that hard, dear. Now, imagine what you could do if you practiced a bit more."
    rub "我说过了，这并不难，亲爱的。现在，想象一下，如果你再多练习一点魔法，你会变得有多强呢？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2958
translate chinese finm2_84ee50a9:

    # mc "Thanks for the lesson. This is so amazing. But I'm worried about how useful I can be in a fight."
    mc "感谢你能教我，这真是太神奇了。但我还是有点担心自己在战斗中到底能派上多大的用处。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2960
translate chinese finm2_c3fbea73:

    # rub "Magic is born from imagination combined with willpower, in the heat of the moment, it'll come more naturally than you expect."
    rub "魔法诞生于想象力与意志力的结合，在激情迸发的时刻，它自会显现，比你预想得还要自然。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2961
translate chinese finm2_6001e51f:

    # rub "If you’re ever threatened, create that orb once again and toss it at your foes."
    rub "若你遭遇威胁，请再次召唤那颗能量球，将其投向它。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2962
translate chinese finm2_51f7ee11:

    # "Look at me, finally learning magic... I never thought I'd see the day."
    "瞧瞧我，终于学会魔法了……真没想到还有这一天。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2963
translate chinese finm2_847213e3:

    # "The three of us spend a few more hours practicing together until [bla] and I have a variety of tricks under our belts."
    "两马一人又一起练习了几个小时，直到[bla]和我掌握了各种魔法技巧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2970
translate chinese finm2_d57d2487:

    # "The courtyard echoes with the rhythmic sounds of fists hitting training dummies and the sharp clinks of sparring weapons."
    "庭院里回荡着拳头击打训练假人的有节奏声响，以及兵器碰撞时清脆的铿锵声。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2976
translate chinese finm2_a5f2eeba:

    # "[hon] and [rik] stand at one side, their movements fluid yet powerful as they exchange techniques, testing their newfound physical prowess."
    "[hon]与[rik]并立一侧，动作流畅而有力，她们在切磋武艺，试探着新力量。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2977
translate chinese finm2_4e7b8081:

    # hon "Y’know, [rik], I thought y’all were all talk at first, but after seeing your fancy footwork, I gotta admit, it’s somethin’ else in a fight."
    hon "嘿，[rik]，说实话，起初我还以为你之前全是在吹牛呢，但看了你那套花哨的脚法后，不得不承认，确实有两下子。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2979
translate chinese finm2_dd97b8a5:

    # rik "And here I thought you were all brawn without depth. Turns out you’ve got some pretty sharp instincts when it counts."
    rik "我还以为你只是个头脑简单、毫无技巧的莽夫呢。没想到关键时刻，你的直觉还挺敏锐的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2981
translate chinese finm2_c14d1a45:

    # hon "Bwahaha. Guess we’re not half bad together, huh? What do ya say we push it even further?"
    hon "噗哈哈~。看来我们搭档的还挺不错的嘛？要不要再多试几招？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2983
translate chinese finm2_4ca150b8:

    # rik "Let’s do it. If Midnight thinks she can just waltz in and take this city, she’s got another thing coming."
    rik "来吧。如果梦魇之月以为她能随随便便就占领我们的城市，那她可就大错特错了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2989
translate chinese finm2_85eabb4b:

    # "As I approach, the two launch into a sparring match. [hon]’s raw power is on full display, each swing of her fists carrying enough force to send shockwaves through the ground."
    "当我走近时，两马突然对打起来。[hon]的蛮力尽显无遗，她每挥出一拳，地面都会震出阵阵波纹。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2990
translate chinese finm2_d3264fd0:

    # "[rik]’s speed and wing mobility keeps her one step ahead, darting around [hon]’s strikes and delivering swift counterattacks."
    "[rik]凭借速度与灵巧的双翼始终快她一步，在[hon]的攻击间隙中穿梭闪避，并迅速发起反击。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2991
translate chinese finm2_3c0bdeca:

    # mc "You two are really giving it your all, huh? It’s like watching a mountain and a storm go head-to-head."
    mc "你们俩这手下得可真是重啊，简直像看高山与风暴在正面交锋一样。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2996
translate chinese finm2_66011749:

    # hon "Hey there, [mc]! C’mon, don’t just stand there—jump in! Let’s see what you’ve got."
    hon "嘿，[mc]！别光站着——快加入我们吧！让我们看看你的本事。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:2997
translate chinese finm2_6f76bf52:

    # mc "E-Eh? Me?!"
    mc "我-我吗？！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3000
translate chinese finm2_d25fdddf:

    # rik "Yeah, [mc]. Let’s see what you’ve got after the power boost!"
    rik "是啊，[mc]。让我们看看你增强后的实力吧！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3001
translate chinese finm2_ee8711b8:

    # mc "I suppose there’s no harm in limit testing. I don’t even know how strong I am right now."
    mc "测试一下自己的极限在哪应该无妨。我甚至不知道自己现在有多强呢。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3007
translate chinese finm2_9e4fb35e:

    # "I step into the fray, and we begin some light-hearted sparring."
    "我踏入训练场，开始了轻松愉快的对练。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3008
translate chinese finm2_84b2f7b9:

    # "My reaction times are sharper, I’m able to see the incoming attacks and dodge with so much agility and precision that my brain struggles to keep up."
    "我的反应变得更加敏锐，能够精确预判袭来的攻击，并以敏捷而又精准的动作闪避，快得连我自己都没反应过来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3009
translate chinese finm2_eb20e4ab:

    # "But the raw boost only gets me so far. My lack of physical experience quickly shows, and it becomes clear that [hon] and [rik] are in a league of their own."
    "但力量的加成终究不足。我缺乏实战经验的短板很快暴露无遗，[hon]和[rik]的实力显然已属另一个层次。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3010
translate chinese finm2_c57215c0:

    # "They were always much stronger, but they’ve managed to take advantage of the new power flowing through them to elevate their strength and speed to new heights."
    "她他们原本就实力超群，如今更能善用体内涌动的新力量，将力量与速度提升至全新境界。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3011
translate chinese finm2_20f2a01a:

    # "I dodge a powerful swing from [hon], barely staying up right as the shockwave in the air alone almost knocks me back."
    "我闪避了[hon]的重拳，勉强保持平衡——仅是挥拳带来的风就几乎将我震飞。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3012
translate chinese finm2_9486aa30:

    # mc "Okay, okay! I’d rather not be recovering with the Queen."
    mc "停停停！我还不想当女王的病友。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3017
translate chinese finm2_08a70d85:

    # hon "Sorry, sugarcube! I’m still getting used to all this power. It’s somethin’ else. I feel like I could rip a tree clean outta the ground if I tried."
    hon "抱歉啦，甜心！我还在适应这股力量呢。这真是不可思议，我感觉如果我再多使点劲的话，能把整棵树连根拔起。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3020
translate chinese finm2_aea3dae1:

    # rik "I thought it was just ‘magic’ at first, but it’s like it’s fueling our bodies too. I’ve never felt this fast—or this strong. I’m almost a little sour at how fast I can move right now."
    rik "起初我以为这只是某种“魔法”，但它似乎也在为我们的身体注入力量。我从未感受过如此迅捷——如此强悍的力量。我都觉得我现在快得实在是有点太夸张了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3021
translate chinese finm2_5546ee90:

    # mc "Sheesh… The two of you together? I feel sorry for whoever tries to take you on directly."
    mc "天呐……谁能打得过你俩？真替那些想挑战你们的马感到惋惜。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3023
translate chinese finm2_0817b4d9:

    # hon "Damn straight. But we’re not done yet. If we’re gonna fight someone like Midnight… we gotta be better than our best."
    hon "没错。但还不够，要对付梦魇之月这种对手……我们必须更加努力。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3025
translate chinese finm2_9315cb94:

    # rik "And that means no holding back. Come on, let’s see if we can push this even further."
    rik "这意味着我们绝不能放弃。来吧，再多练几下，看看我们能不能突破极限。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3026
translate chinese finm2_13c2ba12:

    # "I join them in their training for a few hours, adjusting to my new agility and strength."
    "我与她俩一同训练了数小时，逐渐适应了自己新获得的力量。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3027
translate chinese finm2_56d02601:

    # "Afterwards, I leave them to it. Their movements become even more precise and powerful. I watch for a moment, with a sense of awe."
    "随后，我便让她们自顾自地练习。她们的动作变得更加精准有力。我驻足观望片刻，心中充满敬畏。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3028
translate chinese finm2_3484fa1e:

    # "With allies like these, the fight ahead feels just a little less daunting."
    "有这样的战友，未来的战斗似乎没那么恐怖了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3035
translate chinese finm2_6ae2284e:

    # "I overhear that [pen] has also arrived at the castle and is with [but] in the laboratory. Curious, I head down there myself."
    "我听闻[pen]来城堡了，正与[but]在实验室里。出于好奇，我决定去那看看。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3036
translate chinese finm2_599b065d:

    # "The incense of herbs and alchemical ingredients hit me as I step inside. [but] and [pen] are hard at work with some assistants, surrounded by cluttered tables filled with vials, books, and relics of various shapes and sizes."
    "踏入门内，草药与炼药素材的香气扑面而来。[but]和[pen]正与几名助手忙碌着，周围杂乱的桌面上堆满小瓶、书籍以及形形色色的圣物。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3041
translate chinese finm2_f4b3b61e:

    # mc "[pen]! So happy you could join us."
    mc "[pen]！真高兴你能加入我们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3042
translate chinese finm2_00e63030:

    # pen "I was hoping to finish my report today, not save the world. I wonder… if I do save the world, do you think they’ll give me a deadline extension?"
    pen "我本来打算在今天写完我的研究报告的.....我在想……如果真救了世界，他们会允许我延期提交吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3043
translate chinese finm2_449f5e15:

    # mc "Heck, they should just give you the qualification at that point."
    mc "牛B，按理说他们在那时候就该直接发给你资格认证了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3044
translate chinese finm2_8a74a997:

    # mc "Looks like you two have been busy."
    mc "看来你们俩一直很忙。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3046
translate chinese finm2_d2a18cf8:

    # but "I’ve prepared strength, speed, and vitality potions. When you prepare for the worst, you must bring the best!"
    but "我已备好力量药剂、速度药剂和活力药剂。当你为最坏的情况做准备时，必须带上最好的装备！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3047
translate chinese finm2_87c2a823:

    # mc "As long as I won’t be fighting with erections."
    mc "别让我在不该勃起的时候勃起就行。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3049
translate chinese finm2_d74354ab:

    # pen "Erections?"
    pen "勃起？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3051
translate chinese finm2_2e60b729:

    # but "It’s not a long story, but… it’s a {i}long{/i} story. Hehe."
    but "故事不长，但……某种意义上也是个{i}很长{/i}的故事。嘿嘿~。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3052
translate chinese finm2_026eca64:

    # but "Don’t worry, I’ve been able to use much higher quality ingredients for these brews."
    but "别担心，我这次炼药用的素材比之前用的好得多。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3053
translate chinese finm2_05007c45:

    # mc "What are you working on, [pen]?"
    mc "你在写什么呢，[pen]？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3055
translate chinese finm2_391209cb:

    # pen "I’m creating a list of equipment. You remember relics, right? Magically enchanted accessories and equipment that imbue the wearer with a little of that magic."
    pen "我正在列一份装备清单。你还记得圣物是什么吧？那些经过魔法加持的饰品和装备，能让佩戴者获得些许魔魔法加成。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3056
translate chinese finm2_9da562ea:

    # pen "We’ve got rings of protection for everyone. They’ll help guard against some of the more direct magic attacks. I’ve also prepared a few enchanted pendants that should amplify your abilities, at least for a short period of time."
    pen "我们为你们都准备了防护护符，它们能抵御部分魔法攻击。我还备了几枚魔法吊坠，能暂时增强你们的战斗能力。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3058
translate chinese finm2_c9bd38b7:

    # pen "I’ve even got a few experimental pieces. Let’s just hope they work!"
    pen "我甚至还有几件实验性道具。但愿它们能派上用场！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3059
translate chinese finm2_932d6b5c:

    # but "You’re really going to test those in battle?"
    but "你真要在实战中检验这些东西？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3061
translate chinese finm2_0f8d5326:

    # pen "Well, I’ve been looking to get experimental data for my thesis. Better than waiting for the worst to happen without them."
    pen "我一直在为论文收集实验数据。与其坐等最坏的情况发生，不如先把论文该要的数据搞定。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3062
translate chinese finm2_5cd44100:

    # mc "You two are going all-in, huh? I can’t help but notice your specialties complement each other pretty well."
    mc "这么拼命啊？不得不说，你们各自的专长倒是挺互补的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3064
translate chinese finm2_18e99104:

    # pen "Yeah, we kind of stumbled into it. I actually love enchanting and alchemy, and yet I’m useless at making potions."
    pen "是啊，这也算是种偶然吧。其实我超爱附魔和炼金术的，附魔好说，可偏偏在制作药水方面我毫无天赋。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3066
translate chinese finm2_53b7231d:

    # but "And I love alchemy, but was unable to do enchanting due to a lack of magic. Who knows, that may change."
    but "我差不多，擅长炼药，却因缺乏魔法而无法进行任何形式的附魔。但说不定以后就会了，谁知道呢。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3068
translate chinese finm2_0be42132:

    # pen "We could work together and show the world how awesome these overlooked magical arts can be!"
    pen "我们可以携手合作，向世界展示这些被忽视的艺术有多么精彩！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3070
translate chinese finm2_c9905510:

    # but "Calling them overlooked hits close to home. I’ve lived for a long time, and it’s sad to me that these ancient crafts of ours have been overlooked in comparison to technology."
    but "称它们为被忽视的艺术，真的让我很开心。我活了这么久，看到这些古老的手艺在科技面前被冷落，实在令我可惜。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3072
translate chinese finm2_be89f5a7:

    # pen "I can understand, technology is a lot more accessible, especially to a country without any magic."
    pen "我能理解，科技如今变得触手可及，研究与发展得门槛都比魔法低，对一个没有魔法存在的国家而言更是如此。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3074
translate chinese finm2_e7b9721d:

    # pen "What I can appreciate about technology is that we can utilize it to push even deeper into our own fields. That in itself can be quite exciting, don’t you think?"
    pen "我喜欢科技的地方在于，我们能借助它在各自领域进行更深入的研究。这本身就令马振奋，你觉得呢？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3076
translate chinese finm2_30c6ca73:

    # but "I admit, this laboratory is putting my home to shame. I’m taking notes."
    but "我不得不承认，这间实验室的条件确实比我家好多了。这点我得记下来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3077
translate chinese finm2_b665f110:

    # but "Say, now that I can do magic. If I taught you a little about brewing, would you be so kind as to show me a few enchanting tricks?"
    but "说起来，既然现在我已经能施法了，不如我教你炼金，你教我魔法吧，怎么样？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3079
translate chinese finm2_03974509:

    # pen "You’ve got a deal!"
    pen "好啊！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3080
translate chinese finm2_cc964b66:

    # mc "Already making future plans. I’m glad you’re feeling so confident."
    mc "这就开始制定未来计划啦。看到你们这么自信，我很开心。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3082
translate chinese finm2_23baaa8e:

    # but "In situations like this, you’ve got to believe you’ll make it through to the other side."
    but "在这种情况下，你必须相信自己。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3084
translate chinese finm2_6250be35:

    # pen "And if I’m dead, who’s going to finish my report?"
    pen "如果我死了，谁来完成我的报告？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3085
translate chinese finm2_9bdd6dee:

    # "I couldn't ask for two better people to prepare our equipment."
    "再也找不到比她们更合适的马来准备我们的装备了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3086
translate chinese finm2_0711b038:

    # "I spend a couple of hours helping them out. It almost feels like an alchemy and enchanting class at times, but the results are no joke. By the time we're done, we have enough potions and equipment for the entire group."
    "我花了几个小时帮她们忙。有时感觉就像在上炼金课和魔法课，但成果可一点都不含糊。等我们忙完时，已经备足了全队所需的药水和装备。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3093
translate chinese finm2_4aee24c4:

    # "As I round a corner, I’m taken aback by the sight that greets me."
    "当我拐过街角时，眼前的景象令我猝不及防。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3094
translate chinese finm2_a50d3bf8:

    # "[cre], with an entire army of clones. About fifty of them preparing for battle."
    "[cre]，带着一支克隆大军。约五十名克隆马正在备战。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3096
translate chinese finm2_d59b2a61:

    # mc "[cre]! What a pleasant surprise."
    mc "[cre]！真是个惊喜。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3098
translate chinese finm2_a1bb99f6:

    # cre "Heyyy! We’ve been on standby this entire time. [bla] said you’d need us now more than ever, and it seems she was right."
    cre "嗨！我们一直在这待命呢。[bla]说你现在比以往任何时候都更需要我们的帮助，看来她说的没错。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3100
translate chinese finm2_74012395:

    # cre "Phew… Can't believe you're back here again. You’re so close now, aren’t you?"
    cre "呼……真不敢相信你又回来了。决战的时间快到了吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3101
translate chinese finm2_fe16eab8:

    # mc "We are, but it’s going to take everything we have to get over that last hurdle."
    mc "是快到了，但要跨越这最后一道障碍，我们必须倾尽全力才行。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3103
translate chinese finm2_974890f1:

    # cre "You’ve done more than anyone could have ever expected from you, [mc]. Everyone would be so proud of you."
    cre "你所取得的成就远超我们的预期，[mc]。所有马都会为你感到无比自豪。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3104
translate chinese finm2_fae44bdf:

    # mc "You still won’t let me back to my universe the easy way?"
    mc "所以你还是不肯让我轻易地回到自己的宇宙里啊？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3106
translate chinese finm2_5d6e4dea:

    # cre "Turns out, if we tried that, you’d get kicked back by my superiors!"
    cre "没那么简单，要是我真这么做了，你绝对会被比我更高的存在打发回来的！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3108
translate chinese finm2_2e086809:

    # cre "But I have a good feeling that you’ll find another way~"
    cre "不过嘛，我有预感你会找到其他办法的~"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3109
translate chinese finm2_7485d96d:

    # mc "I hope so too. But I don’t know what I would have done without you and [bla]. I’m really grateful for your help."
    mc "希望如此吧。但若没有你和[bla]，我真不知该怎么办。你能来帮我们，我真的感激不尽。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3111
translate chinese finm2_b76b764f:

    # cre "I’m always happy to help!"
    cre "举手之劳！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3112
translate chinese finm2_272a1383:

    # "The ground shakes a little, and I catch a certain duo sparring."
    "地面微微震动，我瞥见旁边有两匹马正在对练。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3114
translate chinese finm2_db58d0a1:

    # cre "But… this is unexpected."
    cre "呀……这真是出乎我的意料。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3123
translate chinese finm2_3af539d5:

    # "In the background, [mor] and Deathclaw are sparring. They looked like they were really enjoying themselves."
    "背景中，[mor]和死亡爪正在对练。她们看起来打得相当尽兴。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3124
translate chinese finm2_072e3b1e:

    # "[mor], despite the recent setbacks, seems to have already recovered, moving fluidly as she matches Deathclaw blow-by-blow."
    "尽管[mor]最近遇到了点挫折，但她现在似乎已从其中恢复了过来，她与死亡爪的攻防交锋中步步紧逼，动作流畅自如。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3125
translate chinese finm2_42b8289b:

    # "Wait a second, just how crazy-powerful is that [cre] variant?"
    "等等，那个[cre]变种到底有多强？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3129
translate chinese finm2_8d38a653:

    # cre "I didn’t expect to see [mor] fighting alongside us... especially after everything that happened with ours. It’s a little... strange."
    cre "我没想到[mor]会站在我们这一边……尤其是考虑到之前我发生了点不那么愉快的情况下。这感觉有点……奇怪。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3130
translate chinese finm2_2848f684:

    # mc "It took me a long time to get used to it too."
    mc "我也花了很长时间才习惯她的加入。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3131
translate chinese finm2_6c388518:

    # mc "But this [mor] has shown a strength of character completely unfounded in the [mor] we knew. She’s a true ally, if not an unlikely one."
    mc "但这个[mor]展现出的坚韧品格，与我们所知的[mor]截然不同。她虽是个意外的盟友，却是真正的伙伴。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3132
translate chinese finm2_b4cfb1f9:

    # mc "Still, after everything… it feels a little surreal."
    mc "然而，经历了这一切之后……我仍觉得有些不真实。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3134
translate chinese finm2_c7cc96c5:

    # cre "I know it’s not easy to trust someone with her history, especially someone so dangerous. But I had a few interactions with her, and I agree. She’s not just fighting for herself, and that's the key difference."
    cre "我知道要信任这样的马并不容易，尤其是和她有过那样的经历，更何况对方如此危险。不过嘛，我与她有过几次接触，我也同意你的看法。她不只是为自己而战，这才是关键的区别。 "

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3135
translate chinese finm2_4ab7e5ac:

    # mc "But it’s hard to shake the feeling that this is… temporary. What happens when Midnight is dealt with? Will she go back to what she was?"
    mc "但我总觉得这种情况只是……暂时的。等梦魇之月这事解决后会变成什么样？她会不会重新变回我们熟悉的她？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3137
translate chinese finm2_20c76359:

    # cre "That’s a question only [mor] can answer. Sometimes, the path to redemption isn’t a straight line. We’ve all had our moments of doubt, of darkness."
    cre "这个问题只有[mor]才能回答。有时，救赎之路并非笔直。我们都曾经历过怀疑与黑暗的时刻。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3138
translate chinese finm2_81b4373b:

    # cre "Right now, she’s chosen to stand with you, fight with us."
    cre "而此刻，她选择与你并肩而立，与我们共同战斗。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3139
translate chinese finm2_8fa5e798:

    # "[mor] narrowly avoids another heavy strike from Deathclaw. The fierce determination in her eyes is undeniable."
    "[mor]险险躲过死亡爪的又一次猛烈攻击。她眼中那股强烈的决心无可否认。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3140
translate chinese finm2_50401fae:

    # mc "You’re right. For now, we’ve got to focus on what’s in front of us."
    mc "你说得对。我们必须专注于眼下的事。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3141
translate chinese finm2_9cfde3a6:

    # mc "Speaking of, what’s in front of me right now is your ‘army’, I can’t even begin to imagine how much power you’ve brought with you."
    mc "说起来，这些都是你带来的“军队”吧，数量之多，力量之大，简直超乎我的预期。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3143
translate chinese finm2_07d72b40:

    # cre "We're ready to party! We can hold the line. We’ll help keep the city protected, particularly while you and the others focus on Midnight."
    cre "我们已经准备好了！我们会进行协防工作。当你们专注于击败梦魇之月时，我们会协助你们防守这座城市。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3144
translate chinese finm2_8e741d9d:

    # mc "I appreciate it. This is more than I could have hoped for."
    mc "对此我深表感激，这远超我的期望。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3145
translate chinese finm2_6617e7e3:

    # cre "You’ve earned it, [mc]. Let’s end this together."
    cre "你值得拥有这一切，[mc]。让我们一起结束这一切吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3146
translate chinese finm2_3915895b:

    # "I can't fully put into words how wonderful it is to have someone from the old universe here to support me."
    "我此刻的兴奋之情难以用言语表达，旧宇宙的朋友在此刻能来支持我，实在令我振奋。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3152
translate chinese finm2_09307a41:

    # "With a variety of training and preparation under everyone’s belt, we reconvene at the war table just before the sun sets."
    "经过多方面的训练与准备，我们于日落前夕再度齐聚指挥桌前。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3155
translate chinese finm2_241d696f:

    # "It’s surface is cluttered with relics and potions as the plan is put into motion."
    "随着计划的逐步进行，桌面上堆满了圣物与药水。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3157
translate chinese finm2_c29ae883:

    # lil "Everyone. We’ve got one shot at this. Midnight’s waiting for the cover of darkness, and when night falls, she’ll be stronger than ever."
    lil "各位，我们的机会不多，只有一次。梦魇之月正在等待着夜幕的降临，而到那时，她的力量将会变得比以往更加强大。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3158
translate chinese finm2_cd689bf8:

    # lil "We’ve made the most of the time we had. I’ve seen what [mox] and the others are capable of. We’ve got power on our side now."
    lil "我们充分利用了现有的时间进行备战。我已经见识过[mox]以及各位的实力，可以说，我们掌握着更为强大的力量。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3161
translate chinese finm2_3db486ab:

    # mox "This time, it’s all or nothing. We can’t afford any more mistakes."
    mox "不成功，便成仁。我们再也经经受不起任何失败了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3164
translate chinese finm2_20f128e7:

    # rik "Let’s make sure she knows we’re not backing down."
    rik "是时候让她知道我们的决心有多坚定了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3172
translate chinese finm2_3839ad73:

    # hon "I’ll give everything I’ve got."
    hon "该使出真本事了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3173
translate chinese finm2_ecf10add:

    # rub "Sounds like you two can’t wait to get into trouble."
    rub "听起来你们两个已经迫不及待了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3174
translate chinese finm2_4edf603c:

    # cre "We’ve reinforced the perimeter of the city and fortified key positions with family and friends secure in the castle."
    cre "我们加固了城市外围的防线，并重点加强了关键要道的防御工事，并且疏散了各位的家人与朋友，他们在城堡里会很安全的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3182
translate chinese finm2_f6991cb4:

    # bla "The variants are ready, and they’ll follow your lead."
    bla "我的军团已准备就绪，它们将听从您的指挥。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3183
translate chinese finm2_4cdfff01:

    # pen "Everyone’s got their protective rings and pendants, right? But you can’t rely on these forever. They will wear off after a few hits."
    pen "大家都领到了有防护效果的项链了，对吧？有一点需要注意一下，它们提供的效果是有限的，经过几次攻击后就会祛魔。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3184
translate chinese finm2_16f8ae53:

    # but "Strength potions are ready! I might have gone a little overboard, though. Just don’t blame me if you feel like you can punch through walls after drinking one."
    but "我炼了很多力量药水给你们！不过药效可能有点过头了。如果喝完一瓶发现自己能一拳打穿墙壁，可别怪我啊。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3192
translate chinese finm2_11e89d80:

    # mor "Pass me one. I assume Midnight won’t simply let you charge up your blast, you’ll need someone to distract her again."
    mor "那药水递我一瓶。我猜梦魇之月是不会给我们攻击她的机会的，必须想办法吸引她的注意力才行。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3193
translate chinese finm2_04036105:

    # lil "We’ve all come a long way to get here. But this is it—the final push."
    lil "我们历经千辛万苦才有了如今的成果。此刻——将决定我们的胜负。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3194
translate chinese finm2_f8acb77a:

    # lil "Midnight is dangerous. She won’t go down easily, but we know how to stop her now. We hit hard, we hit together, and we finish this."
    lil "梦魇之月十分的危险。她是不会轻易屈服的，但我们已知晓制止她的方法。我们将齐心协力，重拳出击，是时候该终结这场混乱了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3195
translate chinese finm2_3a9eb813:

    # rik "Yeah! No holding back. This time, we end it."
    rik "没错！毫不留情。这次，我们彻底结束她和她带来的混乱！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3196
translate chinese finm2_b35e8946:

    # misc "Excuse me, madam [lil]! It’s the Queen, she’s –"
    misc "恕我打扰，[lil]女士！是女王陛下，她—"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3200
translate chinese finm2_4307a718:

    # aur "Now, now. I’m quite capable of informing them myself."
    aur "好啦，好啦。我完全有能力亲自告知她们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3201
translate chinese finm2_f9a5ded5:

    # "The group collectively exhales in relief at the sight of her standing, though it’s clear she’s still recovering. [aur]’s once stern demeanor softens as she surveys the group."
    "我们立即起立，迎接她的到来。看到她从昏迷中苏醒过来，大家都松了口气，不过她的神色还是有点差。[aur]环视着我们，那张原本严厉的面容也柔和了许多。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3204
translate chinese finm2_8bf7598a:

    # lil "Your Majesty… It’s good to see you up. But you should be resting."
    lil "陛下……您能起身真是太好了。但您应该多休息。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3205
translate chinese finm2_0fe9d8a7:

    # aur "Rest is a luxury I can no longer afford. Not when you’re all about to risk your lives to save my country..."
    aur "休息已是我无力承担的奢侈。尤其是当你们即将为拯救我的国家而赌上性命时……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3208
translate chinese finm2_13a2ec79:

    # bla "It’s great to see you back on your feet, Queenie! You gave us all a scare."
    bla "真高兴看到你重新站起来了，女王！你可把我们吓坏了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3210
translate chinese finm2_dee45783:

    # aur "I owe you all an apology."
    aur "我欠你们一个道歉。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3211
translate chinese finm2_83501053:

    # aur "My actions thus far—trying to imprison [mc], doubting your intentions… I see now how blind I was."
    aur "我至今所为——企图囚禁[mc]，质疑你的意图……直到此刻，我才惊觉自己是何等的盲目。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3213
translate chinese finm2_4bd4adeb:

    # aur "I allowed fear to cloud my judgment, and in doing so, I failed to trust the very people who were fighting to save us all."
    aur "恐惧蒙蔽了我的判断力，因此未能信任那些正为拯救我们而奋战的勇士们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3215
translate chinese finm2_881d8f48:

    # lil "You had your reasons. None of this has been easy for anyone."
    lil "您也有您的理由。这一切对谁都不容易。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3216
translate chinese finm2_867ee07d:

    # mc "We understand, [aur]. You were just trying to protect your people."
    mc "我们能理解您的焦虑，[aur]。您只是想保护你的子民。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3218
translate chinese finm2_5196b499:

    # aur "I hope you can find it in your hearts to forgive me."
    aur "我希望你们能心怀宽容，原谅我。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3223
translate chinese finm2_79e535cf:

    # mox "Hey, it’s water under the bridge. What matters is that you’re here now."
    mox "嘿~，那都是过去的事了。重要的是您在这里。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3224
translate chinese finm2_989d7c15:

    # aur "Thank you… all of you. Your forgiveness means more to me than I can express."
    aur "谢谢你们……谢谢大家。你们的宽恕对我而言，其意义远非言语所能表达。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3225
translate chinese finm2_5452d7d3:

    # aur "And now, I harbor no doubts—none at all. You have my complete trust, and my unwavering support."
    aur "此刻，我毫无疑虑——丝毫没有。我完全信任你，我将坚定不移的支持你。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3230
translate chinese finm2_2d2c43c8:

    # rub "That means a lot, Your Majesty. But are you sure you’re up for this? You still look like you need rest."
    rub "这对我意义重大，陛下。但您确定能胜任吗？您看起来仍需休养。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3231
translate chinese finm2_c02d6173:

    # aur "I am a Queen, and I will do what I must. But I know my limits. I can no longer fight in this condition. The battle ahead will rest on your shoulders."
    aur "我是女王，必当尽我所能。但我深知自身极限，在此境况下，我已无力再战。前方的战斗，将由你们扛起。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3232
translate chinese finm2_b9b79d98:

    # aur "But know this—I trust in you. Every single one of you. I trust that you will do what I could not."
    aur "而且——我信任你们。我相信在座的每一位都能完成我未能完成的事。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3233
translate chinese finm2_f5d42499:

    # aur "I want you to defeat my sister. Defeat Midnight once and for all."
    aur "我要你们击败我的妹妹。彻底击败梦魇之月。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3234
translate chinese finm2_8fc3613a:

    # mc "We won’t let you down, [aur]. Midnight will fall."
    mc "我们不会让你失望的，[aur]。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3235
translate chinese finm2_198cc632:

    # aur "I believe you. Now, go. Do what you must and know that I will be with you in spirit."
    aur "我相信你们。现在，去吧。去做你们必须做的事，我会在精神上与你们同在。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3238
translate chinese finm2_5193dd46:

    # "Then, finally, the sun set."
    "太阳落山了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3245
translate chinese finm2_3a59fb3f:

    # "The wall of darkness surrounding the city approaches as the sun dips below the horizon. An unnatural chill sweeps through the streets, accompanied by tendrils of darkness that ooze from the ravine."
    "太阳沉入了地平线，城市之外的黑暗之墙悄然逼近。一股反常的寒冷席卷街道，幽谷中渐渐渗出了黑暗的触须，如藤蔓般蔓延开来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3266
translate chinese finm2_6722072a:

    # "Nightmares can be seen in the distance, winding their way toward the heart of the city. The air grows heavy with distorted cries and sinister whispers."
    "远方的梦魇蜿蜒而至，直抵城市心脏。空气中充斥着扭曲的呐喊与阴森的低语，让气氛变得愈发沉闷压抑。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3271
translate chinese finm2_c59790e3:

    # "Everyone, guards and the [bla] variants rally at the fortified perimeter. We can only watch as they approach."
    "我们看着所有守卫和[bla]军团在加固的防线外集结。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3272
translate chinese finm2_6dcad935:

    # "The guttural growls of emerging nightmares. Twisted, monstrous forms with glowing violet eyes pour forth, their grotesque shapes shrouded in shadow..."
    "梦魇正在苏醒，它们的喉间发出阵阵嘶吼。扭曲的怪物形态涌现，紫光闪烁的双眼透出诡异光芒，畸形躯体被阴影笼罩……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3275
translate chinese finm2_57f7cddd:

    # lil "Hold the line! [cre] team, spread out and cover the flanks! Everyone else, stick to the plan and don’t let them overwhelm you!"
    lil "坚守阵地！[cre]军队，分散开来掩护侧翼！其余守卫按计划行动，别让它们压制住你们！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3282
translate chinese finm2_2f37f0f5:

    # misc "Yes, ma’am!"
    misc "遵命，女士！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3289
translate chinese finm2_0fc3af0f:

    # "[hon] cracks her knuckles, surveying the oncoming wave of nightmares."
    "[hon]咔嚓咔嚓地压着手指，审视着迎面而来的梦魇浪潮"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3290
translate chinese finm2_06fcd83e:

    # hon "Alright, [rik], let’s show these creeps why they don’t mess with our city!"
    hon "行吧，[rik]，咱们就让这群混蛋看看，什么叫不作死就不会死！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3291
translate chinese finm2_ba74e68a:

    # rik "You do the smashing; I’ll do the slashing."
    rik "你负责砸，我负责砍。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3295
translate chinese finm2_2331826b:

    # "[hon] barrels forward like a living battering ram, her immense strength smashing nightmares into wisps of shadow."
    "[hon]如活体攻城锤般猛然冲锋，她用她那磅礴的力量将梦魇击碎成缕缕阴影。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3304
translate chinese finm2_9271458a:

    # "Each swing of her fist sends shockwaves through the ground, scattering enemies like leaves in a storm."
    "她每挥一拳，地面便震出阵阵碎石，面前的梦魇如暴风扫落叶般溃散。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3312
translate chinese finm2_27bb67df:

    # "A nightmare leaps at her, but she grabs it mid-air and hurls it into another, the impact reducing both to smoky remnants."
    "一只梦魇向她扑来，她没有闪躲，在半空中将其抓住，猛地抛向另一只梦魇。两者相撞，化作了烟雾缭绕的残骸。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3313
translate chinese finm2_b4cab149:

    # hon "Who’s next? Come on, I’ve got plenty more where that came from!"
    hon "谁还想来？快点，我才刚热身呢！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3331
translate chinese finm2_e6833a11:

    # "[rik] dances through the air with acrobatic precision, her agility unmatched. She somersaults over a lunging nightmare, landing a rapid series of strikes that reduce it to vapor before flipping to dodge another attack."
    "[rik]在空中舞动，如钟表般敏捷。她飞到了一只梦魇的身后，连环出拳，梦魇惨叫一身，化作黑烟，她见状随即翻身闪避另一记攻击。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3332
translate chinese finm2_8f226801:

    # "Her movements are fluid, each step calculated for maximum efficiency."
    "她的动作行云流水，每一步都经过她精密的计算，以求最快的击敌效率。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3342
translate chinese finm2_7384226c:

    # rik "Gotta say, [hon], I don’t hate this whole ‘unstoppable duo’ thing we’ve got going on."
    rik "不得不说，[hon]，我们或许确实可以考虑一下这个“无所不能组合”。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3343
translate chinese finm2_1e307dc2:

    # hon "Told you we’d make a good team!"
    hon "我早就说过，咱俩会是绝配！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3350
translate chinese finm2_804b8c70:

    # "[rub] and [bla] were holding their ground a short distance away."
    "[rub]和[bla]在不远处坚守阵地。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3363
translate chinese finm2_8355ffd1:

    # "[rub]’s hands glow as she channels her new magical abilities, conjuring volleys of flame and ice that tear through the advancing nightmares."
    "[rub]的双手泛起光芒，她调动新获得的魔力，召唤出连绵不绝的火焰与冰刺，撕裂着眼前的梦魇。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3364
translate chinese finm2_d4655dc3:

    # "Her mastery over elemental magic is awe-inspiring, each spell devastating in its precision."
    "她对元素魔法的掌控程度高得令人叹为观止，每道咒语都精准得令人心惊。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3371
translate chinese finm2_270a139c:

    # rub "Keep them off me, [bla]! I need a second to charge this next spell."
    rub "别让它们靠近我，[bla]！我需要时间咏唱下一道法术。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3373
translate chinese finm2_23831b93:

    # bla "On it! Let’s see how they like this."
    bla "收到！让它们看看我这招如何。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3381
translate chinese finm2_ca88f7c9:

    # "Wielding her newly unlocked magic, she creates some smaller, but no less effective blasts of fire."
    "她咏唱着新学到的魔法，释放出若干体型较小却威力不减的火球。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3392
translate chinese finm2_23572535:

    # "These quick blasts cover [rub]’s openings, ensuring no nightmares get close as [rub] prepares a blast of energy that clears a line of foes."
    "这些炽热的火球遮住了[rub]的每一处破绽，确保梦魇无法靠近她，当[rub]蓄力释放火球时，整排的敌人都被一扫而空。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3399
translate chinese finm2_4088ac40:

    # bla "Ahaha, we did it! Oh my gosh! I could get used to this."
    bla "啊哈哈~，我们成功啦！天哪！我简直要习惯这种感觉了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3400
translate chinese finm2_3675302a:

    # rub "Hehe, and you were worried about keeping up? Dear, you’re a natural~"
    rub "芙芙~，还担心跟不上节奏呀？亲爱的，要我说，你天生就是这块料~"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3402
translate chinese finm2_ca52e18a:

    # bla "Oh, I’ll do more than just keep up! One more time!"
    bla "哦~，我还想再来一次！再来一次~！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3404
translate chinese finm2_90067737:

    # rub "You got it~!"
    rub "没问题~！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3408
translate chinese finm2_403c9001:

    # "In the distance, [lil], stands atop a ruined cart, surveying the advancing nightmares."
    "在远处，[lil]伫立于一辆残破的马车顶上，凝视着不断逼近的梦魇。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3410
translate chinese finm2_068c5622:

    # "Her eyes narrow as her horn glows with an intense, radiant energy."
    "她的双眸微眯，犄角绽放出耀眼的光芒。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3411
translate chinese finm2_c9f82d85:

    # lil "Clear the area! This one’s going to leave a mark!"
    lil "该清场了！你们将会为此付出代价！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3415
translate chinese finm2_a1b9899c:

    # "She unleashes a tide of pure magic. A massive, glowing crescent of energy sweeps through the oncoming nightmares, erasing dozens of them in a brilliant flash of light."
    "她释放出一股纯粹而强力的魔法洪流。一道巨大的、闪耀着光芒的魔法横扫而去，瞬间消灭了数十只梦魇。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3416
translate chinese finm2_f6b12b84:

    # "The remaining nightmares hesitate, as if sensing the sheer magnitude of her power."
    "残存的梦魇们犹豫着，仿佛察觉到了她力量的浩瀚无垠。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3422
translate chinese finm2_ba990ef1:

    # mox "Now that’s how you do it!"
    mox "这才对嘛！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3423
translate chinese finm2_18997fb1:

    # "I take a deep breath as I focus my new magic. My chest glows as I concentrate and form a ball of heat in my hand which coalesce into a fireball."
    "我深吸一口气，凝聚着新获得的魔法力量。当我全神贯注时，胸前泛起光芒，掌心凝聚出一团热能，最终凝结成炽烈的火球。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3434
translate chinese finm2_816be37b:

    # "Then, I hurl it into the densest cluster of nightmares, the impact creating an explosion of light and heat, clearing the area."
    "随后，我将它抛向梦魇最密集的区域里，撞击引发的光热爆炸瞬间清空了整片区域。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3435
translate chinese finm2_8fe51e5c:

    # mc "Heh… Me, doing magic… Who’d have thought?"
    mc "嘿……我，居然能用魔法了……谁能想到呢？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3439
translate chinese finm2_677652b2:

    # but "I’m so proud of you! Magic can be tiring though, be sure to drink up one of my magic potions for a booster!"
    but "我真为你感到高兴！不过施展魔法很耗体力，记得喝一瓶我的药水补充能量哦！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3442
translate chinese finm2_1cae499b:

    # "[but] hands me a blue vial and gives me one last wink before she steps forward and transforms."
    "[but]她递给我一只蓝色的小瓶，朝我眨了眨眼，随即向前一步，开始变身。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3443
translate chinese finm2_eb0402b1:

    # "Dark wings unfurl behind her, and her power surges to terrifying levels, the air around her crackling with dark energy."
    "她身后展开漆黑的羽翼，力量骤然飙升至骇人程度，周身空气噼啪作响，暗黑能量翻涌不息。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3444
translate chinese finm2_d6d30f5f:

    # but "Finally, some action. Let’s dance."
    but "终于到我了，来舞一曲吧~。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3447
translate chinese finm2_e0eecbbd:

    # "She takes to the skies, her claws glowing with a sinister red light as she dives into the enemy lines. Each swipe of her claws sends waves of darkness scattering, her attacks leaving a trail of destruction in her wake."
    "她飞身，翱翔于天际，利爪泛着诡异的红光，直扑敌阵。每一次挥爪都掀起黑红色的浪潮，攻击所过之处，尽是毁灭的痕迹。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3454
translate chinese finm2_035cfdbd:

    # "[mor] joins in, her green eyes piercing. The two form a devastating pair, cutting through the nightmares with ruthless precision."
    "[mor]也加入了战斗，她那双绿眸锐利如刀。二马组成了所向披靡的组合，以冷酷无情般的精准杀伤梦魇。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3455
translate chinese finm2_9ce5f9bc:

    # mor "Not bad, succubus! You might actually keep up with me."
    mor "不错啊，魅魔！你或许真能跟上我的节奏。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3457
translate chinese finm2_3f6fbbbf:

    # but "Keep up? Sweetie, I’m leading the charge!"
    but "跟上你的节奏？亲爱的，我才是那个冲在最前面的呢！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3461
translate chinese finm2_c3f11307:

    # "[mox] steps forward, gulping as she charges up some magic to cover their flank."
    "[mox]向前迈步，喉咙咕噜作响，低声咏唱着魔法，为侧翼提供掩护。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3462
translate chinese finm2_34aab6a7:

    # mox "Alright, [mox]… You can do this…"
    mox "别慌，[mox]...你能做到的..."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3471
translate chinese finm2_8c353975:

    # "A cluster of nightmares approaches fast."
    "一群梦魇正在飞速逼近。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3475
translate chinese finm2_0bebe08d:

    # mox "Oh look, some volunteers! How would you like to see my disappearing act!"
    mox "嚯哟，还有志愿者！想不想看我的消失魔术！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3478
translate chinese finm2_e47bbcc6:

    # "She raises her hands, summoning beams of silvery light that burn through the darkness, pushing it back more effectively than anyone else."
    "她举起双手，召唤出银白色的光束，释放出去，其杀伤力比其他马更加强大。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3479
translate chinese finm2_670625d6:

    # "Her magic doesn’t just seem to damage the nightmares, just the mere touch seems to vaporize them."
    "她的魔法似乎不仅能伤害梦魇，仅仅是触碰就能让它们蒸发殆尽。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3480
translate chinese finm2_a443ca86:

    # "Her silver light creates pockets of safety amidst the chaos."
    "她的银色光芒在混乱中创造出安全的庇护所。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3485
translate chinese finm2_53a04f47:

    # mc "Amazing [mox]!"
    mc "可以啊[mox]！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3486
translate chinese finm2_de718cbe:

    # mox "Ehehe, thank you, babe! I saw your fireball too! So hot~"
    mox "嘿嘿，谢谢夸奖，宝贝！我也看到你的火球啦！好帅哦~"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3489
translate chinese finm2_de526688:

    # lil "{i}Eh-hem{/i}! [mox]!"
    lil "{i}咳-咳{/i}！[mox]！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3491
translate chinese finm2_2ac6dc2e:

    # mox "Ah, s-sorry! I got distracted!"
    mox "啊，对-对不起！我走神了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3493
translate chinese finm2_c68f0fd6:

    # lil "Your magic—it really seems to counter the darkness. We need to test something."
    lil "你的魔法——它似乎真能有效对抗黑暗。我们需要测试些东西。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3496
translate chinese finm2_d5f76bed:

    # "[lil] leaps to [mox]’s side, her horn glowing with energy. She places her hand on [mox]’s shoulder, their powers intertwining as she channels her energy into [mox]’s lunar magic."
    "[lil]跃至[mox]身侧，她的犄角闪烁着能量的光芒。她抬手按在了[mox]的肩头，将魔法注入了[mox]的月之魔法之中。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3497
translate chinese finm2_20c8d8df:

    # lil "Let’s see what happens when we combine our powers!"
    lil "来看看当我们的魔法合二为一时，会发生什么！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3499
translate chinese finm2_6ed0b3df:

    # mox "You’re seriously trusting me with that kind of power?!"
    mox "你真的要把这种能力交给我吗？！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3500
translate chinese finm2_2fb63776:

    # lil "You’re one of us now. If I can’t trust you with my life, [mox], I’m not qualified to lead you."
    lil "你现在是我们中的一员。[mox]，如果连性命都不能托付于你，我就没资格领导你们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3502
translate chinese finm2_cbcfd6db:

    # mox "[lil]…"
    mox "[lil]..."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3503
translate chinese finm2_2808d99d:

    # lil "Now, get ready!"
    lil "预备！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3505
translate chinese finm2_c7100ef3:

    # mox "Yes! Together!"
    mox "好！我们一起！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3508
translate chinese finm2_2c25f3bd:

    # "The resulting surge of energy is breathtaking. A blinding lunar blast erupts from [mox]’s horn."
    "她们合力释放出的魔法之强大，令我惊叹不已。一道耀眼的月之光波自[mox]的犄角喷涌而出。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3509
translate chinese finm2_c7b9d8d7:

    # "The blast sweeps through the battlefield, clearing an entire city block and momentarily halting the advancing darkness. Everyone pauses, awe-struck by the sheer magnitude of the attack."
    "爆炸席卷战场，夷平了整整一个街区，瞬间停止了黑暗的蔓延。大家屏息凝神，被这毁灭性的攻击震撼得目瞪口呆。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3516
translate chinese finm2_16a6a5bd:

    # hon "Whoa! That’s one hell of a light show!"
    hon "哇！这灯光秀真是太震撼了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3517
translate chinese finm2_18c8814d:

    # rik "Yeah, [mox]! You kick ass!"
    rik "干得好，[mox]！你把打得落花流水！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3522
translate chinese finm2_c5885874:

    # mor "What the fu – Why is everyone so strong these days? What happened while I was in prison?!"
    mor "我嘞个——最近怎么是个马都这么强？我蹲大牢的时候外面都发生啥啦？！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3527
translate chinese finm2_43203143:

    # but "Old age catching up to you, Queenie?"
    but "是不是感觉到自己老了呢，女王？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3534
translate chinese finm2_fe012646:

    # mox "That… that actually worked."
    mox "那....那居然真的奏效了."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3535
translate chinese finm2_9cc55ea4:

    # lil "You’re more powerful than you realize, [mox]. I don’t fully understand it myself, but we'll need that power."
    lil "你比自己想象的更强大，[mox]。我虽未能完全理解其中奥秘，但我们需要这份力量。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3537
translate chinese finm2_0eacb3ce:

    # "The group regroups momentarily, rallying around the temporary reprieve created by the lunar blast."
    "我们的队伍趁着爆炸造成的短暂间隙，重新集结。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3538
translate chinese finm2_7bb2c169:

    # "But try as we might, each defeated foe is replaced by another."
    "但无论我们如何努力，每一只被击败的梦魇都会迅速的被另一只梦魇取代。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3544
translate chinese finm2_c4d24206:

    # cre "Hold the line! Don’t let them break through!"
    cre "坚守阵地！别让它们打进来！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3545
translate chinese finm2_46acc52c:

    # "Her variants dart through the chaos, trying to hold the perimeter. Her eyes scanning the horizon for any sign of respite."
    "她的变体们在混乱中穿梭，竭力守住外围防线。她的目光扫视地平线，寻找任何能争取时间的机会。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3546
translate chinese finm2_ec685744:

    # "Unfortunately, more come pouring through, clashing hard with [cre]’s army."
    "但事与愿违，更多的梦魇蜂拥而至，与[cre]军团激烈交战。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3548
translate chinese finm2_c5e512cc:

    # cre "Damn it… there’s no end to them."
    cre "该死……没完没了了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3550
translate chinese finm2_db6d0f10:

    # bla "Is this her plan? Tire us with an unending force so she can come in and finish us off?"
    bla "这是她的计划吗？用无穷无尽的力量消耗我们，好让她趁虚而入将我们彻底消灭？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3552
translate chinese finm2_a23cc5c5:

    # "Together, all the [cre]s push back against the waves of darkness."
    "所有的[cre]们齐心协力，共同抵御黑暗的侵袭。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3555
translate chinese finm2_7252a713:

    # "And a massive nightmare lunches towards [rik] and [hon]."
    "一只巨大的梦魇朝[rik]和[hon]扑来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3559
translate chinese finm2_e6514118:

    # rik "Woah! This isn’t a normal nightmare!"
    rik "我靠！这和其他的梦魇不一样啊！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3562
translate chinese finm2_c91066f5:

    # hon "T-That’s a darkness-infused manticore!"
    hon "那-那是只被黑暗侵蚀的蝎尾狮！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3567
translate chinese finm2_79117f68:

    # "Its claws swipe at [rik], who barely manages to somersault out of the way."
    "它抬起利爪向[rik]挥去，后者勉强翻滚躲开。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3573
translate chinese finm2_f02ef2cb:

    # rik "More dangerous versions? This changes things! We can’t keep dodging forever!"
    rik "比原来的蝎尾狮更危险？出大问题！我们不可能永远躲过它的攻击！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3588
translate chinese finm2_abfbc6f2:

    # "[hon] slams her shoulder into the nightmare, sending it crashing into a tree."
    "[hon]用肩膀猛撞梦魇，将其撞飞了出去，撞上了一棵树。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3589
translate chinese finm2_68ee5d8d:

    # hon "We don’t need to dodge if we take them out first!"
    hon "进攻就是最好的防御！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3598
translate chinese finm2_ba72f939:

    # "[hon] swings her first, each blow shattering shadows. But even her immense strength starts to falter as more creatures pile onto her position. A claw strikes her side, leaving a cut and causing her to stumble back."
    "[hon]率先发起进攻，每一击都击碎了面前的梦魇。但当更多梦魇涌向她所在的位置时，即便是她强大的力量也开始力不从心起来。利爪划过她的侧身，留下道伤口，令她踉跄着后退。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3601
translate chinese finm2_ba7da38c:

    # "I respond with a fireball, scattering the attackers as I dash in to assist her."
    "我以火球反击，击散她面前的袭击者，随后立马冲上前去。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3602
translate chinese finm2_7ab04807:

    # mc "[hon], are you okay?"
    mc "[hon]，你还好吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3604
translate chinese finm2_57dba882:

    # hon "Nghh… I’m not going down that easy. Let’s hit back harder."
    hon "还好…我才不会这么轻易的认输。来吧，我们全力打回去"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3608
translate chinese finm2_d3dd6115:

    # "[lil] watches the chaos unfold. Her horn glows faintly, but the light flickers as she struggles to summon a third powerful spell."
    "[lil]目睹着混乱的蔓延，开始咏唱起第三道强力魔法，但犄角上散发出的光却开始闪烁起来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3611
translate chinese finm2_a025e3d2:

    # "She pants while wiping a sweat from her brow."
    "她抬手擦去额头上的汗珠，呼吸变得越来越急促。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3612
translate chinese finm2_ef5a2141:

    # lil "Come on… just one more. They’re counting on you."
    lil "来吧……再来一次就好。大家都在指望着我呢。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3615
translate chinese finm2_a948883b:

    # "She unleashes another wave-clearing crescent of energy, but it’s noticeably weaker than before. The nightmares fill the space almost immediately, their numbers unrelenting."
    "她再度释放出一道半月形光波，但威力明显不如先前。梦魇们几乎瞬间就补上了阵线，数量之多令我们窒息。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3621
translate chinese finm2_5ba504b6:

    # "[lil] stumbles, falling to one knee for support. [pen] appears to her side, placing a relic around her neck that glows faintly."
    "[lil]踉跄着，单膝跪地以支撑身体。[pen]出现在她身侧，将一件微光闪烁的圣物挂在她颈间。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3622
translate chinese finm2_9469e8ae:

    # pen "You’ve done more than enough. Don’t push yourself too far."
    pen "你做得已经很棒了，别太勉强自己。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3623
translate chinese finm2_1857dbf2:

    # lil "We can’t stop now. If we don’t press forward, the city is lost."
    lil "现在还不是我们放松的时候。若不继续战斗，这座城市就完了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3625
translate chinese finm2_1eb0158b:

    # pen "You know better than anyone else that we need to conserve our energy to take out Midnight. By exhausting ourselves, we’re just playing into her hand."
    pen "你比任何马都清楚，我们必须保存体力才能击败梦魇之月。若现在耗尽自己的体力，只会正中她的下怀。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3627
translate chinese finm2_87ef4a88:

    # lil "You’re right…"
    lil "你说得对...."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3629
translate chinese finm2_bc47a721:

    # pen "I’m going to rush back to the castle to resupply, stay strong."
    pen "我得赶紧回城堡补给物资，坚持住。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3631
translate chinese finm2_43c6e61f:

    # lil "Thank you, [pen]. Virtues! Regroup!"
    lil "谢谢你，[pen]。谐律之元！重新集结！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3634
translate chinese finm2_30daf867:

    # "The group fights towards the edge of the ravine in the center of the city."
    "我们的队伍朝着城市中心的峡谷全速前进。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3635
translate chinese finm2_9b852403:

    # "The ravine itself churns with a sickly purple light."
    "峡谷中翻涌着病态的紫光。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3638
translate chinese finm2_58eb094c:

    # mox "*{i}Pant, pant{/i}* Is everyone okay? This is crazy..."
    mox "*{i}气喘吁吁{/i}* 大家都还好吗？这太疯狂了……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3639
translate chinese finm2_255ccf24:

    # mc "T-The ravine… Look inside…"
    mc "那—那条峡谷……快看里面……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3640
translate chinese finm2_74a98aa2:

    # "A dense darkness rises like a flood as hundreds of shadows climb up from all directions."
    "峡谷中浓厚的黑暗如洪水般涌起，数百道阴影从四面八方蔓延而上。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3642
translate chinese finm2_5b04c0c3:

    # rub "{i}*Gulp*{/i} We’re surrounded! They’re at the perimeter and rising from the center!"
    rub "{i}*咽口水{/i} 我们被包围了！它们已逼近外围防线，还从峡谷里蜂拥而上！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3645
translate chinese finm2_67ec560b:

    # rik "If we don’t do anything, they’ll overwhelm the city."
    rik "如果我们不采取行动，它们将会占领这座城市。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3647
translate chinese finm2_100dcfd2:

    # mox "Maybe I can charge up another blast, clear the entire ravine…"
    mox "或许我还能蓄力再轰一发，清除这条峡谷里的黑暗……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3651
translate chinese finm2_b4a5aca6:

    # lil "We need to save that energy… [mor], you have wings, can we leave this one to you?"
    lil "不行，我们需要你保存魔力……[mor]，你有翅膀，能把这个交给你处理吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3656
translate chinese finm2_1a4e3898:

    # mor "Hmph, you want me to fight an entire army on my own?"
    mor "嚯，你想让我独自对抗下面一大坨的黑暗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3658
translate chinese finm2_52b3d2ef:

    # lil "I-I know it’s unreasonable…"
    lil "我——我知道这很不合理……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3660
translate chinese finm2_eba22023:

    # mor "Hah, I tried to invade this city once, and here I am defending it."
    mor "哈，我曾试图攻占这座城市，如今却要拼死守卫它。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3662
translate chinese finm2_7955d1e8:

    # mor "Better rewrite your history books, [lil], because Queen [mor] is back, and nothing will ever be the same again~"
    mor "准备好重写你们的史书吧，[lil]，女王[mor]归来，改变了今夜的战局~"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3665
translate chinese finm2_c93c998b:

    # "[mor] allows herself to fall off the edge and she disappears into the darkness below."
    "[mor]任走到了悬崖边缘，转身后倒，任由自己坠落下去，最终消失在了下方无尽的黑暗中。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3670
translate chinese finm2_8a2bf80e:

    # "Just as everyone peers over to watch, lightning erupts in the darkness, like watching a thunderstorm."
    "正当大家探头观看时，黑暗中骤然闪现一道闪电，宛如目睹一场雷暴。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3671
translate chinese finm2_01050219:

    # "The oppressive darkness, which moments ago seemed insurmountable, slithers back toward the ravine, leaving an unsettling calm in its wake."
    "那令人窒息的黑暗，片刻前还显得无所不能，此刻却悄然蜷缩着退回深谷，身后只留下不安的寂静。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3674
translate chinese finm2_6c812141:

    # rik "I know she’s supposed to be evil and stuff, but that’s one badass bug."
    rik "我知道她应该是个邪恶的存在，但那只虫子的实力可真够狠的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3675
translate chinese finm2_245cd17e:

    # mc "Heh, she’s certainly surprised me. I – "
    mc "嘿，她可真是让我吃了一惊。我——"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3677
translate chinese finm2_122f4ff2:

    # lil "Wait… Something’s coming."
    lil "等一下....有什么东西正在靠近。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3685
translate chinese finm2_266b19b9:

    # "From the remaining shadows, Midnight emerges, her figure wreathed in an aura of malevolent energy."
    "梦魇之月从残存的黑暗阴影中现身，她的身影被一股邪恶的黑暗力量笼罩，散发着不详的光晕。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3686
translate chinese finm2_c4d7d871:

    # mid "Look at you. So determined, so... predictable. Did you really think it would be this easy?"
    mid "瞧瞧你。如此坚定，如此的……可预见。你真以为会这么容易？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3713
translate chinese finm2_7f182447:

    # "Her voice echoes unnaturally, distorting and overlapping itself. Illusions of Midnight shimmer into existence around her, making it impossible to pinpoint the real one."
    "她的声音不自然的回响着，扭曲着、重叠着自身。她释放出幻影围在了她的周围，若隐若现让我们无法辨别哪个才是真实的她。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3714
translate chinese finm2_7699dbab:

    # "The group tightens their formation, their eyes darting from one figure to the next."
    "队伍收紧队形，面面相觑。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3718
translate chinese finm2_27f10126:

    # mox "Typical! Group up on us the moment [mor] leaves."
    mox "真老套！[mor]一走，你就立刻现身对付我们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3721
translate chinese finm2_a251c5ee:

    # but "That just leaves more for us~"
    but "幻影分身？唯一的用处就是给我们热身罢了~"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3724
translate chinese finm2_21431215:

    # rub "Something’s not right. She’s toying with us."
    rub "情况不对劲。她有可能想耍什么花招。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3731
translate chinese finm2_2864dd96:

    # "As if on cue, new figures step from the shadows — nightmares disguised as allies."
    "话音刚落，梦魇之月幻影分身们便各自幻化成了我们的样子。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3738
translate chinese finm2_2a9120d9:

    # "A mockery of [hon] leaps toward her."
    "一只[hon]的幻影朝[hon]扑了过去。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3740
translate chinese finm2_fff31a4f:

    # misc "Do you really think your sister is safe right now?"
    misc "你真的觉得你妹妹现在很安全？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3742
translate chinese finm2_8c4082a8:

    # hon "My sister… she’s… {i}*Sigh*{/i} She’s all grown up now. She’s a strong woman, and she doesn’t need me there to coddle her!"
    hon "我妹妹……她……{i}*叹气*{/i} 她现在都长大了。她是个坚强的女孩了，根本不需要我在那儿娇惯她！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3748
translate chinese finm2_339aea28:

    # "[hon] rushes forward and punches through her illusion."
    "[hon] 猛冲上前，一拳击穿了她的幻影。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3755
translate chinese finm2_11321479:

    # "Another illusion, shaped like [lil], steps into view as she whispers taunts designed to break her resolve."
    "另一道幻影，形似[lil]，悄然现身，低语着，意图瓦解她的决心。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3757
translate chinese finm2_9567c8bb:

    # misc "Should have stayed in your room. You’re all going to fail—just like you always do."
    misc "你就该宅在自己房间里。这注定会失败——就像往常一样。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3759
translate chinese finm2_bb1686e1:

    # lil "Hmph, is that really supposed to get under my skin? I thought an illusion based on me would understand – we both know that I’m going to rule this kingdom one day!"
    lil "哼，这真能影响到我的决心吗？我以为我的幻象会和我对齐颗粒度呢——终有一日我会继承这个王国的统治权！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3772
translate chinese finm2_bf237d94:

    # misc "You’re a monster too. Do you really think your allies will accept you after all is said and done~?"
    misc "你也是怪物。你真以为一切结束后，你的朋友们会接受你吗~？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3774
translate chinese finm2_65e6a20d:

    # but "Do these allies look unaccepting to you? The world isn’t scared of me anymore, and I shouldn’t be either."
    but "我的朋友在你眼中像根刺吗？世界不再畏惧我，我也该如此。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3782
translate chinese finm2_6c369aa5:

    # misc "We’ll take everything from you. It’ll all be for nothing, as it always has been."
    misc "我们将夺走你的一切。一切都将化为乌有，正如往常一样。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3783
translate chinese finm2_aa8eeb79:

    # rub "Perhaps you’re right. In the grand scheme of the world, this is but a footnote. However, you’re got one thing wrong. You will never be able to take away the symphony of experiences that have enriched my life."
    rub "你说得或许是对的。在世界的宏大图景中，这不过是微不足道的注脚。然而你有一点想错了——你永远无法夺走那些丰富了我生命的经历。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3790
translate chinese finm2_11544910:

    # "Then a nightmare morphs into [bla]."
    "然后是[bla]。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3792
translate chinese finm2_2f27a0e7:

    # misc "Wait… What the hell are yo–"
    misc "等一下....你他妈到底是什么东——"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3795
translate chinese finm2_0378b449:

    # "The [bla] nightmare inexplicably bursts into nothing."
    "[bla]的幻象莫名其妙地消失了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3797
translate chinese finm2_265bc6ca:

    # bla "Hah, mine couldn’t handle a little bit of divine knowledge! [mc], lend me some magic!"
    bla "哈，就知道这冒牌货承受不了神圣知识的洗礼！[mc]，我们合力击败剩下的那只幻影吧！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3798
translate chinese finm2_1be205bc:

    # mc "You got it!"
    mc "没问题！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3799
translate chinese finm2_2d0c199f:

    # "As she and I prepare to throw a combined fireball at the nearest nightmare, but it dodges with uncanny precision, morphing into [rik]’s shape."
    "当她与我准备向最后幻影合力投掷火球时，它却以诡异的速度精准闪避了过去，化作了[rik]的形态。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3807
translate chinese finm2_8e7c1a4a:

    # misc "Huh, this one doesn’t even have any insecurities! But she’s a right freak in bed!"
    misc "呵，你倒是没啥自卑的地方，但出于敬业，我还是得让你难堪，你在做爱的时候和疯子没啥区别！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3809
translate chinese finm2_8a8ef05f:

    # rik "H-Hey! S-Shut up!"
    rik "嘿！闭-闭嘴啦"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3815
translate chinese finm2_2bc56584:

    # "The fog grows denser and starts reflecting images around, mirroring faces at all angles."
    "但黑雾并未消散，反而变得愈加浓重，从中滋生出大量的幻影，幻化成了我们的形态，围在了我们周围。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3816
translate chinese finm2_00eec5f6:

    # mc "Damn it, I can’t tell which ones are real!"
    mc "该死，我根本分不清哪些是真的！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3817
translate chinese finm2_b69e21cb:

    # bla "They’re everywhere. How do we know who to trust?"
    bla "它们无处不在。我们该如何分辨谁值得信任？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3818
translate chinese finm2_0f87a70d:

    # "The confusion builds, and the illusions begin whispering to each member of the group, sowing doubt and fear. Midnight’s laughter echoes again, filling the air with mockery."
    "混乱不断加剧，幻象开始向每个成员低语，播撒着怀疑与恐惧。梦魇之月的笑声再度回荡，空气中充斥着嘲弄。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3821
translate chinese finm2_a1469b3d:

    # mid "You’ve come so far, only to crumble at the finish line. Isn’t it delightful? All that effort... for nothing."
    mid "倒在了黎明前的黑暗。听着多么美妙啊！不是吗？所有努力……都白费了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3826
translate chinese finm2_4b06a26e:

    # lil "Don’t listen to her! We’ve faced so much so far, and we’ve come out stronger every time."
    lil "别听她的！我们确实走了很长一段路，而每一道坎都让我们变得更加强大。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3833
translate chinese finm2_fbc56606:

    # "[mox] comes face to face with her own twisted reflection."
    "[mox]与自己扭曲的幻影面对面。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3835
translate chinese finm2_62a86dd7:

    # misc "Why didn’t you save her? Why did you run away?"
    misc "你为什么不救她？你为什么逃走了？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3837
translate chinese finm2_fe1b0ce1:

    # mox "I…"
    mox "我....."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3838
translate chinese finm2_af9dc8d6:

    # misc "You could have saved your mother, if you weren’t so fucking weak and useless~"
    misc "你本能救下你的母亲的，但可惜啊，你太他妈弱了~"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3845
translate chinese finm2_f7271a53:

    # "[mox] raises her hand, lunar magic flaring and burning away all the illusions."
    "[mox]举起手，月之魔法骤然迸发，焚尽了所有幻象。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3846
translate chinese finm2_4c7250f8:

    # mox "Hmph… Is this the best you have, Midnight? This is a display of desperation. Weakness."
    mox "哼……就这啊，小月月？这不过是你临死前的挣扎罢了。无聊。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3847
translate chinese finm2_02545a5f:

    # mox "A mere trick. It’s proof that Midnight can’t take us all at once."
    mox "班门弄斧罢了。这也证明你其实根本无法同时对付我们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3853
translate chinese finm2_ea2d6c55:

    # lil "[mox]’s right! She’s trying to split us up!"
    lil "[mox]说得对！她想拆散我们！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3854
translate chinese finm2_5d7de314:

    # rub "Backs together, ladies and gent. Keep in formation and get ready."
    rub "女士们先生们，快列队集结。保持队形，准备应对接下来的战斗。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3856
translate chinese finm2_edc1c625:

    # "But even as the illusions falter under [mox]’s light, Midnight herself remains elusive, her mocking smile never wavering."
    "虽然幻象在[mox]的魔法下逐渐减弱，但梦魇之月的真实意图依然令我们难以捉摸，即便在这种情况下，她那嘲弄的笑容始终未曾动摇。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3860
translate chinese finm2_d1468ab2:

    # "[rik] suddenly freezes mid-attack, her sharp eyes narrowing as realization dawns on her."
    "[rik]在攻击的途中突然僵住，锐利的双眸骤然眯起，恍然大悟的神色浮现。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3861
translate chinese finm2_9536b93e:

    # rik "Wait a second. She’s not attacking us..."
    rik "等等。她没有攻击我们……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3864
translate chinese finm2_b43232e2:

    # but "Come to think of it, she isn't doing anything!"
    but "仔细一想，她根本什么都没做！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3865
translate chinese finm2_32afd78a:

    # mc "She’s... stalling?"
    mc "她在.....拖延时间？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3867
translate chinese finm2_33452875:

    # rik "Exactly. She’s distracting us! What is she planning?"
    rik "没错。她在分散我们的注意力！她到底在打什么主意？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3874
translate chinese finm2_0a755259:

    # "Somehow, nightmares approach from the north, these ones still had bodies like the illusions. They looked like guards, citizens… But how?"
    "不知为何，梦魇突然从北方袭来，它们暗黑色的外表下仍带着如幻象般的躯体。它们形似守卫，形似市民……到底发生了什么？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3879
translate chinese finm2_6cd3c4b6:

    # rik "A-Are those real?"
    rik "那——那是真的吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3882
translate chinese finm2_7f1f54a0:

    # mox "Wait… How are the nightmares this deep into the city already?"
    mox "等等……梦魇怎么已经深入到城市里来了？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3884
translate chinese finm2_4d559762:

    # lil "N-No… That can be…"
    lil "那-那不会是.....这不可能..."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3889
translate chinese finm2_a42a04a7:

    # "[pen] stumbles closer, an aura of twisted shadows corrupting her. it’s really her!"
    "[pen]蹒跚着进入到了我们的视野里，扭曲的暗影正侵蚀着她。真的是她！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3896
translate chinese finm2_48842ac8:

    # lil "They’re… {i}new{/i} nightmares…"
    lil "它们是……{i}新转化{/i}的梦魇……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3897
translate chinese finm2_67ffbbfc:

    # mox "[pen]! I… I…"
    mox "[pen]！我...我....."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3899
translate chinese finm2_efc00cc7:

    # mox "[lil] lend me your energy!"
    mox "[lil] 快把你的魔法借给我！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3901
translate chinese finm2_e632364c:

    # lil "A-Are you sure? Will we have enough for Midnight?"
    lil "你-你确定吗？那接下来该怎么打梦魇之月？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3902
translate chinese finm2_4f5ae35c:

    # mox "I don’t care about that right now. Just do it!"
    mox "我不想管。快点！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3904
translate chinese finm2_f77abc49:

    # lil "Alright! Take as much as you need!"
    lil "好吧！你想用多少就用多少吧！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3907
translate chinese finm2_03c54645:

    # "Closing her eyes and gritting her teeth, [mox] creates a column of lunar light which soars forth and eradicates every trace of darkness."
    "她紧闭双眼，咬紧牙关，[mox]召唤出一道月之光柱，直冲云霄，驱散了所有黑暗。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3908
translate chinese finm2_cab59d3b:

    # "The hosts of the nightmares, guards and [pen] alike, fall down exhausted."
    "梦魇的宿主、守卫与[pen]，疲惫地倒下。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3911
translate chinese finm2_ffee6ff0:

    # pen "{i}*Pant, pant*{/i} W-What just… I… I’m alive?"
    pen "{i}*气喘吁吁*{/i} 什——什么……我……我还活着？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3914
translate chinese finm2_bacfc7e9:

    # mox "Thank goodness, you’re okay!"
    mox "谢天谢地，你还活着！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3917
translate chinese finm2_dc1f8243:

    # hon "Well I’ll be! [mox]’s magic isn’t just pure force, it purifies!"
    hon "天哪！[mox]的魔法不仅是纯粹的力量，它还能净化黑暗！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3919
translate chinese finm2_8b93ea11:

    # mox "Yeah… I just had a hunch."
    mox "嗯……这只是我的某种预感罢了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3924
translate chinese finm2_3b7e7856:

    # lil "Still… that was quite a risk you took…"
    lil "不过……你冒的风险可真不小……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3926
translate chinese finm2_5639e114:

    # mox "[pen] what happened? How were you turned this far north? [mor] and the [cre] army should be-"
    mox "[pen]发生了什么？你怎么会被带到这么北的地方？[cre]和[cre]军团——"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3928
translate chinese finm2_0d758772:

    # pen "Oh my god… the castle! Midnight is in the castle! Forget about us, you have to stop her as fast as you can!"
    pen "天哪……是城堡！梦魇之月在城堡里！别管我们了，你们必须尽快阻止她！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3929
translate chinese finm2_e1a8443f:

    # mc "Shit! Was she really just trying to buy time?!"
    mc "我去！她刚才真的是在拖延时间？！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3931
translate chinese finm2_161e30d5:

    # lil "{i}*Gasp*{/i} The Queen! Everyone, to the castle! Now!"
    lil "{i}*惊呼*{/i} 不好，女王陛下！各位，快去城堡！快啊！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3935
translate chinese finm2_039cdbd7:

    # "Midnight’s laughter crescendos as her illusions disappears into the shadows, her voice fading but still taunting."
    "梦魇之月的笑声越来越强，接着幻影消逝于黑暗之中，她的声音也随之减弱却，但仍带着嘲弄之味。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3936
translate chinese finm2_7012ee82:

    # mid "How cute. Let’s see if you can stop what’s already begun."
    mid "真可爱。让我瞧瞧你们能不能阻止我吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3939
translate chinese finm2_60638665:

    # "The group charges toward the castle."
    "我们朝着城堡冲去。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3942
translate chinese finm2_50f0886d:

    # "As we neared the gates, the castle loomed above us, its towers silhouetted by the moon itself."
    "当我们接近城门时，城堡在我们上方巍然耸立，月光勾勒出塔楼的剪影。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3943
translate chinese finm2_9d1d49dc:

    # "Inside, the faint sound of talking echoed from within the castle walls as we climbed up through the main chamber. The true scale of Midnight’s plan becoming horrifyingly clear."
    "当我们沿着主厅向上前进时，城堡墙壁内传来隐约的谈话声。梦魇之月的真正计划正以骇人的方式逐渐清晰。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3954
translate chinese finm2_10cd9116:

    # mid "Come, sister. You were never meant to be a beacon of light. You were born to rule."
    mid "来吧，姐姐。你就不适合成为一座灯塔，和我一起统治世界吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3955
translate chinese finm2_7277b3a1:

    # mid "Join me, and we’ll bring the world to its knees."
    mid "加入我，我们姐妹合心，必将让世界屈服于我们的脚下。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3956
translate chinese finm2_c8dccb53:

    # mid "You will be Sundowner, the true force of the sun."
    mid "你将成为破灭之阳——太阳的化身。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3958
translate chinese finm2_1c9bb824:

    # aur "I… I can’t…"
    aur "我...我不可以...."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3960
translate chinese finm2_9701198e:

    # mid "You can. You only need to take that final step."
    mid "哦~你可以的。你只需要迈出最后一步就行。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3961
translate chinese finm2_874557f1:

    # mid "The power of the sun will be yours, and with it, you will bring about a new era. A new order."
    mid "太阳的力量将属于你，凭此之力，你将开启崭新的纪元，建立新的秩序。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3962
translate chinese finm2_c2bb829e:

    # "Light spilled from the throne room as we charged in. [aur]’s mane flickered in intensity."
    "我们刚冲到王座厅的门前，一道剧烈的光芒突然从里面倾斜而出。向里看去，[aur]的鬃毛在强光中闪烁不定。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3966
translate chinese finm2_8c705421:

    # lil "Stop right there! Virtues, charge me!"
    lil "停！大家，快将你们的能量传到我的身上！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3967
translate chinese finm2_d6d3c126:

    # "Midnight’s head snapped toward them, a twisted grin spreading across her face."
    "梦魇之月猛地回头望向我们，脸上浮现出一抹扭曲的笑容。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3977
translate chinese finm2_53214794:

    # mid "Ah, the heroes. How quaint. You think you can stop me? You think you can save her? It’s already too late~"
    mid "啊，是你们啊，真是可笑，你们以为还有机会能阻止我？以为能救她？太晚了~"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3982
translate chinese finm2_e389504d:

    # "She raised her hand, sending a wave of dark energy surging toward us. The force of the attack sent a shockwave through the room, but the group stood their ground, drawing on the new power that still flowed through them."
    "她举起手，朝我们释放出一道暗黑魔法。魔法造成的冲击波在房间里荡漾开来，但我们不为所动，抵住了这股力量，继续运作着我们体内流淌着的能量。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3983
translate chinese finm2_663645b2:

    # lil "Tch… Hurry!"
    lil "嘶....快呀！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3987
translate chinese finm2_369b63cb:

    # bla "I’m going as fast as we can!"
    bla "我吃奶的力都用出来啦！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:3991
translate chinese finm2_0a1e9593:

    # rub "Ngghh, we don’t have enough time!"
    rub "额啊啊，我们时间不够了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4001
translate chinese finm2_04ca6202:

    # mid "Ahahaha! You're simply adorable."
    mid "啊哈哈，你们无用的努力真是可爱啊。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4002
translate chinese finm2_566e6220:

    # mid "I can’t believe I wasted my time coveting that meagre power for myself, when the real reward was in front of me all along."
    mid "我简直不敢相信，自己竟浪费了这么多时间去贪图那点微不足道的力量，而真正的力量其实一直就在我的眼前。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4003
translate chinese finm2_e8123b39:

    # mid "My sister…"
    mid "我的姐姐..."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4006
translate chinese finm2_add89bda:

    # "Midnight placed her hand on [aur]’s head, darkness transferring through her hand. Then, a blast of light surged outward, cutting through the air with a deafening roar."
    "梦魇之月将手按在[aur]的头顶，黑暗通过她的手传递过去。接着，一道光芒猛然迸发，随之而来的轰鸣震耳欲聋，仿佛撕裂了空气。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4008
translate chinese finm2_01f5f60e:

    # "It collided with everyone, creating an wave of heat. The throne room shook under the force."
    "它与我们相碰，掀起一股热浪。王座厅在冲击力下剧烈震颤。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4012
translate chinese finm2_c6a3aaa3:

    # "As the dust settled, we stood in stunned silence, our hearts sinking as our vision cleared."
    "尘埃落定之际，我们呆立原地，陷入了震惊的沉默。当视野逐渐清晰，我们的心也随之停止。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4013
translate chinese finm2_ba085ea5:

    # "Before us, standing tall and regal, were Midnight and…"
    "在我们面前，伫立着的是梦魇之月和……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4016
translate chinese finm2_2818d662:

    # "Sundowner."
    "破灭之阳。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4017
translate chinese finm2_71651e30:

    # "The heat of her presence was immediate. The pressure of her power overwhelming."
    "她的身体散发着热浪，力量的压迫感令人窒息。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4018
translate chinese finm2_c83d3e5b:

    # "Midnight's laugh echoed through the chamber, triumphant and cruel. She spread her arms wide as though to embrace her victory."
    "梦魇之月的笑声在厅堂里回荡，宣示着她残酷的胜利。她张开双臂，仿佛拥在拥抱着她的胜利。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4025
translate chinese finm2_85fdd820:

    # mid "You see?! This is what true power looks like! I corrupted your precious Queen!"
    mid "你看到了吗？！这才是真正的力量！我腐化了你们尊敬的女王！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4026
translate chinese finm2_830b6b2c:

    # mid "All those dark thoughts~ She was so easy to break."
    mid "一些阴暗的念头~就能轻松的击破她的防线。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4033
translate chinese finm2_d0f0cfed:

    # lil "N-No… Your Majesty…"
    lil "不……陛下……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4034
translate chinese finm2_d0735d9c:

    # mox "Holy… shit…"
    mox "我的....天啊..."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4035
translate chinese finm2_5d9c8085:

    # mc "[aur], [sel]! If you’re still in there, if you can hear us… Please!"
    mc "[aur]，[sel]！如果你们能听到我的声音的话……求求你们！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4042
translate chinese finm2_690adad5:

    # mid "Ahahaha! Together, we will bring the world to its knees!"
    mid "啊哈哈哈！我们将携手让世界臣服于我们！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4045
translate chinese finm2_4ec12c5f:

    # "Sundowner's expression cracked. There was something cold in her gaze as she glanced at Midnight."
    "破灭之阳沉下了脸。她瞥向梦魇之月，目光里透着一丝寒意。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4046
translate chinese finm2_6f3697a2:

    # "Her voice, when it came, was sharp and laced with ice."
    "她的声音响起，尖锐而无情。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4048
translate chinese finm2_372b9444:

    # db "Oh, how cute. You actually thought I’d share my power with you?"
    db "哦，真是天真。你居然以为我会把我的力量分享给你？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4050
translate chinese finm2_784b3e39:

    # "Midnight's expression faltered, the smug grin slipping slightly from her face as Sundowner's words hit her."
    "梦魇之月一愣，那副得意的笑容从她脸上微微滑落，破灭之阳的话语直击她的心坎。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4051
translate chinese finm2_ddb7d444:

    # mid "{i}*Stammering*{/i} Wh-what do you mean? {i}We{/i} have all this power—together—we can—"
    mid "{i}*结巴*{/i} 你——你什么意思？{i}我们{/i}拥有如此强大的力量——团结起来——我们能够—"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4053
translate chinese finm2_140d12bf:

    # db "You really think I would share power with you? You’ve always been the little sister, Midnight."
    db "你真以为我会与你合作？你永远只是我的小妹妹罢了，梦魇之月。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4054
translate chinese finm2_d07c1c8b:

    # db "Even now, you think I’m just another pawn to you? You’ve played your hand, but I’m done with being your second fiddle."
    db "即便此刻，你仍以为我是你手中的棋子？你已出尽底牌，而我也不愿做你的配角。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4056
translate chinese finm2_a207e8fa:

    # "Midnight stood frozen for a long moment, her eyes widening as realization dawned on her. The world around her seemed to stop, the silence suffocating."
    "梦魇之月僵立良久，当真相浮现时，她的双眼骤然睁大。周遭的世界仿佛凝固，气氛令人窒息。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4057
translate chinese finm2_839edfc9:

    # "This wasn’t part of the plan. She had thought she was the one pulling the strings, but now… it seemed the strings had snapped, and she was left dangling."
    "很明显，这不在她的计划之内。她原以为自己掌控着一切，但现在嘛....不出意外的话，肯定是出意外了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4061
translate chinese finm2_de457fbd:

    # "Meanwhile, [mor] dropped in from a nearby window."
    "与此同时，[mor]从附近的一扇窗户钻了进来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4063
translate chinese finm2_2dcc62d9:

    # mor "Hey guys, how’s – oh, for the love of—FUCK this! {i}*She throws her hands up in frustration*{/i}"
    mor "嘿，伙计们，你们好吗——我真的******************，开什么国际玩笑！{i}*她沮丧地摊开双手*{/i}"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4070
translate chinese finm2_bfa2b023:

    # "Sundowner took a step forward, her gaze unwavering as she turned fully toward Midnight."
    "破灭之阳向前迈了一步，死死地盯住了梦魇之月。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4071
translate chinese finm2_8293d69c:

    # db "You thought you could use me. But you’ve never had any idea what true power felt like, did you? You were always chasing after the shadows while I was the one meant to shine."
    db "你以为能利用我。但你从未见识过真正的力量，对吧？你永远在追逐我的虚影，而我才是注定要闪耀的存在。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4073
translate chinese finm2_0129f490:

    # "Midnight’s eyes widened in horror as she realized just how badly she had miscalculated. She invested a lot of power into corrupting Sundowner, and now…"
    "梦魇之月惊恐地瞪大了双眼，意识到自己竟如此严重地误判了形势。她耗费了大量力量来将姐姐腐化成破灭之阳，而现在……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4074
translate chinese finm2_3775f416:

    # "Sundowner, fully transformed, was a force unlike any they had ever encountered—a goddess of the sun, corrupted, and radiating raw power."
    "破灭之阳，腐化后的日之女神，是我们前所未见的强大存在——她浑身散发着纯粹而又邪恶的力量。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4075
translate chinese finm2_1ec58416:

    # "She had become a threat far greater than Midnight could have ever hoped to control."
    "她已然成为一个巨大的威胁，就连梦魇之月也无法掌控她。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4076
translate chinese finm2_c985686a:

    # mid "No… no, this isn’t how it’s supposed to be! You can’t turn on me! We were supposed to rule together!"
    mid "不……不，事情不该这样！你不能背叛我！我们本该共同统治这个世界！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4078
translate chinese finm2_1c092258:

    # db "I will never share power with you..."
    db "想得挺美，我绝不会与你分享那本该属于我的权力……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4079
translate chinese finm2_6c9037dc:

    # db "Not now, not ever."
    db "现在不会，以后更不会。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4080
translate chinese finm2_db997dcf:

    # mid "I..."
    mid "我...."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4082
translate chinese finm2_37880e59:

    # "Midnight's guard was completely down... Sundowner took advantage, raising her hand, and..."
    "梦魇之月的防备在她的震惊中彻底松懈了……破灭之阳趁次机会，抬起手来，然后……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4084
translate chinese finm2_e196e976:

    # db "Now… [lil]! Fire!"
    db "现在.....[lil]！就是现在！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4092
translate chinese finm2_5da82302:

    # lil "You got it, Your Majesty!"
    lil "是，陛下！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4095
translate chinese finm2_3992d552:

    # "Without hesitation, [lil]’s horn glowed more fiercely than ever, filled with our accumulated energy condensed into one final, powerful blast."
    "[lil]毫不迟疑，犄角骤然释放出前所未有的炽烈光芒，凝聚着我们的全部能量，化作最后一次震撼天地的轰鸣。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4098
translate chinese finm2_32b0040a:

    # "The blast shot forward like a beam of pure light, faster than anyone could react. It collided with Midnight {i}and{/i} Sundowner."
    "一道圣洁的光束向前迸射，快如闪电。它稳稳地击中了梦魇之月{i}和{/i}破灭之阳。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4099
translate chinese finm2_6c4a03a6:

    # "The room was bathed in a brilliant flash of light, blinding and all-encompassing. Midnight screamed, her voice twisting in fury as the power overwhelmed her, filling the air with a blinding explosion of light."
    "房间被一道耀眼的白光所笼罩。梦魇之月尖叫着，她的声音在愤怒中扭曲，当光束将她淹没时，空气中爆发出令人目眩的光芒。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4103
translate chinese finm2_0d109597:

    # "As the energy cleared, we saw the darkness fades, the malevolent shadows dissipating like smoke."
    "当光束消散时，我们看见黑暗逐渐消散，那些邪恶的暗影也随之如烟雾般消散。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4104
translate chinese finm2_95392966:

    # "Midnight’s form flickered, her aura of darkness burned away, leaving behind a faint, pale figure."
    "梦魇之月的身形忽隐忽现，她身上的黑暗气息消散殆尽，只留下一个虚弱而朦胧的身影。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4105
translate chinese finm2_831a6b1a:

    # "She looked up, her expression softened, and I saw a glint of pride behind her exhaustion."
    "她抬起头，神情柔和下来，我看见她疲惫的眼神里闪过一丝骄傲。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4109
translate chinese finm2_9cc5c166:

    # sel "You’ve proven yourselves worthy… after all."
    sel "我就知道我可以信任你们...."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4112
translate chinese finm2_27fd4b30:

    # "And then, with a final shimmer, she closed her eyes and slumped to the ground."
    "接着，她眼中闪过一丝微光，闭上双眼，瘫倒在地。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4113
translate chinese finm2_be0cc31e:

    # mc "[sel]!"
    mc "[sel]！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4116
translate chinese finm2_7d50f895:

    # "I rushed over to catch her, a light surrounded her and continued to expand outward, washing over the castle and beyond, purging every trace of darkness from the surrounding lands."
    "我飞奔过去抱住她，一道光芒将她笼罩，并持续向外扩散，越过城堡，越过高山，越过平原，将所有的黑暗都驱散殆尽。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4119
translate chinese finm2_9e2f6773:

    # aur "Nngghh, my head is throbbing…"
    aur "嗷……我头疼得要命……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4122
translate chinese finm2_95d05224:

    # lil "You... you resisted it, [aur]. The darkness that Midnight tried to bury you with, you did it!"
    lil "你……你做到了，[aur]。梦魇之月试图用黑暗将你腐化，而你成功抵住了她的腐化。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4124
translate chinese finm2_d65c66e3:

    # aur "That power was pulling me, and I thought I had lost myself. But... but I didn’t. I couldn’t let it control me."
    aur "那股邪恶力量在诱惑我，我以为自己要完了。但……但我不能，我不能让它控制我。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4126
translate chinese finm2_597925b7:

    # lil "I knew you’d pull through, [aur]. Despite everything that’s happened, I trusted that you had a good heart, that your intentions were always pure."
    lil "我知道你不会被轻易腐化的，[aur]。尽管经历了种种，但我始终相信你心地善良，你的初衷从未改变。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4128
translate chinese finm2_461d4201:

    # aur "But how did you… How did we survive? You only purged away the evil within us."
    aur "但你是怎么……我和妹妹是怎么活下来的？你在没有杀死我俩的情况下成功驱散了我们体内的黑暗。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4130
translate chinese finm2_a77ce139:

    # lil "The truth is, I held back and instead relied on [mox]’s power in the hopes you’d separate."
    lil "事实上，我刻意克制了自己力量，转而依赖[mox]的力量，希望以此能将你们净化。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4133
translate chinese finm2_d1d98b6c:

    # mox "Ehehe, thank you for trusting me, [lil]."
    mox "嘿嘿~，谢谢你信任我，[lil]。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4135
translate chinese finm2_1d8300b8:

    # lil "If I didn’t see that glimpse of good in both of you, I wouldn’t have given Midnight the chance."
    lil "若非在你们身上都瞥见了一丝微微的善意，我绝不会冒这个险。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4139
translate chinese finm2_45daf714:

    # but "We… we actually did it!"
    but "我们……我们真的做到了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4142
translate chinese finm2_e8cd1855:

    # hon "What a relief… We gave the darkness a real pounding. Who’d have thought we’d be the ones to do that?"
    hon "太解气了……我们真的击败了黑暗。谁能想到我们居然真的成功了？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4145
translate chinese finm2_2788583d:

    # rub "But... who exactly was that woman we just saved? She's almost identical to..."
    rub "但是……我们刚刚救下的那位究竟是谁？她和……简直一模一样……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4146
translate chinese finm2_f4097128:

    # "[rub] looked over to [sel], her strength slowly returning."
    "[rub]转头看向[sel]，她的力量正慢慢恢复。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4150
translate chinese finm2_2465184b:

    # lil "That must be… [aur]’s real sister… [sel]."
    lil "她肯定是....[aur]真正的妹妹....[sel]。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4153
translate chinese finm2_3ecb009a:

    # bla "Aahhh! It feels so good to finally put a face to this mystery."
    bla "啊！终于能搞清楚真相了，感觉真好！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4156
translate chinese finm2_82e3446d:

    # rik "Wait, hold on — so… this [sel]… is… was Midnight? I don’t understand."
    rik "等等，等等——所以……这个[sel]……是……是梦魇之月？我不明白。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4160
translate chinese finm2_2836fe1b:

    # "[sel] laughed, gentle and calm as she tried to stand. I supported her with my own weight."
    "[sel]轻声笑了起来，笑声温柔而平静。她试着站起来，我用自己的身体支撑着她。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4161
translate chinese finm2_1494a78a:

    # sel "No need to worry, dear. Midnight has been purged. The darkness that consumed me has vanquished."
    sel "孩子，不必担忧。梦魇之月已被驱散，控制我的黑暗已然消亡。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4163
translate chinese finm2_bda899b0:

    # sel "Midnight was born from a nightmarish force that twisted my jealousy and bitterness into something… monstrous. In a moment of weakness, I allowed it in. It seized that opening and took control, feeding off my insecurities."
    sel "梦魇之月诞生于一场噩梦般的力量，它将我的嫉妒与怨恨扭曲成某种……怪物般的存在。在意志薄弱的瞬间，我被她乘虚而入。它抓住这个破口掌控全局，以我的不安为食。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4165
translate chinese finm2_752bad6b:

    # sel "As an alicorn, I held great power, and under Midnight’s influence, I became a grave danger to this world. My sister, [aur], used much of her strength to seal me away in the moon, hoping it would contain the nightmare within me."
    sel "身为天角兽，我拥有强大力量，在梦魇之月的操控下，我成了这个世界的重大威胁。我的姐姐[aur]耗费了巨大的魔力将我封印在月亮里，期盼能禁锢住我体内潜藏的噩梦。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4171
translate chinese finm2_691b1db7:

    # hon "But while you were up there, that corruption just kept leaking out?"
    hon "但即便你被放逐到了月球上，你体内的黑暗力量却依然影响着大地？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4178
translate chinese finm2_0e3edd36:

    # aur "Unfortunately, yes. My power waned over the years, and darkness seeped into the world, finding others who were vulnerable to despair or rage, and twisting them into nightmares, just as it did to her."
    aur "不幸的是，确实是样的。这些年来我的力量日渐衰弱，渐渐的压制不住黑暗的渗透，这才使它侵蚀了这个世界。它寻找着那些易受绝望或愤怒侵蚀的灵魂，将他们扭曲成噩梦——正如当年对我妹妹所做的那样。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4179
translate chinese finm2_2bd3592b:

    # mc "So, by stopping Midnight, we didn’t just free you. We freed everyone who’s been possessed recently."
    mc "因此，我们阻止梦魇之月的行动，不仅拯救了你，更救了所有被黑暗附身的马。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4181
translate chinese finm2_db3f9642:

    # sel "Precisely. Those recently possessed should be returning to their former selves now. But…"
    sel "确实如此。那些最近被附身的马此刻应该正在恢复原状。但是……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4182
translate chinese finm2_1d5c43ba:

    # sel "Those who were corrupted long ago… their bodies will not have survived the strain. I must spend the rest of my life making amends, for those I will never be able to help."
    sel "而那些被黑暗寄生太久的……他们的躯体终究承受不住这般折磨。我余生都将用来赎罪，为那些我永远无法拯救的灵魂。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4184
translate chinese finm2_696649b2:

    # sel "[aur], dear sister… After everything, you still managed to resist the corruption. You truly remained pure to the very end."
    sel "[aur]，亲爱的姐姐……从始至终，你都抵御住了腐化，你确实纯洁至终。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4185
translate chinese finm2_b082cd05:

    # sel "I… don’t deserve to be here right now. How was I brought back?"
    sel "我……现在根本不配待在这里。我究竟是怎么被带回来的？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4187
translate chinese finm2_a3e05e26:

    # aur "I know why, [sel], because even when you were consumed by the darkness, you couldn't bring yourself to finish me off. Even as Midnight, there was still something good in you."
    aur "我知道为什么，[sel]，因为即便你成为了梦魇之月，也始终不忍心彻底杀死我，你的体内仍存着名为善的火种。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4189
translate chinese finm2_3812cd88:

    # sel "How could I ever? Even in my darkest moments, I could never hurt you like that."
    sel "我怎么可能会呢？即使在最黑暗的时刻，我也绝不会那样对你。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4191
translate chinese finm2_f88f0eea:

    # aur "That’s why you were brought back, because you still had that last piece of light left inside of you."
    aur "这就是你回来的原因，你的体内还残留着最后一丝圣洁的光芒。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4193
translate chinese finm2_07efc844:

    # aur "But I fear that it’s too late for me. With the things I’ve done… I don’t deserve to rule Arcadia anymore."
    aur "而.....以我所作所为……我恐已不配再统治Arcadia。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4195
translate chinese finm2_817178fe:

    # sel "You speak such nonsense! You’d push that responsibility onto me as if I don’t have my own sins to bear?"
    sel "你说的简直是胡话！竟想把女王之位让到我身上，仿佛我没有自己的罪孽要承担似的？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4196
translate chinese finm2_fb157840:

    # "[sel] shook her head, brushing a hand gently across [aur]’s forehead."
    "[sel]摇了摇头，轻轻抚过[aur]的脸庞。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4198
translate chinese finm2_08cb5fd8:

    # sel "Dear sister. This world needs your light, your kindness. I owe everything to you. You never gave up on me, even when you should have."
    sel "亲爱的姐姐。这个世界需要你的领导与仁慈。我的一切都归功于你。在你最该放弃的时候也没有放弃我。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4199
translate chinese finm2_fe82c581:

    # sel "We’ll restore this land together… as it was meant to be."
    sel "我们将携手恢复这片大地……让她回归她本该有的样子。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4201
translate chinese finm2_ef22b354:

    # aur "Could I really be forgiven? Even after how I treated everyone?"
    aur "我做了这么多邪恶的事后，真的还能被原谅吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4209
translate chinese finm2_dea8f2c6:

    # hon "This is what we fought for, right? A second chance for everyone."
    hon "这就是我们奋斗的目标，对吧？给每匹马第二次机会。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4210
translate chinese finm2_258b8238:

    # rik "Yeah, even though you were a bit of a dick, I kinda get it now!"
    rik "是啊，虽然你之前有点混蛋，但我现在倒是能理解了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4211
translate chinese finm2_a721e8ee:

    # lil "Your Majesty, the kingdom needs you more than ever during this time of renewal."
    lil "陛下，在这个复兴之际，王国比以往任何时候都更需要您。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4218
translate chinese finm2_b717a230:

    # sel "That’s right! You’re not going to get out of this so easily~"
    sel "没错！你可没那么容易脱身呢~"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4219
translate chinese finm2_97751da5:

    # aur "Aaahhhh… I could use a long rest too. Maybe banish me to the sun for a thousand years."
    aur "啊啊啊~……我也需要休息。或许我可以试试把我放逐到太阳待个一千年啥的~。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4221
translate chinese finm2_691afb1c:

    # sel "If you do that, who’s going to update me on modern history and politics? I don’t even know what species [mc] is supposed to be!"
    sel "如果你这么做，谁来给我更新现代历史和政治知识呀？我连[mc]到底是什么物种都不知道！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4222
translate chinese finm2_f56946a6:

    # mc "Me?! But you’re the one that summoned me here!"
    mc "我？！可我是你召唤来的啊！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4224
translate chinese finm2_7afe20ba:

    # sel "Heheh, that I did! I suppose I should acknowledge it now. In my desperation to stop Midnight, I fought against her from the inside."
    sel "嘿嘿，确实是我做的！现在该好好给你们解释一番了。为了阻止梦魇之月，我在体内和她进行绝望的对抗。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4226
translate chinese finm2_07292a5f:

    # sel "Failing to find a solution in this universe, I peered into others to discover you. A missing link with the capability to unite this universe together and save it."
    sel "在这个宇宙中未能找到解方，我便窥探其他宇宙来寻觅。而我发现，你正是那缺失的环节，唯有你，才能将我们团结起来，拯救这个宇宙。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4229
translate chinese finm2_86774d7b:

    # "Both the Queen and Princess bow."
    "女王和公主向我们鞠了一躬。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4231
translate chinese finm2_b01f0b2b:

    # lil "Y-Your Majesty!"
    lil "陛-陛下！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4238
translate chinese finm2_2df85cbf:

    # sel "You all—"
    sel "谢谢你们——"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4239
translate chinese finm2_9b594774:

    # aur "You saved our kingdom."
    aur "你们拯救了这个国家。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4240
translate chinese finm2_8d483250:

    # aur "It would honor me if you’d join me on this journey to restore Arcadia to its former glory."
    aur "若你们能与我同行，共同踏上这段重振Arcadia昔日荣光的征程，我将深感荣幸。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4241
translate chinese finm2_f7cfdde9:

    # aur "Each of you represents something that the world desperately needs. Concord, harmony... you’re all living embodiments of this and more."
    aur "你们每一位都代表着这个世界迫切需要的东西。和谐、融洽……你们都是这些品质的的体现。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4258
translate chinese finm2_f283fd5f:

    # rub "There’s no question, we’ve already decided."
    rub "没问题，我们已经决定了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4259
translate chinese finm2_8bfda0ff:

    # lil "Absolutely, Your Majesty. It would be an honor."
    lil "当然，陛下。这是我的荣幸。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4260
translate chinese finm2_2b26d5bf:

    # but "That’s right. We’ll do our best!"
    but "没错。我们会全力以赴！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4261
translate chinese finm2_510f39c4:

    # rik "Yep! As long as you don’t mind giving us a little bit of power to bring things like… sports… back? Ehehe."
    rik "没错！只要你不介意把一点点权力交给我们，用来让那些……比如体育赛事之类的东西……重新回归？嘿嘿。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4268
translate chinese finm2_c4c1a9f0:

    # aur "This is only the beginning. Rebuilding, healing… these will take time. But with people like you, I have no doubt that we’ll succeed."
    aur "这仅仅是个开始。重建、医疗……这些都需要时间。但有像你们这样的马，我坚信我们终将成功。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4269
translate chinese finm2_a87a24eb:

    # "[aur] stood with a newfound strength, her light shining brighter now that [sel] was by her side. For a world that was once shrouded in darkness, the future could not be brighter than this very moment."
    "[[aur]以焕然一新的力量重新屹立，[sel]则伴其身侧，她们的光芒愈发璀璨。对于这个曾被黑暗笼罩的世界而言，此刻的未来已然照耀得无比绚烂。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4272
translate chinese finm2_d434bb76:

    # "We stepped out of the castle and into the courtyard."
    "我们走出城堡，踏入庭院。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4274
translate chinese finm2_b1e7b63a:

    # "The true moon finally broke through, casting a serene moonlight over the city."
    "真正的月亮终于破云而出，将代表宁静的月光洒满整座城市。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4275
translate chinese finm2_eef57491:

    # "In that light, the shadows and nightmares vanished, peace and clarity settling in their place."
    "皎白的月光代表着阴影与噩梦的消散，取而代之的则是宁静与清明。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4276
translate chinese finm2_7925412d:

    # "Watching over this vista, the realization of our success finally sunk in — not only had we freed the city, but we’d cleansed the entire world of Midnight’s corruption."
    "眺望着这美丽的景象，我们终于意识到了我们的胜利——我们不仅解放了这座城市，更将梦魇之月的腐化彻底地从整个世界中清除了出去。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4277
translate chinese finm2_e991bb47:

    # "We had triumphed, and harmony was restored."
    "我们取得了胜利，恢复了以往和谐。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4278
translate chinese finm2_85d86de5:

    # "A brief silence hung in the air before we were interrupted by a sharp, familiar voice."
    "空气中弥漫着短暂的寂静，随后一道尖锐而熟悉的声音打破了它。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4287
translate chinese finm2_2b96c6ca:

    # mor "Touching, truly. But as much as I love a happy ending, I think I’ll stick to my own path."
    mor "真感动呐~。虽然吧，我很喜欢圆满的结局，但我还是该走了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4289
translate chinese finm2_35c313de:

    # mc "You’re leaving already? Thought you’d at least want to celebrate with us."
    mc "这就要走啦？我还以为你至少会和我们一起庆祝呢。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4291
translate chinese finm2_9e20588a:

    # mor "Not exactly my style. Besides, I’ve got my own people to look after, I’ll celebrate with them."
    mor "庆祝这种事不太合我的风格。再说，我还有自己的子民要照顾，我会和他们一起庆祝。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4292
translate chinese finm2_9d613922:

    # mc "Well, if you ever need us… you know where to find us."
    mc "懂你意思，如果你需要我们的话……你知道该去哪儿找我们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4293
translate chinese finm2_96a9c33e:

    # aur "Thank you, [mor]. You may consider yourself pardoned."
    aur "谢谢你，[mor]。你可以认为自己被赦免了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4294
translate chinese finm2_c6d6b586:

    # mor "Hmph…"
    mor "哼....."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4295
translate chinese finm2_bdf91f85:

    # "For a moment, [mor]’s gaze softened, her eyes flicking over each of us."
    "片刻间，[mor]的眼神柔和下来，目光扫过了我们。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4299
translate chinese finm2_c90e09f4:

    # mor "Y-Yeah, well… {i}*Sniff*{/i} Keep the Virtues close. Who knows, maybe I’ll check in one day. Just don’t get too comfortable."
    mor "嗯…{i}*抽鼻子*{/i} 别得意，说不定哪天我就回来找你们了，别太安逸。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4303
translate chinese finm2_7389ffd5:

    # mor "Or maybe, if you’re lucky, I will finally sign that peace treaty you were so insistent on, [aur]."
    mor "也有可能，如果你够幸运的话，我或许会同意签署你那份和平条约，[aur]。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4308
translate chinese finm2_cc36f74f:

    # "With [mor] departure, we walked back with a skip in our step, a great relief that eased every tension and bruise we’d accumulated for this moment."
    "[mor]转身离去了。我们蹦蹦跳跳地走回来，一种巨大的解脱感消除了我们为这一刻积攒的所有紧张与伤痕。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4315
translate chinese finm2_0f792d58:

    # but "I suppose we’re officially the Virtues of Concord."
    but "我想我们正式成为“谐律之元”了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4316
translate chinese finm2_68c3e16b:

    # bla "Does this mean we’re famous now?"
    bla "这意味着我们现在要出名了？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4317
translate chinese finm2_cd65d158:

    # hon "I could get used to that! What’s next for us?"
    hon "我不讨厌这样！接下来我们该做什么？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4321
translate chinese finm2_e7246fd1:

    # rub "We celebrate — right?"
    rub "我们该庆祝了——对吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4322
translate chinese finm2_198b5d03:

    # mc "Exactly! We’ll make sure the city’s safe, but after that? We’re going all out."
    mc "没错！我们会确保城市安全，但之后呢？我们需要再接再厉。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4324
translate chinese finm2_6c577610:

    # "We returned to the city. It felt like a different world from the shadowy one we’d left behind."
    "我们回到了城市。这里与我们身后那个阴暗的世界截然不同。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4326
translate chinese finm2_0e423bd5:

    # "People were emerging from their barricaded homes, blinking in the light and exchanging bewildered glances."
    "群众从各自封满障碍物的家中走出，在日出的光线中眨着眼睛，彼此交换着茫然的眼神。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4328
translate chinese finm2_36b2bfb6:

    # "As we moved down the main thoroughfare, word spread quickly: the heroes had returned, and the nightmare had ended."
    "我们沿着主干道前行时，胜利的消息迅速传开：英雄们回来了，袭扰多年的黑暗终于结束了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4329
translate chinese finm2_5971ba4c:

    # "Laughter and cheers rang out as folks greeted us; eyes wide with excitement."
    "欢声笑语此起彼伏，大家热情地向我们打招呼，眼中闪烁着兴奋的光芒。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4332
translate chinese finm2_dd9faa97:

    # mox "This feels like a dream. To see everyone so… happy, like the darkness was never even here."
    mox "看到大家如此的……快乐，仿佛黑暗从未存在过。这感觉就像一场梦。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4333
translate chinese finm2_48c0cb89:

    # mc "It’s more than a dream. We made it real."
    mc "这已不再是一个梦想。我们让它成为了现实。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4336
translate chinese finm2_fb607265:

    # lil "And now, we can finally start thinking about what the Virtues of Concord will really mean now that we’ve proven ourselves. Peace… that’s something we can uphold together."
    lil "如今，我们终于可以开始思考，当我们证明了自己的价值之后，谐律之元究竟意味着什么。和平……这是我们能够共同捍卫的事物。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4338
translate chinese finm2_a7418c7d:

    # mox "Whatever the future holds, we’ll face it together."
    mox "无论未来会怎样，我们都将共同面对它。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4339
translate chinese finm2_ea48235e:

    # "The rest of us nodded in agreement. The bond between us was unbreakable now."
    "我们纷纷点头，以表赞同。此刻，我们之间的羁绊已牢不可破。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4340
translate chinese finm2_7aa9f64e:

    # "The virtues were no longer just lost relics of an old world — we were alive, carried in each of us as we took our places among the people we’d sworn to protect."
    "谐律精华不再是旧世界的失落圣物——我们获得了它的力量，当我们站在誓言守护的群众之中时，谐律精华便在我们的心中生生不息"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4347
translate chinese finm2_149544a7:

    # "Along with an absolute ton of [cre] variants. They’re still here!"
    "还有海量的[cre]变体。它们还在！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4348
translate chinese finm2_4f23d1c7:

    # "They gathered into a circle, some brushing themselves off, others whispering to each other in low voices as if processing the chaos they’d just survived."
    "她们聚成一圈，有的在拍打着身上的尘土，有的在低声交谈，仿佛在消化刚刚经历的混乱。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4349
translate chinese finm2_35b36c13:

    # "[cre] bounced forward and gave me a biiiig hug!"
    "[cre] 蹦蹦跳跳地冲过来，给了我一个超——大的拥抱！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4351
translate chinese finm2_ce8b7da0:

    # cre "You did it again, [mc]! I’m so proud of you!"
    cre "你又做到了，[mc]！你太强了，我为你感到骄傲！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4352
translate chinese finm2_9245382d:

    # mc "Be proud of yourselves! You and everyone else from the nexus. You didn’t just protect this city, but you protected every version of this city!"
    mc "为自己感到骄傲吧！你和你的变体们不仅守护了这座城市，更守护了这座城市的每个版本！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4353
translate chinese finm2_4196ca35:

    # "There are some cheers from the [cre] crowd!"
    "[cre]群中传来阵阵欢呼！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4355
translate chinese finm2_184e3eb6:

    # cre "Alright, ladies, time to say our goodbyes! Back into the bakery we go!"
    cre "好了，女士们，该说再见了！我们回烘焙坊去吧！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4358
translate chinese finm2_fd279a46:

    # but "So, um… are we just supposed to… forget that there were, like, fifty of you running around?"
    but "所以，呃……我们难道就该……假装忘记你们五十匹马在四处乱窜的事实吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4360
translate chinese finm2_83e3c45e:

    # bla "We could use our powers to wipe out the whole memory of today, if you’d like. One clean slate for everyone."
    bla "若你同意的话，我们可以动用力量抹去今日所有记忆。让在场的每一匹马忘掉我们的存在。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4362
translate chinese finm2_4c39e096:

    # cre "Oh, come on, nobody really wants to remember what happened today anyway — except maybe the good parts. Besides, out of context multiverse knowledge isn’t hurting anyone!"
    cre "哎呀，反正没哪个马真想记住今天发生的事——除了那些美好的片段。再说，超现实的多元宇宙知识又不会伤害任何马嘛！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4370
translate chinese finm2_d44668b3:

    # misc "You know, she’s got a point. I'll see you in Monster Girl 1,000!"
    misc "说得也是。咱们《Monster Girl 1,000》里见！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4371
translate chinese finm2_9ab7117c:

    # "The other [cre]s chuckled, giving each other nods and pats on the back as they lined up, ready to slip back into the bakery."
    "其余的[cre]们咯咯笑着，互相点头示意，拍着对方的后背排成一列，准备走回烘焙坊。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4376
translate chinese finm2_ba2c3a4a:

    # "One by one, they disappeared, offering winks, waves, and cheeky comments as they disappeared from sight."
    "她们一个接一个地消失，在消失在视线之外时，还抛来飞吻、挥手致意和玩笑话。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4378
translate chinese finm2_699afc2c:

    # cre "Thanks for another adventure, [mc]. If you ever need multiversal backup again, just holler!"
    cre "谢谢你又给我带来了一场伟大的冒险，[mc]。如果需要来自其他宇宙的支援话，叫我一声就行！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4379
translate chinese finm2_ca6789fa:

    # mc "Thanks [cre]. Couldn’t have done this without you."
    mc "我也谢谢你，[cre]。没有你，我也不可能成功的。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4380
translate chinese finm2_0b88d720:

    # "She rushed in for another tight hug before bouncing back and waving goodbye."
    "她又冲过来给了你一个紧紧的拥抱，随即蹦回原地，挥手告别。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4383
translate chinese finm2_d9c00bf8:

    # "With that, leaving just one lone [bla] left."
    "至此，只剩下一个孤零零的[bla]了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4386
translate chinese finm2_5b7667d4:

    # "[bla] gave a slightly bewildered wave."
    "[bla]略带困惑地挥了挥手。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4393
translate chinese finm2_cf591ab2:

    # bla "I, uh… I’m not taking questions at this time."
    bla "我，呃……现在不接受任何形式的提问。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4397
translate chinese finm2_f9ead591:

    # "[rik] burst into laughter."
    "[rik]突然大笑起来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4398
translate chinese finm2_8c9a9fd4:

    # rik "Looks like you’re back to being our one-and-only, [bla]. That’s good enough, right?"
    rik "看来你又成了我们唯一的[bla]。这挺好的，对吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4400
translate chinese finm2_18e350a2:

    # bla "More than enough!"
    bla "当然！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4403
translate chinese finm2_8ae73ac7:

    # "In the following days, the city buzzed with rebuilding and restoration."
    "在随后的日子里，这座城市因重建与修复工作而变得热闹非凡。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4407
translate chinese finm2_464437dd:

    # "Myself and the other virtues led the charge, the people of Arcadia came together to sweep away the remnants of the battle and begin the slow process of healing."
    "我和姑娘领头行动，Arcadia的民众们也齐心协力，扫除了战后的废墟，开始了漫长的修复过程。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4409
translate chinese finm2_a8e11fc4:

    # "The celebration was held in the grand hall of the castle, restored to its former glory with sweeping banners of both sun {i}and{/i} moon."
    "胜利庆典在城堡的大堂内举行，厅内悬挂着{i}太阳与月亮{/i}的巨幅旗帜，再一次重现了昔日的辉煌。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4411
translate chinese finm2_1ee1d6d3:

    # "Tables were laden with food, and every corner filled with the lively hum of celebrating citizens."
    "餐桌上摆满了食物，每个角落都回荡着庆祝的欢声笑语。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4413
translate chinese finm2_a4f1ac49:

    # "The Virtues, [sel], and [aur] were at the heart of it all, mingling with the townsfolk, laughing, and sharing stories of the recent battle."
    "谐律之元们、[sel]与[aur]是这一切的核心，她们与居民们欢聚一堂，谈笑风生，分享着各自在战斗中的故事。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4415
translate chinese finm2_4f48acf1:

    # "The Queen raised her glass, her voice carrying over the crowd as she called for everyone’s attention."
    "女王举起酒杯，她的声音穿透人群，呼唤着大家的注意。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4416
translate chinese finm2_c031912f:

    # aur "Tonight, we celebrate not only the victory over darkness but the courage and unity of Arcadia. Each and every one of you showed bravery beyond measure. And to the Virtues, who restored hope when all seemed lost—this kingdom will always be grateful."
    aur "今夜，我们不仅庆祝战胜黑暗，更颂扬Arcadia的勇气与团结。在场的每一位都展现了无与伦比的英勇。而那些在绝望之际重燃希望的谐律之元们——这片王国将永远铭记你们的功绩。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4417
translate chinese finm2_a186f19e:

    # "Everyone raised their glasses, voices ringing out in a cheer for us. It was a sight to behold."
    "众人举杯齐声欢呼，声势浩大。这般景象令人叹为观止。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4419
translate chinese finm2_534602e3:

    # "After the toast, the crowd dispersed to enjoy the festivities. I took a moment to breathe it all in, glancing around the room. Now was the perfect time to catch up with everyone after everything we’d been through."
    "祝酒结束后，宾客们四散去享受宴会。我驻足片刻，环顾四周，将这一切尽收眼底。历经风风雨雨，此刻正是叙旧的绝佳时机。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4421
translate chinese finm2_c83ad972:

    # "Although [mox] spotted me first with a glass of wine in hand."
    "[mox]最先注意到我，手里还端着一杯葡萄酒。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4422
translate chinese finm2_aa5b88c0:

    # mox "Mind if I join you?"
    mox "介意我加入你吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4423
translate chinese finm2_9448ad37:

    # mc "Get that butt over here~"
    mc "那就坐过来吧~"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4425
translate chinese finm2_ac580c2f:

    # mox "Hehe, I’d sit on your lap if we weren’t in public!"
    mox "嘻嘻，要不是在公共场合，我早就坐在你腿上了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4426
translate chinese finm2_46a55eeb:

    # "She chuckled, plopping down beside me, her shoulder pressed against mine."
    "她咯咯地笑了起来，扑通一声坐在我身边，紧紧贴着我的肩膀。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4428
translate chinese finm2_f23416ba:

    # mox "How are you doing? It must feel like a lifetime since you had a night off."
    mox "你最近怎么样？感觉你有好长一段时间没睡个饱觉了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4429
translate chinese finm2_1c317682:

    # mc "No kidding. But having you by my side makes it all worth it."
    mc "有你在身边，多苦多累都是值得的，不开玩笑。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4430
translate chinese finm2_8d8bf9cc:

    # mc "Although, it’s not like you to be sipping wine on your lonesome. Something on your mind?"
    mc "话说回来，你平时可不会自己一个喝闷酒，有心事？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4432
translate chinese finm2_d28e70be:

    # mox "I was just thinking about how much power I was able to wield. After everything that happened… I never expected to become a virtue too."
    mox "其实......我没想过我也会成为一名谐律之元，我正想着自己能掌控多少力量。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4433
translate chinese finm2_0bc025a7:

    # mc "The power is incredible, isn’t it? Never in my dreams did I ever think I’d be able to harness magic like you or [lil]. You’ll have to teach me!"
    mc "这力量真是不可思议，对吧？我做梦也没想到自己竟能像你或[lil]那样使用魔法。魔法这事你一定要教教我！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4435
translate chinese finm2_bec3848f:

    # mox "Actually, [sel] offered me lessons to control my own powers. Like I could refuse that! She also mentioned wanting to talk to you before the evening is over."
    mox "其实吧，[sel]主动来问过我，想教我如何掌控自己的力量，这我怎么可能拒绝！哦对了。她还说，想在今晚结束前找你谈谈。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4436
translate chinese finm2_dd1cad97:

