# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4596
translate chinese finaleparty_422bf142:

    # sky "Ahaha, come on, [mc] has probably had this conversation with everyone in the room!"
    sky "哈哈~得了吧，[mc]这家伙八成跟屋里每匹马都聊过这个话题了！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4597
translate chinese finaleparty_3a527be0:

    # mc "Well, everyone except… {i}you{/i}, actually. I’ve never met you before, [sky]."
    mc "嗯，其实…我并没有见过{i}你{/i}，[sky]。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4599
translate chinese finaleparty_dadf1f32:

    # sky "And we were such fast friends! I guess your experience from the other universe wasn’t necessary, you just naturally have that charm that brings people together."
    sky "那我们的感情也这么好啊！看来你在另一个宇宙的经历也不是必须性的嘛，你天生就带着那种特质。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4600
translate chinese finaleparty_ebd280ff:

    # mc "I never would have imagined it growing up, but at this point it’s gotta be true."
    mc "小时候我怎么想也想不到我有这种特质，但都到了这个地步，肯定是有的啦~。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4602
translate chinese finaleparty_f75e9fb7:

    # rik "At this point, you don’t even have to try. I think everyone here is willing to fight for your attention."
    rik "都这个时候了，就别谦虚了。我想在座的各位都愿意为你争取得到属于你的那份关注。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4604
translate chinese finaleparty_94510f80:

    # sky "Haha, this man deserves a break! Let everyone else put the effort in for a while!"
    sky "哈哈，你该休息一下了！让其他马也努力一阵子吧！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4607
translate chinese finaleparty_f369c480:

    # "After chatting around, I spot [sel] in a nearby hallway. Just the gal I was looking for."
    "和大伙闲聊片刻后，我瞥见我一直在找的姑娘[sel]正在走廊里。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4609
translate chinese finaleparty_1e707999:

    # mc "Enjoying the evening, [sel]?"
    mc "享受这个夜晚吗，[sel]？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4611
translate chinese finaleparty_72af11d7:

    # sel "Ah, [mc]! My apologies for being late to the festivities. I’m still struggling to adapt to, well… everything."
    sel "啊，[mc]！抱歉我迟到了。我还在努力适应……额...这一切。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4613
translate chinese finaleparty_34b2e1ed:

    # sel "My sister and I wear strong faces for now, but behind the scenes we’re both receiving a lot of medical attention."
    sel "我和姐姐此刻都在强装镇定，私下里我们都在接受大量的医疗护理。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4614
translate chinese finaleparty_4d66a962:

    # mc "Is the recovery going smoothly?"
    mc "康复顺利吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4616
translate chinese finaleparty_a45551be:

    # sel "I don’t think either of us will ever feel 100%% again, but we’ll bounce back from this, I can promise you that."
    sel "我认为我们俩都再也无法恢复以前的状态了，但我们肯定会重新振作起来，我向你保证。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4617
translate chinese finaleparty_6be8e532:

    # mc "You mentioned you wanted to speak to me, which is great because I think we both have a lot to talk about."
    mc "我听其他姑娘说你说想和我谈谈，这太好了，因为我总觉得我们有很多话要说。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4619
translate chinese finaleparty_743b2def:

    # sel "That we do… I mentioned it earlier, but I want to apologize for summoning you here. It was selfish to bring you into an unwanted existence like that, but I hope you can see how it was necessary."
    sel "确实如此……虽然我之前提过这么做的原因，但还是要特地为召唤你前来而致歉。将你卷入这般不情愿的存在实属自私，但希望你能理解此举的必要性。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4620
translate chinese finaleparty_30de8a53:

    # mc "Don’t worry, I’ll never blame you for that, just like I didn’t blame [mox]."
    mc "别担心，我永远不会因此责怪你，就像我从未责怪过[mox]一样。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4621
translate chinese finaleparty_fdc3c1ee:

    # mc "But I must insist on it never happening again. Even if I’d personally never know, it’d be a great relief to know if there was some way to prevent me from being summoned into another universe."
    mc "但我坚持要求此事绝不再发生。我希望能找到一条能阻止我被传送到其它宇宙的方法，我本人不必知晓这种方法。这样便能让我如释重负。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4623
translate chinese finaleparty_f1abb9a9:

    # sel "And that’s exactly what I wanted to talk to you about. I want to make sure that it’s impossible for you to be copied to anymore universes."
    sel "这正是我想和你谈谈的事。我要确保你再也无法被复制到其他宇宙中。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4625
translate chinese finaleparty_585e2440:

    # sel "But there’s a problem. I want to tether you, but you’re like a loose thread. You’re not originally from this universe, you don’t have an ‘official’ place here and because of that I’m unable to tether you."
    sel "但有个问题。我想将你系住，但却根本系不住。你本不属于这个宇宙，在这里没有“正式”的归属，正因如此，我无法将你系住。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4627
translate chinese finaleparty_a8e87cb8:

    # sel "In a metaphorical sense, you’re currently not 100%% compatible with this universe. Here, you're still an anomaly. Any more interuniversal magic may have unintended effects."
    sel "通俗来说，你目前与这个宇宙的契合度尚未达到百分百。在此处，你依然是个异常的存在。任何额外的跨宇宙魔法都可能引发意想不到的后果。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4628
translate chinese finaleparty_a892d00b:

    # mc "I think I understand. Is there anything I can do to change that?"
    mc "我大概明白了。我能做些什么来改变这种情况吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4630
translate chinese finaleparty_e011cd5f:

    # sel "I believe that you may be able to earn your place in this universe by copying the actions you took in the previous."
    sel "我相信，通过复制你在前世所采取的行动，你或许能够在这个宇宙中获得属于自己的位置。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4631
translate chinese finaleparty_af001754:

    # sel "Only once you’ve reached a certain level of parity with your previous universe’s counterpart, you will no longer be an outsider, and I'll be able to tether you to this reality."
    sel "唯有当你与前世宇宙的对应者达到某种程度的平衡时，你才不再是局外者，我才能将你锚定于这个现实。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4632
translate chinese finaleparty_33830945:

    # mc "Uuuhhhhh… I just have to copy my actions? At what level?"
    mc "呃……所以我只需要复制我的行为就行？什么层面上的行为？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4634
translate chinese finaleparty_e8cea01f:

    # sel "At the boundary level. You need to align your current standing in this universe with that of your previous."
    sel "边界层面。你需要将你当前在这个宇宙中的地位与你之前的地位保持一致。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4635
translate chinese finaleparty_e931336c:

    # sel "In even simpler terms, you may be able to reach parity by building the same relationships with the same people."
    sel "更简单地说，你或许能通过与相同的马建立相同的关系来实现与上个宇宙的地位平等。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4636
translate chinese finaleparty_70eba8d7:

    # mc "Ooohhh, I get it! That shouldn't be... too... hard..."
    mc "哦~，我懂了！这应该不会……太……难……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4637
translate chinese finaleparty_8adee60c:

    # "Oh god, does this mean that I need to have sex with both [sel] and [aur]? Does she know?"
    "我日，这不就意味着我必须和[sel]以及[aur]都发生性关系吗？她知道吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4639
translate chinese finaleparty_274394bc:

    # sel "I’m not sure who’s left, but I can also offer any assistance you may need to reach parity."
    sel "我不确定你还剩下谁没建立这种关系，但我会尽我所能的帮助你实现这一目标。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4640
translate chinese finaleparty_4adee94b:

    # "She doesn’t know!"
    "她 不 知 道 ！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4642
translate chinese finaleparty_4c86d55d:

    # sel "But there is another matter, which I hoped you might find comfort in. I’m working on a way to create a mirror to your original universe."
    sel "还有一件事，我希望它能给你带来些许慰藉。我正在尝试创造一面穿越回你原始宇宙的镜子。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4643
translate chinese finaleparty_c355a526:

    # mc "Wait… you mean—"
    mc "等一下.....你的意思是—"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4645
translate chinese finaleparty_6460c6ff:

    # sel "It will take time. My powers are not what they once were, and even with my sister by my side, creating a mirror universe is a delicate process. But you have my word: I’ll do my best to let you return home."
    sel "但这需要时间。我的力量已不如从前，即便有姐姐相助，制造穿越镜仍是极其精细且漫长的过程。但我向你保证：我会竭尽全力让你回家。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4646
translate chinese finaleparty_1b6323d5:

    # "I almost couldn't believe my ears. A genuine way home without abusing [cre]'s nexus?"
    "我简直不敢相信自己的耳朵。居然有种不使用[cre]的能力就能回家的方法？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4647
translate chinese finaleparty_e394ca97:

    # mc "Thank you, [sel]. Truly. Just… thank you."
    mc "谢谢你，[sel]。真的。就....谢谢你。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4649
translate chinese finaleparty_0324864f:

    # sel "You’ve earned it, many times over. Now, enjoy tonight. You and your friends have given this Arcadia — and beyond — a second chance."
    sel "你值得拥有这一切，数倍也不为过。现在，尽情享受这个夜晚吧。你和你的朋友们为Arcadia——乃至更广阔的世界——赢得了第二次机会。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4652
translate chinese finaleparty_66e645ab:

    # "So much has happened in such a short amount of time... I almost forgot about the mirrors. I didn't even get a chance to ask [aur] about them."
    "这么短的时间里发生了太多事……我差点忘了那面镜子。甚至都没机会问[aur]关于它们的事。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4653
translate chinese finaleparty_6e37d84c:

    # "But now, I realized that without [sel], those mirrors wouldn’t even exist. Only she and [mox] possessed the magic to create a bridge between worlds."
    "但此刻我才明白，若没有[sel]，那面镜子根本不存在。唯有她与[mox]掌握着在世界之间架设桥梁的魔法。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4655
translate chinese finaleparty_9648c23a:

    # "I went to return to the main hall, but I almost bumped into [aur] who was just leaving at the same time."
    "我正要返回主厅，却险些撞到同时离开的[aur]。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4656
translate chinese finaleparty_23c663de:

    # mc "Apologies, your Majesty!"
    mc "抱歉，陛下！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4658
translate chinese finaleparty_7640534e:

    # aur "Oh, no, no… That was my fault, I wasn’t looking forward…"
    aur "哦，不，不……这是我的错，是我没好好看路……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4659
translate chinese finaleparty_7e92da77:

    # "Some awkwardness hung in the air as we stared at each other. There’re definitely things to be said between us, but where do you even begin?"
    "空气中弥漫着些许尴尬，我们凝视着彼此，我们之间确实有话要说，但究竟该从何说起呢？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4661
translate chinese finaleparty_08d704b2:

    # aur "We really ought to sit down sometime and have a discussion."
    aur "我们真的该找个时间坐下来好好谈谈了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4662
translate chinese finaleparty_6560b6ba:

    # mc "Yeah… But this isn’t the best time for that. Wouldn’t want to spoil the party."
    mc "嗯……但现在不是谈这个的好时机。别扫了大家的兴啊。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4664
translate chinese finaleparty_58009b90:

    # aur "Agreed, I could apologize in earnest now, but I’d much rather engage in such a discussion one-on-one under better circumstances."
    aur "我同意，此刻我本可以真诚的向你致歉，但我更希望在更加合适的场合下与你单独讨论这件事"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4666
translate chinese finaleparty_9bd7439d:

    # aur "For now, let’s just celebrate as comrades and forget the bad blood."
    aur "眼下，让我们以战友之姿欢庆，忘却过往的恩怨。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4667
translate chinese finaleparty_c4d9beed:

    # aur "[mc], you will be allowed to wander these halls as you see fit. The guards will not stop you. You may even walk into the throne room, but do expect screams if you enter the female bathrooms."
    aur "[mc]，你将被允许随心所欲地在这座宫殿里行走。守卫不会阻拦你。你甚至可以走进王座厅，但若踏入女洗手间，可别惊讶于听到的尖叫声哟~。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4669
translate chinese finaleparty_05d0f2d6:

    # aur "When you feel like you are ready, come and see me, and we can have that discussion."
    aur "当你觉得准备好了，就来找我，我们可以好好谈谈。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4670
translate chinese finaleparty_91cb65ee:

    # mc "It seems like you went from not trusting me enough to almost trusting me too much, doesn’t it?"
    mc "你似乎是从不太信任我，变成了几乎太信任我，对吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4672
translate chinese finaleparty_ade7c0c1:

    # aur "[mc], my dear… I think you may have saved the world. You’re lucky I’m not making you run this country in my stead."
    aur "[mc]，亲爱的……我想你可能拯救了世界。你也很幸运，在你有如此成就下我也没让位与你。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4673
translate chinese finaleparty_5b765ba0:

    # mc "Lucky, eh?"
    mc "幸运，嗯？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4675
translate chinese finaleparty_1d5feb1a:

    # aur "*{i}Eh-hem{/i}* I hope you enjoy the party, [mc]. You will always be welcome in my castle."
    aur "{i}咳咳{/i}* 希望你玩得尽兴，[mc]。我的城堡永远欢迎你。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4676
translate chinese finaleparty_59e97b86:

    # mc "Thank you, your Majesty."
    mc "谢谢您，陛下。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4679
translate chinese finaleparty_ffa74087:

    # "As I wandered back into the main hall, I let these thoughts settle, finding a comfortable spot in the lively crowd. The celebration continued around me, a much needed release for everyone here."
    "当我踱步回到主厅时，任这些思绪沉淀，在熙攘的人群中寻得一处安身之处。庆典仍在四周持续，对在场每一位而言，这都是必要的宣泄。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4681
translate chinese finaleparty_62a9461f:

    # "The hours passed, with plenty of stories and smiles until the night stretched on, and gradually, the crowd began to thin."
    "时间流逝，故事与欢笑不断，直至夜色渐深，与会者渐渐散去。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4683
translate chinese finaleparty_de78c8be:

    # "[mox] caught my eye from across the room, giving me that familiar, warm smile. With a nod, we slipped away from the party together and retired to a lodging in the castle."
    "[mox]吸引了我的目光，朝我露出那熟悉而温暖的笑容。我们相视点头，便悄然离开宴会，踏入了城堡内的居所。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4686
translate chinese finaleparty_55096248:

    # "She rested her head on my shoulder as we closed the door behind us. No words were needed; all we wanted now was to be close."
    "她把头靠在我的肩上，我们关上了身后的门。无需言语；此刻我们只想与彼此相依。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4688
translate chinese finaleparty_c4fdd079:

    # "As we lay together, her fingers traced familiar patterns on my skin, a comfortable rhythm of touches that felt like home. These are the exact same patterns the {i}other [mox]{/i} would do."
    "我们相拥而卧，她的手指在我的肌肤上描绘着熟悉的纹路，舒适的节奏宛如归家般的温暖。这些纹路，与{i}另一个[mox]{/i}手法一致。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4691
translate chinese finaleparty_16b5827d:

    # "Why am I thinking about her right now?"
    "为什么此刻我想的是她？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4692
translate chinese finaleparty_e6ec86ac:

    # "I can’t exactly say I miss her. She’s right in front of me after all."
    "我倒不能说想她。毕竟她就在我眼前。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4694
translate chinese finaleparty_5e82b3bf:

    # mox "Is something wrong?"
    mox "怎么了吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4695
translate chinese finaleparty_a95a19ff:

    # mc "Can you really read my face that well?"
    mc "你真能看透我的心思吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4697
translate chinese finaleparty_64949039:

    # mox "Hehe, well, you do look a little grumpy right now!"
    mox "嘿嘿~这个嘛，你现在看起来确实有点不高兴呢！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4698
translate chinese finaleparty_4a77c35b:

    # mc "It’s just… I spoke to [sel], she can open a portal back to my universe. I’ve almost done it, I can almost return ‘home.'"
    mc "只是……我跟[sel]谈过了，她能打开通往我所在宇宙的传送门。我快成功了，几乎就能回到‘家’了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4700
translate chinese finaleparty_aa9be089:

    # mox "Ahh… I see..."
    mox "啊......这样啊...."

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4701
translate chinese finaleparty_2e4f987f:

    # mox "If you decide to leave… I won’t stop you. It may hurt, but I won’t try to keep you here against your will."
    mox "若你决定离开……我不会阻拦。纵然心痛，我也不会违背你的意愿强留你。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4702
translate chinese finaleparty_cb711f44:

    # mc "I don’t know."
    mc "我还没决定好。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4704
translate chinese finaleparty_f7d7e321:

    # "A silence stretched between us, only broken by the quiet sounds of the city outside."
    "寂静在我们之间蔓延，唯有窗外低沉的声响偶尔会打破这份宁静。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4707
translate chinese finaleparty_ff6a50a3:

    # "I looked at her, the way her eyes flickered with a hint of vulnerability that she tried to mask with a light smile."
    "我望着她，她眼中闪过一丝伤感，却试图用浅浅的微笑掩饰。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4708
translate chinese finaleparty_c58acae5:

    # "Her hand drifted to mine, her fingers slipping between mine like they belonged there."
    "她的手缓缓的移向了我的掌心，十指相交。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4709
translate chinese finaleparty_4961cce1:

    # mc "When I first got here, I was desperate to get back. I wanted to go back to a life that made sense, and I couldn’t shake the feeling that ‘home’ was slipping further away."
    mc "刚来到这个宇宙时，我迫切想回到原来的那个宇宙。渴望回归那个熟悉的，平常的生活，却始终摆脱不了“家”正渐行渐远的恐惧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4710
translate chinese finaleparty_0dd07003:

    # mc "But somewhere along the way…"
    mc "但在某个时候……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4711
translate chinese finaleparty_1f6eb65d:

    # mc "Somewhere along the way, I stopped looking over my shoulder. Stopped wondering if I’d wake up back where I started. The people here… all of you… it’s like I found a second home."
    mc "不知从何时起，我不再回忆过去。不再担心醒来时会回到原点。这里的大家……让我感到……就像找到了第二个家一样。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4713
translate chinese finaleparty_84c89c2c:

    # mox "And yet, you feel torn…"
    mox "然而，你却感到心力交瘁……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4714
translate chinese finaleparty_1e6ea9bc:

    # mc "[mox], this whole time, you've been my anchor here. Without you, I… I don’t know if I could’ve gotten this far. You’ve become… everything. More than I could ever put into words."
    mc "[mox]，这些年来，你始终是我在这片土地上的锚点。没有你，我……我不知道自己能否走到今天。你已成为……我的全部。这份情谊，远非言语所能承载。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4716
translate chinese finaleparty_94ba56a1:

    # mox "Then why are you still thinking about leaving?"
    mox "那你为什么还在考虑离开？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4717
translate chinese finaleparty_1ba381fe:

    # "The question hit me harder than I’d expected, cutting straight to the core of my uncertainty."
    "这个问题比我预想的还要沉重，直刺我内心深处的不安。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4718
translate chinese finaleparty_1af300b7:

    # mc "Because I was looking for something that I already found."
