    # mc "Well, uh… any ideas how I can sleep with the Queen and Princess?"
    mc "呃……有没有什么办法能让我和女王还有公主发生性关系？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4864
translate chinese c1m2_551f4d27:

    # mox "Bwahaha, seducing the Queen and Princess? That's a tall order, even for you!"
    mox "噗哈哈~，想勾引女王和公主？这可太难啦，就算对你来说也是个很大的挑战！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4866
translate chinese c1m2_e6ac736e:

    # mox "But I wager you’ve done this before too?"
    mox "但我敢打赌你以前也这么干过吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4867
translate chinese c1m2_0c6fec3e:

    # mc "That’s true. The circumstances couldn’t be any more different though. The Queen and I have a frosty relationship due to the whole ‘courtroom’ situation."
    mc "确实如此。不过情况截然不同。由于“法庭”事件的影响，我和女王的关系一直很尴尬。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4868
translate chinese c1m2_a752bf7a:

    # mc "Then [sel] has just gotten back to society and has so much catching up to do."
    mc "然后[sel]刚刚重返社会，有太多事情需要学习。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4869
translate chinese c1m2_b8e3a4cf:

    # mc "And I seriously doubt they’ll sleep with me as mere favors because I ‘need it’."
    mc "而且我严重怀疑她们愿意和我上床的原因仅仅是因为‘我需要这么做’罢了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4871
translate chinese c1m2_5efb102e:

    # mox "But at the same time, you can use both of those factors to your advantage."
    mox "但与此同时，你也可以将这两个因素都转化为自己的优势。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4872
translate chinese c1m2_822aa5c3:

    # mc "How so?"
    mc "怎么说？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4874
translate chinese c1m2_2097fac7:

    # mox "[aur] surely feels bad for how she treated you and will be willing to rekindle that relationship. Not to mention that she’s elated at your success. You have a couple of opportunities to make a move on her."
    mox "[aur]肯定为当初对你的态度感到愧疚，愿意重修旧好。更何况她对你的成功而感到开心。你现在完全有机会可以追她。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4875
translate chinese c1m2_044b840d:

    # mox "And [sel] is new to this society, and technically, you're also relatively new. She’ll be looking for new friends, connections, and there’s a lot in common that you can bond over."
    mox "而[sel]刚刚回归，从每种意义上来说，你和她情况差不多。她也想交点新朋友、拓展马脉，你们有很多共同点，很适合当朋友。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4876
translate chinese c1m2_0b61d858:

    # mc "Huh, you really are a social genius. I’ll get to work straight away!"
    mc "咦，你真是社交天才啊。我马上就动手！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4878
translate chinese c1m2_c882bc49:

    # mox "Yeah! You go get that royal sister pussy!"
    mox "就是这样！去把皇家姐妹都变成你的后宫吧！"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4887
translate chinese c1m2_886c1b09:

    # "(You received a $[gen1] reward for saving the city! This amount scales with the amount of good deeds you did across your playthrough)"
    "（您因拯救城市获得了$[gen1]奖励！该金额将根据您在整个游戏过程中所做过的善举数量进行浮动调整）"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4899
translate chinese castle2_aef9c8f6:

    # "This evening, I found myself pacing in the castle courtyard."
    "今夜，我独自踱步于城堡庭院之中。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4900
translate chinese castle2_bf7b3371:

    # "After everything – Midnight, the Virtues, the nightmares, the multiverse madness – I had one more loose end to tie up."
    "经历了一切——梦魇、谐律、梦魇、多元宇宙的疯狂——我还有最后一件悬而未决的事要处理。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4901
translate chinese castle2_3d68d856:

    # "One glaring, regal loose end: The royal sisters."
    "一个显而易见、高贵而悬而未决的问题：皇家姐妹。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4902
translate chinese castle2_7ff3cc01:

    # "And right now? Queen [aur]."
    "而此刻？我正在想着[aur]女王。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4903
translate chinese castle2_9d523481:

    # "It wasn’t just that we hadn’t spoken properly since the battle; it was the fact that every interaction we’d had before that was… complicated."
    "不仅是因为自那场战斗后我们再未好好交谈过；更在于此前我与她的每一次互动都……错综复杂。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4904
translate chinese castle2_e0f29b01:

    # "The whole ‘put me on trial and arresting me’ thing."
    "而且还有“法庭事件”。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4905
translate chinese castle2_3bbae140:

    # "Sure, she’d said she was proud of me — who wouldn’t be, after saving the world? But that alone doesn’t wash away the bad blood."
    "当然，她说过为我感到骄傲——毕竟我拯救了世界，谁不该为之骄傲？但仅凭这点，并不能消除积怨。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4908
translate chinese castle2_aeaea64f:

    # "Still, I had a plan. Sort of. Maybe."
    "不过，我还是有个计划。算是个计划吧....大概算。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4910
translate chinese castle2_eecd41e9:

    # "The guards gave me knowing nods as I approached the grand throne room. I wasn’t the troublemaker they were side eyeing with suspicion; I could quite effortlessly walk wherever I wanted now."
    "当我走向宏伟的王座厅时，卫兵们向我投来心照不宣的点头示意。我现在已并非他们斜眼怀疑的那个嫌疑人；此刻我已能随心所欲地行走于任何地方。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4912
translate chinese castle2_5426f2f9:

    # "Inside, [aur] was perched on her throne, posture elegant as ever. She wasn’t even wearing her crown at this hour, which somehow made her seem even more intimidating."
    "殿内，[aur]端坐于王座之上，姿态依旧优雅。此刻她甚至未戴王冠，这般模样反而更显威严。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4914
translate chinese castle2_9a1296d3:

    # "As I stepped closer, she looked up from some parchments, her lips curling into a small smile."
    "当我走近时，她从几卷文件上抬起头来，嘴角微微扬起一抹微笑。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4915
translate chinese castle2_c793f9ca:

    # aur "[mc]. To what do I owe this unexpected visit?"
    aur "[mc]. 承蒙何见，为何您今夜要来拜访我？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4916
translate chinese castle2_6159519d:

    # mc "I thought we could… talk. Without any bad vibes this time."
    mc "我想我们可以……谈谈。也是时候该好好谈谈了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4918
translate chinese castle2_23b9bcc9:

    # "Her smile faltered, and there was a flicker of something else — regret, perhaps?"
    "她的笑容僵住了，眼底掠过一抹异样——或许是懊悔？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4919
translate chinese castle2_78189dbf:

    # aur "I suppose we’re overdue with that."
    aur "我想我们早就该这么做了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4921
translate chinese castle2_02e12932:

    # "With some quick telekinesis, she made a nearby chair float over, and I took a seat across from her."
    "她用魔法将附近一把椅子搬了过来，放在了她的对面，我便坐了下来。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4922
translate chinese castle2_ff9c5c46:

    # "For a few moments, neither of us spoke. The silence wasn’t uncomfortable exactly, but it wasn’t easy either."
    "片刻间，我们谁都没说话。这沉默倒不算难堪，但也不算轻松。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4924
translate chinese castle2_6b94186c:

    # aur "I…. owe you an apology."
    aur "我……欠你一个道歉。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4926
translate chinese castle2_05180b80:

    # aur "For how I treated you when you first arrived. I… I misjudged you."
    aur "你初到这个世界时，我的态度并不好。我……我误判了你的意图。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4927
translate chinese castle2_f2353a48:

    # mc "Well, you did throw me in prison."
    mc "嗯，然后你把我关进了监狱。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4929
translate chinese castle2_5cd8dc5f:

    # aur "Yes, I did. And in hindsight, it was a… less-than-stellar decision."
    aur "是的，我确实这么做了。事后看来，这真是个……不太明智的决定。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4931
translate chinese castle2_ac88a27b:

    # aur "You’ve proven me wrong in so many ways, [mc]. You brought people together when I thought it impossible. You faced Midnight when I could not. You…"
    aur "你以无数种方式证明了我错了，[mc]。当我以为不可能时，你把大家团结在了一起；当我无力直面梦魇之月时，你挺身而出。你……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4933
translate chinese castle2_60b762f7:

    # aur "You gave my country hope again."
    aur "你让我的国家重燃希望。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4934
translate chinese castle2_36e5dd32:

    # "I felt a lump rise in my throat, but I pushed it down, opting for humor instead. I had to remember my goal and keep things light."
    "喉咙里涌起一股哽咽，但我强忍住，转而用幽默化解。我必须牢记目标，保持轻松氛围。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4935
translate chinese castle2_6a1cd5dd:

    # mc "Not bad for a guy you almost banished, huh?"
    mc "对于一个差点被你放逐的罪犯来说，表现还不错吧？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4937
translate chinese castle2_20040c53:

    # aur "Not bad at all."
    aur "嗯，确实不错。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4938
translate chinese castle2_63e45243:

    # "And she in turn replied with a lighter tone."
    "她则以更轻快的语气回应道。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4940
translate chinese castle2_ddb4c9b1:

    # mc "Well… How about we call it even?"
    mc "嗯……咱们就算扯平了？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4941
translate chinese castle2_b33b1d96:

    # aur "Even?"
    aur "算吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4943
translate chinese castle2_49bbd56a:

    # "She raised an eyebrow, though her lips twitched into a small smirk. I wasn’t entirely sure if she was amused or teasing — or both."
    "她挑了挑眉，嘴角微微扬起一抹笑意。我实在不确定她是觉得有趣还是在调侃——或许两者兼而有之。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4945
translate chinese castle2_734fbfd3:

    # aur "Dear… I arrested you, and you saved the country. These are not things that can merely be called ‘even’."
    aur "亲爱的……我逮捕了你，而你拯救了我的国家。这些事，岂能简单地说是“扯平”？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4946
translate chinese castle2_bb8b7306:

    # aur "In this conversation, you have all the power. I should be bowing down to you and be begging for your forgiveness."
    aur "在这场对话中，你掌握着全部主动权。我本该向你低头，恳求你的宽恕。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4948
translate chinese castle2_5e8d7367:

    # aur "I owe you far more than an apology. I’m half tempted to grant you a ‘wish’. Anything you desire."
    aur "我欠你的远不止一句道歉。你想要我做什么都行，毕竟这是我欠你的。请您许愿吧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4949
translate chinese castle2_29d5d840:

    # "A wish! I received one of these in the other universe. But… there’s absolutely no way I could ask for… sex? That’s just not my style."
    "一个愿望！我在另一个宇宙收到过这样的东西。但是……我绝对不可能许愿和她做爱……对吧？那根本不是我的风格。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4951
translate chinese castle2_2615f4d6:

    # aur "You remind me of things I thought I had long buried — of vulnerabilities I believed I’d outgrown. Watching you rally the Virtues, unite people in a way I haven’t managed in years… it made me question my place, my worth."
    aur "你唤醒了我以为早已深埋心底的记忆——我的脆弱。看着你团结谐律之元，以我多年未能企及的方式团结了民心……这让我开始质疑自己的位置，质疑自己的价值。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4952
translate chinese castle2_61814620:

    # mc "[aur], without you, Midnight would have stopped us before we had begun. Let alone handle the city afterwards. Everything we’ve done is built on what you’ve created."
    mc "[aur]，若没有你，梦魇之月早在我们行动前就已阻止我们。更别说保护整座城市了。我们的成功，都建立在你创造的基石之上。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4954
translate chinese castle2_ca818636:

    # "She tilted her head, studying me, her expression softening further."
    "她歪着头打量我，神情愈发柔和。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4956
translate chinese castle2_898003ba:

    # aur "You always know what to say, don’t you? No wonder they all follow you."
    aur "你总是知道该说什么，对吧？难怪大家都追随你。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4958
translate chinese castle2_6e72e247:

    # aur "We can have pleasant chats and posture forgiveness in my cushy throne room, but there are many that know me as an authoritarian Queen."
    aur "我们可以在我舒适的王座厅里愉快交谈，假装宽怨彼此，但许多马都知道我是位专制女王。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4959
translate chinese castle2_f0156f4a:

    # aur "Some will overlook it due to the circumstances, and in hindsight my strict actions may be celebrated."
    aur "有马会因当时的整个国家的处境而视而不见，不过事后看来，我的举措或许会受到称赞。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4961
translate chinese castle2_ac15a0d5:

    # aur "But I don’t know how I’ll be able to become the ruler this city deserves again. The years have been too stressful."
    aur "但我不知该如何重拾这份担当，成为这座城市值得拥有的领导者。这些年来的压力实在太大了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4962
translate chinese castle2_f212ada3:

    # "For all her centuries of experience, the Queen standing before me was someone grappling with her own doubts and failures like anyone else."
    "尽管她拥有数个世纪的阅历，此刻，我面前的女王，如同常人般反省着自己的过去。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4963
translate chinese castle2_f102d35e:

    # mc "You know, you’re probably the only person in this city who could say they aren’t the ruler it deserves — and actually mean it. Most people in power wouldn’t even consider questioning themselves. That alone puts you miles ahead."
    mc "你知道吗，在这座城市里，恐怕只有你能说自己配不上领导这个国家了——不开玩笑。大多数领导者连自我反省都做不到。仅凭这一点，你就是一个合格的领导者了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4965
translate chinese castle2_4d1b33ac:

    # aur "Self-doubt does not inspire loyalty, [mc]. Strength does. Certainty does."
    aur "但自我反省是无法获得忠诚的，[mc]。唯有力量能，毫无疑问。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4966
translate chinese castle2_e1962abe:

    # mc "Maybe, but strength isn’t just about standing tall and looking invincible. It’s about knowing when to admit you’ve made mistakes. About letting people see you’re a person, too."
    mc "也许吧，但力量的含义不仅在于昂首挺胸、威风凛凛。更在于懂得何时承认错误，让人们看到你也是普通马。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4968
translate chinese castle2_dd07fbed:

    # "Her lips pressed into a thin line, her gaze falling briefly to the lunar parchments that have been recently hung around the room."
    "她的双唇抿成一条细线，目光短暂地落在了附近的文件上。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4969
translate chinese castle2_87979e23:

    # aur "And you think that’s what I should do? Expose my vulnerabilities to a city already divided and scarred?"
    aur "你觉得我该这么做吗，向这座早已分裂伤痕累累的城市暴露我的脆弱？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4970
translate chinese castle2_14c624f5:

    # mc "I think your people already know you’re not perfect. They don’t need perfection. They need someone who cares enough to try. Someone who’s willing to shoulder the blame, even when it’s not fair. And you’ve done that. You’ve been doing that."
    mc "我想你的子民早已明白你并非完美。他们不需要完美的领导者，他们需要的是一个愿意付出，努力去关心自己子民的领导者，一个即使委屈在身也甘愿承担责任的领导者。而你做到了，你一直都在这样做。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4972
translate chinese castle2_43c8e3d9:

    # aur "You make it sound so simple."
    aur "你说的倒轻巧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4973
translate chinese castle2_dc799463:

    # mc "It’s not. But you don’t have to do it alone. You’ve got people now — people who believe in you, who’ve seen what you’re capable of. That includes me, by the way."
    mc "确实不容易。但你不必独自面对这种情况，现在你身边有着很多坚定的支持者——那些相信你，见过你能力的人。顺便说一句，我也是其中之一。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4974
translate chinese castle2_cd9aac44:

    # mc "You don’t need to expose your vulnerabilities to everyone. But you should absolutely have people at your back to confide in when the going gets tough."
    mc "你不必向所有平民暴露自己的脆弱。但当困境来临时，你绝对需要有值得信赖的朋友在你身后支持你。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4976
translate chinese castle2_132b648b:

    # aur "You’re quite persistent, aren’t you?"
    aur "你真是执着啊，不是吗？"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4977
translate chinese castle2_98af8010:

    # mc "Only when it matters."
    mc "只有在重要时刻，我才会如此。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4978
translate chinese castle2_c8301898:

    # mc "You’ve got a wall around you that rivals the city’s defenses."
    mc "你在你的心中筑起了一道墙，其坚固程度堪比城市的防御工事。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4979
translate chinese castle2_09029418:

    # mc "I admire that too, but maybe… maybe it’s time to let someone through."
    mc "我不反对这一点，但也许……是时候拆掉它了。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4981
translate chinese castle2_53bf382e:

    # aur "I underestimated you, [mc], in more ways than one."
    aur "我低估了你，[mc]，很多方面都低估了你。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4983
translate chinese castle2_409a5ca2:

    # aur "You know, when you first arrived here, I saw you as a threat to our very society. But now…"
    aur "你知道吗，你刚来这里时，我视你为我们整个社会的威胁。但现在……"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4985
translate chinese castle2_72f62cf7:

    # aur "I see someone who might just be the bridge between what I was and what I want to become. Someone who challenges me to rethink everything I thought I knew about leadership, about strength… and about myself."
    aur "我遇见了一个人，他或许正是连接着我的过去与现实的桥梁。这个人不断挑战着我，迫使我重新审视自己对领导力、力量……乃至对自身的认知。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4986
translate chinese castle2_edffa32a:

    # mc "That’s… a lot to put on one person."
    mc "这……不敢当。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4988
translate chinese castle2_e76f5692:

    # aur "Perhaps. But you’ve proven yourself capable of handling a lot more than I ever expected."
    aur "或许吧。但你已经证明了你能够胜任那些远超我预期的任务。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4990
translate chinese castle2_a01e6627:

    # aur "Perhaps you’ve proven yourself capable of handling me."
    aur "或许你已经证明自己有能力应对我。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4993
translate chinese castle2_624a61e6:

    # "She stood up and took another step closer, her presence commanding but no longer intimidating."
    "她站起身又迈近一步，气场依旧强大却不再令人畏惧。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4995
translate chinese castle2_232cc68a:

    # aur "Tell me, [mc]. What is it you truly want? Not for the city, not for the Virtues — for yourself."
    aur "告诉我，[mc]。你真正想要的是什么？不是为了这座城市，不是为了谐律之元们——而是为了你自己。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4996
translate chinese castle2_3cf94825:

    # "I know what I want. Just a place to belong. To have a purpose, to make a difference, and to be with people who make me feel like I matter."
    "我知道自己想要什么，我想要一个归属之地。我会拥有目标，我能创造价值，与我那些重要的朋友们相伴。"

# game/5 - Castle Route.rpy:4997
translate chinese castle2_33fb003a:

    # "And yet… I also know why I’m really here."
